445>>>>>>>>>>>//      Enumerate keys (one level) for a given tag under HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE
445>>>>>>>>>>>//
445>>>>>>>>>>>//      The function, EnumRegistryKey, takes a Tag (eg SOFTWARE\DFWIN40) and
445>>>>>>>>>>>//      'returns' all sub-keys. This is achieved by passing the function a
445>>>>>>>>>>>//      call-back procedure-id. The call-back will take one parameter, a string,
445>>>>>>>>>>>//      that is the name of the sub-key.
445>>>>>>>>>>>//
445>>>>>>>>>>>//      The return value is the number of sub-keys enumerated.
445>>>>>>>>>>>
445>>>>>>>>>>>
