702>>>>>>>>>>>Define clAppWorkSpace        for (|CI$8000000C)
702>>>>>>>>>>>Define clHighlight           for (|CI$8000000D)
702>>>>>>>>>>>Define clHighlightText       for (|CI$8000000E)
702>>>>>>>>>>>Define clBtnFace             for (|CI$8000000F)
702>>>>>>>>>>>Define clBtnShadow           for (|CI$80000010)
702>>>>>>>>>>>Define clGrayText            for (|CI$80000011)
