738>>>>>>>>>>>    Else ;        Move sTitle        to sCaption
740>>>>>>>>>>>    Move (Message_Box(sMessage, sCaption, MB_OK, MB_ICONINFORMATION)) to rval
741>>>>>>>>>>>End_Procedure
