1003>>>>>>>>>//
1003>>>>>>>>>// Splits a string into an array of strings using the given delimiter.
1003>>>>>>>>>//
1003>>>>>>>>>// Params:
1003>>>>>>>>>//     sString     The string to split.
1003>>>>>>>>>//     sDel        The delimiter (like "," or "|")
1003>>>>>>>>>// Returns:
1003>>>>>>>>>//     Array of strings (not including the delimiters itself.
1003>>>>>>>>>Function StrSplitToArray Global String sString String sDel Returns String[]
1005>>>>>>>>>    String[] asResult
1006>>>>>>>>>    Integer iStart iEnd iDel
1006>>>>>>>>>    
1006>>>>>>>>>    If (sString <> "") Begin
1008>>>>>>>>>        
1008>>>>>>>>>        Move 1 to iStart
1009>>>>>>>>>        
1009>>>>>>>>>        Move (Length(sDel)) to iDel
1010>>>>>>>>>        Move (Pos(sDel, sString, iStart)) to iEnd
1011>>>>>>>>>        
1011>>>>>>>>>        If (iEnd > 0) Begin
1013>>>>>>>>>            While (iEnd > 0)
1017>>>>>>>>>                Move (Mid(sString,  iEnd - iStart, iStart)) to asResult[SizeOfArray(asResult)]
1018>>>>>>>>>                
1018>>>>>>>>>                Move (iEnd + iDel) to iStart
1019>>>>>>>>>                Move (Pos(sDel, sString, iStart)) to iEnd
1020>>>>>>>>>            Loop
1021>>>>>>>>>>
1021>>>>>>>>>            
1021>>>>>>>>>            Move (Right(sString,  Length(sString) - iStart + 1)) to asResult[SizeOfArray(asResult)]
1022>>>>>>>>>        End
1022>>>>>>>>>>
1022>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
1023>>>>>>>>>            Move sString to asResult[0]
1024>>>>>>>>>        End
1024>>>>>>>>>>
1024>>>>>>>>>    End
1024>>>>>>>>>>
1024>>>>>>>>>    
1024>>>>>>>>>    
1024>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return asResult
1025>>>>>>>>>End_Function
