1109>>>>>>>>>//  Decodes the passed value using the URI encoding scheme.
1109>>>>>>>>>Function UrlDecode Global String sValue Returns String
1111>>>>>>>>>    Integer iVoid
1111>>>>>>>>>    WString wValue
1111>>>>>>>>>    
1111>>>>>>>>>    If (Trim(sValue) <> "") Begin
1113>>>>>>>>>        Move (Replaces("%3D", Replaces("%3B", sValue, ";"), "=")) to wValue
1114>>>>>>>>>        Move (UrlUnescapeW(AddressOf(wValue), 0, 0, URL_UNESCAPE_INPLACE)) to iVoid
1115>>>>>>>>>    End
1115>>>>>>>>>>
1115>>>>>>>>>    
1115>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return (CString(wValue))
1116>>>>>>>>>End_Function
