1816>>>>>>>>>Class FileValidationTable is an DescriptionValidationTable
1817>>>>>>>>>    
1817>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
1819>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
1821>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer No_Fill_State     False // this is never used and is obsolete. (JJT)
1822>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Ordering          1   // Indx1 is a good guess.
1823>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Type_Value        ''  // default these two to
1824>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Type_Field        0   // Undefined (none).
1825>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Code_Field        1   // Fld 1=code, 2=descr
1826>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Description_Field 2   // are good guesses.
1827>>>>>>>>>        
1827>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Code_Load_Object  0   // or (Code_Loader(Self))
1828>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1829>>>>>>>>>    
1829>>>>>>>>>    Function Table_Loaded_State Returns Integer
1831>>>>>>>>>        Integer iRVal
1831>>>>>>>>>        Get No_fill_State to iRVal // if true, table always is loaded
1832>>>>>>>>>        If not iRval ;            Forward Get table_loaded_State to iRVal
1836>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iRval
1837>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1838>>>>>>>>>    
1838>>>>>>>>>    Function Validate_Value String sCode Returns Integer
1840>>>>>>>>>        Integer iRVal
1840>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDSO
1840>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Load_Object  to iDSO
1841>>>>>>>>>        // we use standard validate, if code is blank, OR if
1841>>>>>>>>>        //   1. if no code DSO or the code DSO exists but is not busy.
1841>>>>>>>>>        //   2. AND it is not no-fill
1841>>>>>>>>>        //   3. AND it is static
1841>>>>>>>>>        // Else we find the record directly
1841>>>>>>>>>        // Note that the operation mode is busy during request_validate (the
1841>>>>>>>>>        // ddo does this). WHen operation mode is busy we must not use
1841>>>>>>>>>        // the code dso (must find manually).
1841>>>>>>>>>        If (sCode='' or ;            ( (iDSO=0 or Operation_Mode=0)    and ; // if no code DSO or DSO not busy            No_Fill_State(Self)=0 and ;            Static_State(Self) ) ) ;            Forward Get Validate_Value sCode to iRVal
1845>>>>>>>>>        Else If (sCode<>Current_Code(Self)) ;            Get Find_Value sCode to iRVal
1849>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iRVal // OK
1850>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1851>>>>>>>>>    
1851>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Initialize_File
1853>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iCodeField iDescField iDSO iIndex iTypeField
1853>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Load_Object  to iDSO
1854>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File         to iFile
1855>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Field        to iCodeField
1856>>>>>>>>>        Get Description_Field to iDescField
1857>>>>>>>>>        Get Ordering          to iIndex
1858>>>>>>>>>        Get Type_Field        to iTypeField
1859>>>>>>>>>        If (iDSO and Operation_Mode=0) ;            Send Initialize_File to iDSO ;            iFile iIndex iCodeField iDescField ;            iTypeField (Type_Value(Self))
1862>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
1863>>>>>>>>>            Clear iFile
1864>>>>>>>>>            // if Type exists, seed the type value
1864>>>>>>>>>            If iTypeField ;                Set_Field_Value iFile iTypeField to (Type_Value(Self))
1869>>>>>>>>>        End
1869>>>>>>>>>>
1869>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1870>>>>>>>>>    
1870>>>>>>>>>    Function Find_Value String Code Returns Integer
1872>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iCodeField iDescField iDSO iIndex iTypeField
1872>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Load_Object  to iDSO
1873>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File         to iFile
1874>>>>>>>>>        Get Ordering          to iIndex
1875>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Field        to iCodeField
1876>>>>>>>>>        Get Description_Field to iDescField
1877>>>>>>>>>        Get Type_Field        to iTypeField
1878>>>>>>>>>        Send Initialize_File
1879>>>>>>>>>        //
1879>>>>>>>>>        Set_Field_Value iFile iCodeField to Code
1882>>>>>>>>>        If (iDSO and Operation_Mode=0) ;            Send Request_Find to iDSO EQ iFile iIndex
1885>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Vfind iFile iIndex EQ
1888>>>>>>>>>        If not (Found) ;            Function_Return 1
1891>>>>>>>>>        // Set properties Current_code and Current_Description
1891>>>>>>>>>        Send Store_Current_Data iFile iCodeField iDescField
1892>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return 0
1893>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1894>>>>>>>>>    
1894>>>>>>>>>    // internal
1894>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Store_Current_Data Integer iFile Integer iCodeField Integer iDescField
1896>>>>>>>>>        String sVal
1896>>>>>>>>>        Get_Field_Value iFile iCodeField to sVal
1899>>>>>>>>>        Set Current_Code to (trim(sVal))
1900>>>>>>>>>        If iDescField Begin
1902>>>>>>>>>            Get_Field_Value iFile iDescField to sVal
1905>>>>>>>>>            Set Current_Description to (trim(sVal))
1906>>>>>>>>>        End
1906>>>>>>>>>>
1906>>>>>>>>>        Set Current_RowId to (GetRowId(iFile))
1907>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1908>>>>>>>>>    
1908>>>>>>>>>    Function Next_Code_Record Returns Boolean
1910>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iCodeField iDescField iIndex
1910>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTypeField
1910>>>>>>>>>        String sTypeValue sFoundTypeValue
1910>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFound
1910>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDSO
1910>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Load_Object  to hoDSO
1911>>>>>>>>>        Get Description_Field to iDescField
1912>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Field        to iCodeField
1913>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File         to iFile
1914>>>>>>>>>        
1914>>>>>>>>>        If hoDSO Begin
1916>>>>>>>>>            Get Next_Code_record of hoDSO to bFound
1917>>>>>>>>>        End
1917>>>>>>>>>>
1917>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
1918>>>>>>>>>            Get Ordering to iIndex
1919>>>>>>>>>            Vfind iFile iIndex GT
1921>>>>>>>>>            Move (Found) to bFound
1922>>>>>>>>>            If bFound Begin
1924>>>>>>>>>                // if found see if we are at the end of the valid list of types
1924>>>>>>>>>                Get Type_Field to iTypeField
1925>>>>>>>>>                Get Type_Value to sTypeValue
1926>>>>>>>>>                If ((iTypeField<>0) and (sTypeValue<>"")) Begin
1928>>>>>>>>>                    Get_Field_Value iFile iTypeField to sFoundTypeValue
1931>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Trim(sTypeValue)=Trim(sFoundTypeValue)) to bFound
1932>>>>>>>>>                End
1932>>>>>>>>>>
1932>>>>>>>>>            End
1932>>>>>>>>>>
1932>>>>>>>>>        End
1932>>>>>>>>>>
1932>>>>>>>>>        If bFound Begin
1934>>>>>>>>>            Send Store_Current_Data iFile iCodeField iDescField
1935>>>>>>>>>        End
1935>>>>>>>>>>
1935>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bFound
1936>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1937>>>>>>>>>    
1937>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Fill_List
1939>>>>>>>>>        RowID riId
1939>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFound
1939>>>>>>>>>        String sCode sDesc
1939>>>>>>>>>        If (Static_State(Self)=0 or No_Fill_State(Self)) ;            Procedure_Return
1942>>>>>>>>>        //
1942>>>>>>>>>        Send Delete_Data
1943>>>>>>>>>        Send Initialize_File
1944>>>>>>>>>        Get Next_Code_Record to bFound
1945>>>>>>>>>        While bFound
1949>>>>>>>>>            Get Current_Code        to sCode
1950>>>>>>>>>            Get Current_Description to sDesc
1951>>>>>>>>>            Get Current_RowId       to riId
1952>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Table_Value sCode sDesc riId
1953>>>>>>>>>            Get Next_Code_Record to bFound
1954>>>>>>>>>        Loop
1955>>>>>>>>>>
1955>>>>>>>>>        Set Table_Loaded_State to True
1956>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1957>>>>>>>>>    
1957>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Fill_From_List Integer iObj Integer iMsg
1959>>>>>>>>>        Integer iItem
1959>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile
1959>>>>>>>>>        RowID   riId
1959>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFound
1959>>>>>>>>>        String sCode sDesc
1959>>>>>>>>>        
1959>>>>>>>>>        If (iObj=0 or iMsg=0) ;            Procedure_Return
1962>>>>>>>>>        
1962>>>>>>>>>        If (Static_State(Self) and No_Fill_State(Self)=0 ) ;            Forward Send Request_Fill_From_List iObj iMsg
1966>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
1967>>>>>>>>>            Get Main_File to iFile
1968>>>>>>>>>            Send Initialize_File
1969>>>>>>>>>            Get Next_Code_Record to bFound
1970>>>>>>>>>            While bFound
1974>>>>>>>>>                Get Current_Code        to sCode
1975>>>>>>>>>                Get Current_Description to sDesc
1976>>>>>>>>>                Get Current_RowId       to riId
1977>>>>>>>>>                Send iMSG to iObj iItem sCode sDesc iFile riId
1978>>>>>>>>>                Increment iItem
1979>>>>>>>>>                Get Next_Code_Record to bFound
1980>>>>>>>>>            Loop
1981>>>>>>>>>>
1981>>>>>>>>>        End
1981>>>>>>>>>>
1981>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1982>>>>>>>>>End_Class
