2037>>>>>>>>>>>// Mixin class to support transistion support for CodeType and CodeMast files.
2037>>>>>>>>>>>// These files used to be in filelist and they used to reside at 207 and 208 and they
2037>>>>>>>>>>>// were always opened with "open as"
2037>>>>>>>>>>>// We want these to be in the filelist at 253 and 254. These open methods will attempt to open these files
2037>>>>>>>>>>>// as such. If these are old files (not in filelist or wrong number) they will get loaded with the old
2037>>>>>>>>>>>// open as - thus keeping this backwards compatible.
2037>>>>>>>>>>>// By adding to filelist, we can sort the files and we can open them as other database sources.
2037>>>>>>>>>>>Use VDFBase.pkg
2037>>>>>>>>>>>
2037>>>>>>>>>>>Declare_Datafile CodeType
Including file: CodeType.fd    (C:\Training\DataFlexLibraries\DDSrc\CodeType.fd)
2037>>>>>>>>>>>Declare_Datafile CodeMast
Including file: CodeMast.fd    (C:\Training\DataFlexLibraries\DDSrc\CodeMast.fd)
2037>>>>>>>>>>>Define C_Expected_CodeType_FileNumber for 253  // and the logical name must be CODETYPE
2037>>>>>>>>>>>Define C_Expected_CodeMast_FileNumber for 254  // and the logical name must be CODEMAST
2037>>>>>>>>>>>
2037>>>>>>>>>>>Class cCodeMaintOpen_Mixin is a Mixin
2038>>>>>>>>>>>    
2038>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OpenCodeMast
2040>>>>>>>>>>>        String sName
2040>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Codemast.File_number=C_Expected_CodeMast_FileNumber) Begin
2042>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FILE_LOGICAL_NAME of Codemast.File_number to sName
2045>>>>>>>>>>>            If (uppercase(trim(sName))="CODEMAST") Begin
2047>>>>>>>>>>>                Open CodeMast
2049>>>>>>>>>>>                Procedure_Return
2050>>>>>>>>>>>            End
2050>>>>>>>>>>>>
2050>>>>>>>>>>>        End
2050>>>>>>>>>>>>
2050>>>>>>>>>>>        Open "CodeMast" as Codemast.File_number
2052>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
2053>>>>>>>>>>>    
2053>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OpenCodeType
2055>>>>>>>>>>>        String sName
2055>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Codetype.File_number=C_Expected_CodeType_FileNumber) Begin
2057>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FILE_LOGICAL_NAME of CodeType.File_number to sName
2060>>>>>>>>>>>            If (uppercase(trim(sName))="CODETYPE") Begin
2062>>>>>>>>>>>                Open CodeType
2064>>>>>>>>>>>                Procedure_Return
2065>>>>>>>>>>>            End
2065>>>>>>>>>>>>
2065>>>>>>>>>>>        End
2065>>>>>>>>>>>>
2065>>>>>>>>>>>        Open "CodeType" as CodeType.File_number
2067>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
2068>>>>>>>>>>>    
2068>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
