4058>>>>>>>    // This function will be called indirectly by DEOs when an item is being
4058>>>>>>>    // entered, exited or needs validation. The first argument holds the
4058>>>>>>>    // fieldnumber for the field and the second holds the id of the message
4058>>>>>>>    // which can be send to retrieve the message which needs to be send for
4058>>>>>>>    // this Field/Event combination. The value of the second argument can be
4058>>>>>>>    // GET_Field_Entry_MSG, GET_Field_Exit_MSG or GET_Field_Validate_MSG.
4058>>>>>>>    Function Exec_Field_Message Integer iField Integer iMsg_ID Returns Integer
4060>>>>>>>        Integer iMsg
4060>>>>>>>        Integer iResult
4060>>>>>>>        String  sValue
4060>>>>>>>        Get iMsg_ID iField to iMsg
4061>>>>>>>        If iMsg Begin
4063>>>>>>>            Get Field_Current_Value iField to sValue
4064>>>>>>>            Get iMsg iField sValue to iResult
4065>>>>>>>        End
4065>>>>>>>>
4065>>>>>>>        Function_Return iResult
4066>>>>>>>    End_Function
