4702>>>>>>>        For iCount from 0 to iMax
4708>>>>>>>>
4708>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Client iCount to iDSO
4709>>>>>>>            Move ( sFiles + String(Main_file(iDSO))+",") to sFiles
4710>>>>>>>        Loop
4711>>>>>>>>
4711>>>>>>>
4711>>>>>>>        // Make sure each required File exists
