8544>>>>>>>>>Class cVersionInfo is a cObject
8545>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
8547>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
8549>>>>>>>>>        
8549>>>>>>>>>        
8549>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piVersionMajor
8550>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piVersionMinor
8551>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piVersionRelease
8552>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piVersionBuild
8553>>>>>>>>>        
8553>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbIncluded
8554>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbSpecialBuild
8555>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbPrivateBuild
8556>>>>>>>>>        
