9932>>>>>>>>>    
9932>>>>>>>>>    // Fetch the next row
9932>>>>>>>>>    // Returns  : 0   = No more data
9932>>>>>>>>>    //<>0 = Success
9932>>>>>>>>>    Function SQLFetch Returns Integer
9934>>>>>>>>>        Integer ihdbc
9934>>>>>>>>>        Integer ihstmt
9934>>>>>>>>>        Integer iResult
9934>>>>>>>>>        String  sDrvrId
9934>>>>>>>>>        String  sEmpty
9934>>>>>>>>>        
9934>>>>>>>>>        // Initialize
9934>>>>>>>>>        Move "" to sEmpty
9935>>>>>>>>>        Move 0  to iResult
9936>>>>>>>>>        
9936>>>>>>>>>        // Get the cli handles
9936>>>>>>>>>        Get phCLIStatementHandle  to ihstmt
9937>>>>>>>>>        Get phCLIConnectionHandle to ihdbc
9938>>>>>>>>>        Get psDriverId            to sDrvrId
9939>>>>>>>>>        
9939>>>>>>>>>        // Fetch
9939>>>>>>>>>        If (ihstmt <> 0 and ihdbc <> 0 and sDrvrId <> "") Begin
9941>>>>>>>>>            Move False to Err
9942>>>>>>>>>            
9942>>>>>>>>>            // Call the driver function to fetch
