10188>>>>>>>>>    // Return the value of a column in a fetched row of a given
10188>>>>>>>>>    // statement.
10188>>>>>>>>>    Function SQLColumnValue Integer iCol Returns String
10190>>>>>>>>>        Integer ihdbc
10190>>>>>>>>>        Integer ihstmt
