10273>>>>>>>>>                    If (iLen > iVariableBufferLength) Begin
10275>>>>>>>>>                        // Allocate
10275>>>>>>>>>                        Move (Repeat(' ', iLen)) to wResult
10276>>>>>>>>>                        
