11198>>>>>>>>>    Procedure GetAccessToken
11200>>>>>>>>>       
11200>>>>>>>>>        // Call the get accesstoken function here        
11200>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
11201>>>>>>>>>    
11201>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RefreshAccessToken String sRefreshToken
11203>>>>>>>>>        
11203>>>>>>>>>        // Call the refresh accesstoken function here
