11554>>>>>>>        
11554>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_FILE_LOGIN of hTableNumber to sConnectionString
11557>>>>>>>        Function_Return (Pos(C_ConnectionId, Uppercase(sConnectionString)))        
