12683>>>>>>>        Get DocumentObject to hoDocumentObject
12684>>>>>>>        // Create an TextNode in the document and assign its interface to the new DF object.
12684>>>>>>>        Get createTextNode of hoDocumentObject sValue to infcNewTextNode
12685>>>>>>>        If infcNewTextNode Begin // if there was an error, no infc handle would be returned
12687>>>>>>>            Get NodeClassId of hoDocumentObject NODE_TEXT to iClassId
12688>>>>>>>            Get CreateXMLObject iClassId infcNewTextNode to hoNewTextNode
12689>>>>>>>        End
12689>>>>>>>>
12689>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoNewTextNode
