13217>>>>>>>    // returns an error sub-object as a sibling of this error object
13217>>>>>>>    Function ErrorItemNode Integer iItem Returns Handle
13219>>>>>>>        Handle hoParseErrorNode hoParent
13219>>>>>>>        Handle hParseErrorIntf
13219>>>>>>>        Get ErrorItem iItem to hParseErrorIntf
13220>>>>>>>        If (hParseErrorIntf) Begin
13222>>>>>>>            // add to parent in case developer destroys the current object
13222>>>>>>>            Get Parent to hoParent
13223>>>>>>>            Get Create of hoParent U_cXMLDOMParseError to hoParseErrorNode
13224>>>>>>>            Set XmlInterface of hoParseErrorNode to hParseErrorIntf
13225>>>>>>>        End
13225>>>>>>>>
13225>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoParseErrorNode
13226>>>>>>>    End_Function
13227>>>>>>>End_Class
