13564>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure MessageBoxError String sErrorText Boolean bCritical
13566>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIcon iRet
13566>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoOldSelf hoFocus
13566>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (If(bCritical,MB_IconHand,MB_IconExclamation)) to iIcon
13567>>>>>>>>>>>        Move Self to hoOldSelf
13568>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Focus of desktop to hoFocus
