13687>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set_Error Integer iErrNr String sErrMsg String sFullErrMsg Integer iLineNr Integer iFileNr Integer iFieldNr
13689>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
13689>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
13690>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value of oErrorNumber iCount to iErrNr
13691>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value of oErrorText   iCount to sErrMsg
13692>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value of oFullErrorText iCount to sFullErrMsg
13693>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value of oLineNr      iCount to iLineNr
13694>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value of oFileNr      iCount to iFileNr
13695>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value of oFieldNr     iCount to iFieldNr
13696>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
