13796>>>>>>>>>>>    // see if error exists for this file and field. If it does, return the
13796>>>>>>>>>>>    // item number, else return -1.
13796>>>>>>>>>>>    Function FileFieldErrorItem Integer iFile Integer iField Returns Integer
13798>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount i
13798>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
13799>>>>>>>>>>>        Decrement iCount
13800>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to iCount
13806>>>>>>>>>>>>
13806>>>>>>>>>>>            If (Error_FileNr(Self,i)=iFile and ;                Error_FieldNr(Self,i)=iField) ;                Function_Return i
13809>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
13810>>>>>>>>>>>>
13810>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return -1
13811>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
