14362>>>>>>>>>    // This object's container (cWebApp) must understand these
14362>>>>>>>>>    // DoAttach and Detach messages.
14362>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnAttachSession DWord ByRef dwError
14364>>>>>>>>>        Set peDetachEndPointEnvironment to WebAppEnvNone
14365>>>>>>>>>        
14365>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Get DoAttachProcess to dwError
14367>>>>>>>>>        
14367>>>>>>>>>        If (dwError) Begin
14369>>>>>>>>>            Abort
14370>>>>>>>>>>
14370>>>>>>>>>        End
14370>>>>>>>>>>
14370>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
