14376>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnDetachSession
14378>>>>>>>>>        //  Store WebAppEnvironment for usage in OnReleaseProcess
14378>>>>>>>>>        Set peDetachEndPointEnvironment to (CurrentWebAppEnvironment(Self))
14379>>>>>>>>>        
14379>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Send DoDetachProcess
14381>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
14382>>>>>>>>>    
14382>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnReleaseProcess
14384>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount iObjectCount iId
14384>>>>>>>>>        
14384>>>>>>>>>        //  For ASP we ignore the OnReleaseProcess since it is not reliable
14384>>>>>>>>>        If (peDetachEndPointEnvironment(Self) = WebAppEnvASP) ;            Procedure_Return
14387>>>>>>>>>        
14387>>>>>>>>>        Get HttpH_Count to iObjectCount
14388>>>>>>>>>        
14388>>>>>>>>>        For iCount From 0 To (iObjectCount-1)
14394>>>>>>>>>>
14394>>>>>>>>>            Get HttpH_ID iCount to iId
14395>>>>>>>>>            Send OnReleaseProcess of iId
14396>>>>>>>>>        Loop
14397>>>>>>>>>>
14397>>>>>>>>>
14397>>>>>>>>>        Get Wso_Count to iObjectCount
14398>>>>>>>>>        
14398>>>>>>>>>        For iCount From 0 To (iObjectCount-1)
14404>>>>>>>>>>
14404>>>>>>>>>            Get Wso_ID iCount to iId
14405>>>>>>>>>            Send OnReleaseProcess of iId
14406>>>>>>>>>        Loop
14407>>>>>>>>>>
14407>>>>>>>>>        
14407>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Send DoReleaseProcess
14409>>>>>>>>>        
14409>>>>>>>>>        Set peDetachEndPointEnvironment to WebAppEnvNone
14410>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
