14476>>>>>>>>>        Integer hObjId iError
14476>>>>>>>>>        Get MapWPONametoID sWebBpo to hObjId // will generate an error if not found
14477>>>>>>>>>        
14477>>>>>>>>>        If hObjId ;            Get DoGetDDValue of hObjId sFile sField iOption sParam (&sValueOut) to iError
14480>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move 1 to iError
