14483>>>>>>>>>    
14483>>>>>>>>>    // Note that DfFunc and Call both map to this location. From this point on, it is Call
14483>>>>>>>>>    // This can be called as part of a webapp or a web-service. We must check and only
14483>>>>>>>>>    // pass these messages to the correct objects
14483>>>>>>>>>    // values for WebAppEndPointEnvironment in function CurrentWebAppEnvironment
14483>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnDFFunc String sWebBpo UChar[] llrequest UChar[] ByRef llresponse UInteger ByRef llpdwError
14485>>>>>>>>>        Integer hObjId iVoid
14485>>>>>>>>>        Integer eWebAppEndPointEnvironment
14485>>>>>>>>>        tWASCallData callData
14485>>>>>>>>>        tWASCallData callData
14485>>>>>>>>>        
14485>>>>>>>>>        Get CurrentWebAppEnvironment to eWebAppEndPointEnvironment
14486>>>>>>>>>        If (eWebAppEndPointEnvironment=WebAppEnvASP) Begin
14488>>>>>>>>>            Get MapWPONametoID sWebBpo to hObjId // will generate an error if not found
14489>>>>>>>>>        End
14489>>>>>>>>>>
14489>>>>>>>>>        Else If (eWebAppEndPointEnvironment=WebAppEnvWebService) Begin
14492>>>>>>>>>            Get MapWSONametoID sWebBpo to hObjId // will generate an error if not found
14493>>>>>>>>>        End
14493>>>>>>>>>>
14493>>>>>>>>>        
14493>>>>>>>>>        
14493>>>>>>>>>        Move (AddressOf(llrequest)) to callData.pRequest
14494>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(llrequest)) to callData.iRequestSize
14495>>>>>>>>>        
14495>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to callData.pResponse
14496>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to callData.iResponseSize
14497>>>>>>>>>        
14497>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to callData.dwError
14498>>>>>>>>>        
14498>>>>>>>>>        // It really can't be none, but if it is, the id will be 0 anyway
14498>>>>>>>>>        If hObjId ;            Get DoCall of hObjId (AddressOf(callData)) to llpdwError
14501>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move 1 to llpdwError
14503>>>>>>>>>        
14503>>>>>>>>>        If (callData.pResponse <> 0) Begin
14505>>>>>>>>>            Move (ResizeArray(llresponse, callData.iResponseSize, 0)) to llresponse
14506>>>>>>>>>            Move (CopyMemory(AddressOf(llresponse), callData.pResponse, callData.iResponseSize)) to iVoid
14507>>>>>>>>>            Move (Free(callData.pResponse)) to iVoid
14508>>>>>>>>>        End
14508>>>>>>>>>>
14508>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
14509>>>>>>>>>    
14509>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnHttpRequest String lllpszWbo String lllpszMethod String lllpszPath String lllpszQueryString String lllpszContentType String lllpszAcceptType DWord lliSize DWord ByRef llpdwError
14511>>>>>>>>>        Integer hObjId iError
14511>>>>>>>>>        Integer eWebAppEndPointEnvironment
14511>>>>>>>>>        
14511>>>>>>>>>        //  Make sure this unsigned value shows as unsigned
14511>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iError
14512>>>>>>>>>        Move lliSize to lliSize
14513>>>>>>>>>        
14513>>>>>>>>>        Get CurrentWebAppEnvironment to eWebAppEndPointEnvironment
14514>>>>>>>>>        If (eWebAppEndPointEnvironment=WebAppHttpModule) Begin
14516>>>>>>>>>            Get MapHttpHNameToID lllpszWbo to hObjId // will generate an error if not found
14517>>>>>>>>>        End
14517>>>>>>>>>>
14517>>>>>>>>>        
14517>>>>>>>>>        // It really can't be none, but if it is, the id will be 0 anyway
14517>>>>>>>>>        If hObjId ;            Send HandleHttpRequest of hObjId lllpszMethod lllpszPath lllpszQueryString lllpszContentType lllpszAcceptType lliSize
14520>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move 1 to iError
14522>>>>>>>>>        
14522>>>>>>>>>        // Always write result error to indicate that we did finish
14522>>>>>>>>>        Move iError to llpdwError
14523>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
14524>>>>>>>>>    
