14621>>>>>>>>>    
14621>>>>>>>>>    // Error Interface:
14621>>>>>>>>>    
14621>>>>>>>>>    // ReportCriticalError is sent for critical errors by the error handler object. For the HTTP 
14621>>>>>>>>>    // handler it sends a fatal error to the end-point so it can properly return an error 500.
14621>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ReportCriticalError Integer iErr String sErrMsg Integer iLine  Integer iFileNr Integer iFieldNr
14623>>>>>>>>>        String sLineBreak sDtl
14623>>>>>>>>>        String sFileName sFieldName
14623>>>>>>>>>        Integer eWebAppEndPointEnvironment
14623>>>>>>>>>        
14623>>>>>>>>>        // At some point we should figure out how to make HTTP handler throw error here!
14623>>>>>>>>>        Get CurrentWebAppEnvironment to eWebAppEndPointEnvironment
14624>>>>>>>>>        If (eWebAppEndPointEnvironment=WebAppHttpModule) Begin
14626>>>>>>>>>            If (pbVerboseErrors(Self)) Begin
14628>>>>>>>>>                Move (SFormat(C_$VDFErrorInLine, iErr, iLine)) to sDtl
14629>>>>>>>>>                If (iFileNr  > 0) ;                    Move (sDtl * DD_FILE_TEXT  * String(iFileNr))  to sDtl
14632>>>>>>>>>                If (iFieldNr > 0) ;                    Move (sDtl * DD_FIELD_TEXT * String(iFieldNr)) to sDtl
14635>>>>>>>>>                Move (sErrMsg + C_NewLine + sDtl) to sErrMsg
14636>>>>>>>>>            End
14636>>>>>>>>>>
14636>>>>>>>>>            
14636>>>>>>>>>            Move (Replaces("\n",sErrMsg, Character(13)+Character(10))) to sErrMsg
14637>>>>>>>>>            Send ReportFatalError "Critical DataFlex Error" sErrMsg
14638>>>>>>>>>        End
14638>>>>>>>>>>
14638>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
14639>>>>>>>>>    
14639>>>>>>>>>    // ReportError and ReportErrorEvent is private and should never be sent. It is sent
14639>>>>>>>>>    // from within the error handler object to report errors
14639>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ReportError Integer iErr String sErrMsg Integer iLine  Integer iFileNr Integer iFieldNr
14641>>>>>>>>>        String sLineBreak sDtl
14641>>>>>>>>>        String sFileName sFieldName
14641>>>>>>>>>        Integer eWebAppEndPointEnvironment
14641>>>>>>>>>        
14641>>>>>>>>>        Get CurrentWebAppEnvironment to eWebAppEndPointEnvironment
14642>>>>>>>>>        If (eWebAppEndPointEnvironment<>WebAppHttpModule) Begin
14644>>>>>>>>>            //  It must be Classic ASP
14644>>>>>>>>>            Move (HtmlEncode(sErrMsg)) to sErrMsg
14645>>>>>>>>>            Move "<br />" to sLineBreak
14646>>>>>>>>>            // The extended error message will contain \n to mark end of line. We will
14646>>>>>>>>>            // convert these to HTML style.
14646>>>>>>>>>            Move (Replaces("\n",sErrMSg,sLineBreak)) to sErrmsg
14647>>>>>>>>>            If (pbVerboseErrors(Self)) Begin
14649>>>>>>>>>                Move (SFormat(C_$VDFErrorInLine, iErr, iLine)) to sDtl
14650>>>>>>>>>                If (iFileNr  > 0) ;                    Move (sDtl * DD_FILE_TEXT  * String(iFileNr))  to sDtl
14653>>>>>>>>>                If (iFieldNr > 0) ;                    Move (sDtl * DD_FIELD_TEXT * String(iFieldNr)) to sDtl
14656>>>>>>>>>                Append sErrMsg sLineBreak sDtl
14658>>>>>>>>>            End
14658>>>>>>>>>>
14658>>>>>>>>>            Append sErrMsg sLineBreak sLineBreak
14660>>>>>>>>>            Send OutputHTML sErrMsg
14661>>>>>>>>>        End
14661>>>>>>>>>>
14661>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
14662>>>>>>>>>    
14662>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ReportErrorEvent Integer iErr String sErrMsg Integer iLine  Integer iFileNr Integer iFieldNr
14664>>>>>>>>>        String sHtml sLineBreak sDtl
14664>>>>>>>>>        String sFileName sFieldName
14664>>>>>>>>>        //Move ". " To sLineBreak
14664>>>>>>>>>        Move (Character(13)+Character(10)) to sLineBreak
14665>>>>>>>>>        // The extended error message will contain \n to mark end of line. We will
14665>>>>>>>>>        // convert these to HTML style.
14665>>>>>>>>>        Move (Replaces("\n",sErrMSg,sLineBreak)) to sErrmsg
14666>>>>>>>>>        Move (SFormat(C_$VDFErrorInLine, iErr, iLine)) to sDtl
14667>>>>>>>>>        If (iFileNr  > 0) ;            Move (sDtl * DD_FILE_TEXT  * String(iFileNr))  to sDtl
14670>>>>>>>>>        If (iFieldNr > 0) ;            Move (sDtl * DD_FIELD_TEXT * String(iFieldNr)) to sDtl
14673>>>>>>>>>        Append sErrMsg sLineBreak sDtl
14675>>>>>>>>>        Send LogEvent iErr sErrMsg
14676>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
14677>>>>>>>>>    
14677>>>>>>>>>    // EnumerateErrors and ErrorReportCallBack could be used for
14677>>>>>>>>>    // advanced purposes allowing other objects to handle errors in
14677>>>>>>>>>    // a more custom fashion.
14677>>>>>>>>>    
14677>>>>>>>>>    // use this to generate a report of all errors
14677>>>>>>>>>    Procedure EnumerateErrors Integer iMsg Integer hObj
14679>>>>>>>>>        Send EnumerateErrors to Error_Object_Id  iMsg hObj
14680>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
14681>>>>>>>>>    
14681>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ErrorReportCallBack Integer iItem Integer iMsg Integer hObj
14683>>>>>>>>>        Send ErrorReportCallBack to Error_Object_Id iItem iMsg hObj
14684>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
14685>>>>>>>>>
14685>>>>>>>>>    // Use this to display the last error
14685>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ReportLastError Integer bClearError
14687>>>>>>>>>        // note: passing -1 means last error (if no last error, nothing happens)
