14886>>>>>>>>>    Function Utf16FromBuffer  Pointer pMultiCharBuffer Integer eCharType Integer ByRef iLen Returns Pointer
14888>>>>>>>>>        Pointer pWideBuf
14888>>>>>>>>>        Integer iWideBufLen iStrLen
14888>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to pWideBuf
14889>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iLen
14890>>>>>>>>>        If (pMultiCharBuffer) Begin
14892>>>>>>>>>            Move (CStringSize(pMultiCharBuffer)) to iStrLen
14893>>>>>>>>>            If (iStrLen) Begin
14895>>>>>>>>>                Move (MultiToWideBuffer(eCharType,pMultiCharBuffer, iStrLen, AddressOf(pWideBuf))) to iLen
14896>>>>>>>>>                If (iLen=0) Begin
14898>>>>>>>>>                    Function_Return 0
14899>>>>>>>>>                End
14899>>>>>>>>>>
14899>>>>>>>>>            End
14899>>>>>>>>>>
14899>>>>>>>>>        End
14899>>>>>>>>>>
14899>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return pWideBuf
14900>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
