14964>>>>>>>>>    // Variant functions that allow you to move between a variant string (wide char) and other
14964>>>>>>>>>    // buffer and string types. Normally a Move vVar to sVar does a OEM/Unicode translation. These
14964>>>>>>>>>    // allow you translate to other formats (UTF8, OEM and ANSI)
