15003>>>>>>>>>    Function VariantStrToUTF16 Variant vValue Integer ByRef iLen Returns Pointer
15005>>>>>>>>>        Pointer pBSTR pRetStr
15005>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
15005>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to pRetStr
15006>>>>>>>>>        Move (VariantStringLength( vValue)) to iLen
15007>>>>>>>>>        If (iLen) Begin
15009>>>>>>>>>            Move (DeRefPtr(AddressOf(vValue),8)) to pBSTR
15010>>>>>>>>>            Move (Alloc(iLen+1 * 2)) to pRetStr
15011>>>>>>>>>            Move (MemCopy(pRetStr,pBSTR,(iLen+1 * 2))) to bOk
15012>>>>>>>>>        End
15012>>>>>>>>>>
15012>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return pRetStr
15013>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
