15025>>>>>>>>>    // Create Uchar array from variant string.
15025>>>>>>>>>    // Data buffer is encoded by eCharType
15025>>>>>>>>>    Function VariantStrToUCharArray Variant vValue Integer eCharType Returns UChar[]
15027>>>>>>>>>        Pointer pBSTR pRetStr
15027>>>>>>>>>        Integer iLen iBufLen
15027>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
15027>>>>>>>>>        UChar[] UC1
15028>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to pRetStr
15029>>>>>>>>>        Move (VariantStringLength( vValue)) to iLen
15030>>>>>>>>>        If (iLen) Begin
15032>>>>>>>>>            Move (DeRefPtr(AddressOf(vValue),8)) to pBSTR
15033>>>>>>>>>            If (eCharType=CP_UTF16) Begin
15035>>>>>>>>>                Move (iLen*2) to iBufLen
15036>>>>>>>>>                Move (ResizeArray(UC1,iBufLen)) to UC1
15037>>>>>>>>>                Move (MemCopy(AddressOf(UC1),pBSTR,iBufLen)) to bOk
15038>>>>>>>>>            End
15038>>>>>>>>>>
15038>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
15039>>>>>>>>>                Move (WideToMultiBuffer(eCharType,pBSTR,iLen,AddressOf(pRetStr))) to iBufLen
15040>>>>>>>>>                Move (ResizeArray(UC1,iBufLen)) to UC1
15041>>>>>>>>>                Move (MemCopy(AddressOf(UC1),pRetStr,iBufLen)) to bOk
15042>>>>>>>>>                Move (Free(pRetStr)) to bOk
15043>>>>>>>>>            End
15043>>>>>>>>>>
15043>>>>>>>>>        End
15043>>>>>>>>>>
15043>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return UC1
15044>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
