15065>>>>>>>>>    // UChar array conversions. Converts a passed uchar array with from-encoding to
15065>>>>>>>>>    // a new UChar array with to-encoding
15065>>>>>>>>>    
15065>>>>>>>>>    Function ConvertUCharArray UChar[] UCharData Integer iFromCP Integer iToCP Returns UChar[]
15067>>>>>>>>>        Pointer pFromBuf pToBuf
15067>>>>>>>>>        Integer iBytes iChars
15067>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
15067>>>>>>>>>        
15067>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(UCharData)) to iBytes
15068>>>>>>>>>        If (iFromCP=iToCP or iBytes=0) Begin
15070>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return UCharData
15071>>>>>>>>>        End
15071>>>>>>>>>>
15071>>>>>>>>>        
15071>>>>>>>>>        If (iFromCP<>CP_UTF16) Begin
15073>>>>>>>>>            Move 0 to UCharData[iBytes] // extend to make sure we have 0 at end
15074>>>>>>>>>            Get Utf16FromBuffer (AddressOf(UCharData)) iFromCP (&iChars) to pFromBuf
15075>>>>>>>>>        End
15075>>>>>>>>>>
15075>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
15076>>>>>>>>>            Move (iBytes/2) to iChars // if from is utf16
15077>>>>>>>>>        End
15077>>>>>>>>>>
15077>>>>>>>>>        
15077>>>>>>>>>        If (iToCP<>CP_UTF16) Begin
15079>>>>>>>>>            If (iFromCP=CP_UTF16) Begin
15081>>>>>>>>>                Get Utf16ToBuffer (AddressOf(UCharData)) iToCP iChars to pToBuf
15082>>>>>>>>>            End
15082>>>>>>>>>>
15082>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
15083>>>>>>>>>                Get Utf16ToBuffer pFromBuf iToCP iChars to pToBuf
15084>>>>>>>>>                Move (Free(pFromBuf)) to bOk
15085>>>>>>>>>            End
15085>>>>>>>>>>
15085>>>>>>>>>            Move (CStringSize(pToBuf)) to iBytes
15086>>>>>>>>>        End
15086>>>>>>>>>>
15086>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
15087>>>>>>>>>            Move (iChars*2) to iBytes
15088>>>>>>>>>            Move pFromBuf to pToBuf
15089>>>>>>>>>        End
15089>>>>>>>>>>
15089>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(UCharData,iBytes)) to UCharData
15090>>>>>>>>>        Move (MemCopy(AddressOf(UCharData),pToBuf,iBytes)) to bOk
15091>>>>>>>>>        Move (Free(pToBuf)) to bOk
15092>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return UCharData
15093>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
