15150>>>>>>>>>>>// Mixes in basic support for some of the Web interfaces that are shared with 
15150>>>>>>>>>>>// cWebComponent and cWebApp classes. These are messages that interact with the
15150>>>>>>>>>>>// private cVDFInternetSession global object.
15150>>>>>>>>>>>
15150>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebEndPoint_Mixin is a Mixin
15151>>>>>>>>>>>
15151>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ServerVariable String sVariableName Returns String
15153>>>>>>>>>>>        String sVal
15153>>>>>>>>>>>        
15153>>>>>>>>>>>        Get HttpServerVariable of ghInetSession sVariableName to sVal
15154>>>>>>>>>>>        
