15404>>>>>>>    Procedure OnHttpRequest String sVerb String sPath String sContentType String sAcceptType DWord iSize
15406>>>>>>>        Case Begin
15406>>>>>>>            Case (sVerb = "GET")
15408>>>>>>>                Send OnHttpGet sPath sAcceptType
15409>>>>>>>                Break
15410>>>>>>>            Case (sVerb = "POST")
15413>>>>>>>                Send OnHttpPost sPath sContentType sAcceptType iSize
15414>>>>>>>                Break
15415>>>>>>>            Case (sVerb = "PUT")
15418>>>>>>>                Send OnHttpPut sPath sContentType iSize
15419>>>>>>>                Break
15420>>>>>>>            Case (sVerb = "PATCH")
15423>>>>>>>                Send OnHttpPatch sPath sContentType iSize
15424>>>>>>>                Break
15425>>>>>>>            Case (sVerb = "DELETE")
15428>>>>>>>                Send OnHttpDelete sPath
15429>>>>>>>                Break
15430>>>>>>>        Case End
15430>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
