15497>>>>>>>        If (eCodePage <> CP_UTF8) Begin
15499>>>>>>>            Get ConvertUCharArray of oCharTranslator ucData CP_UTF8 eCodePage to ucData
15500>>>>>>>        End
15500>>>>>>>>
15500>>>>>>>        
15500>>>>>>>        Send OutputUChar ucData
15501>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
