15787>>>>>>>
15787>>>>>>>        // When this object is created, we must already have an error handler object created.
15787>>>>>>>        // If this error is triggered, it's a programming mistake. In addition this error handler must
15787>>>>>>>        // understand a pre-defined set of messages (i.e. the handler must be based on cWebApperror). We
15787>>>>>>>        // do not check for that here. If an error handler exists, we assume you've provided the right one.
15787>>>>>>>        If (Error_object_id=0) Begin
15789>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$MissingErrorHandlerObject
15790>>>>>>>>
15790>>>>>>>            Abort
15791>>>>>>>>
15791>>>>>>>        End
