15803>>>>>>>
15803>>>>>>>// This function converts a typed value from the generic format appropriate for transport to
15803>>>>>>>// the DataFlex format for that type.
15803>>>>>>>//
15803>>>>>>>// For example a date value should be converted from XML transport format
15803>>>>>>>// for dates. e.g. European "2013-03-24" is converted into "24/03/2013"
15803>>>>>>>//                 USA      "2013-03-24" is converted into "03/24/2013"
15803>>>>>>>//
15803>>>>>>>// This function is intended to be used when receiving numeric or date values from
15803>>>>>>>// the client during an AJAX call in a Web Framework application.
15803>>>>>>>//
15803>>>>>>>// This function is used internally by the framework to convert psValue Web Properties.
15803>>>>>>>//
15803>>>>>>>// eDataType - Must be passed to inform this function how to interpret the passed value (sValue)
15803>>>>>>>// sValue    - Is the value to be converted.
15803>>>>>>>// Returns   - The converted value.
15803>>>>>>>//
15803>>>>>>>// See also ConvertToClient
15803>>>>>>>Function ConvertFromClient Global Integer eDataType String sValue Returns String
15805>>>>>>>    // Test if the value represents a number, date or datetime. If so we must convert
15805>>>>>>>    // the value from a universal format sent by the client....
15805>>>>>>>    Case Begin
15805>>>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeNumber)
15807>>>>>>>            // don't convert if psValue = "", otherwise "" will convert to "0".
15807>>>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
15809>>>>>>>                ConvertFromXml xsNumber sValue to sValue
15810>>>>>>>            End
15810>>>>>>>>
15810>>>>>>>            Case Break
15811>>>>>>>        
15811>>>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeDate)
15814>>>>>>>            ConvertFromXml xsDate sValue to sValue
15815>>>>>>>            Case Break
15816>>>>>>>        
15816>>>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeDateTime)
15819>>>>>>>            ConvertFromXml xsDatetime sValue to sValue
15820>>>>>>>            Case Break
15821>>>>>>>        
15821>>>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeTime)
15824>>>>>>>            ConvertFromXml xsTime sValue to sValue
15825>>>>>>>            Case Break
15826>>>>>>>        
15826>>>>>>>    Case End
15826>>>>>>>    
15826>>>>>>>    Function_Return sValue
15827>>>>>>>End_Function
15828>>>>>>>
15828>>>>>>>
15828>>>>>>>// This function converts a DataFlex format value into a generic format appropriate for
15828>>>>>>>// transport to the client.
15828>>>>>>>//
15828>>>>>>>// For example a date value should be converted into XML transport format
15828>>>>>>>// for dates. e.g. European "24/03/2013" is converted into "2013-03-24"
15828>>>>>>>//                 USA      "03/24/2013" is converted into "2013-03-24"
15828>>>>>>>//
15828>>>>>>>// This function is intended to be used when sending numeric or date values to
15828>>>>>>>// the client during an AJAX call in a Web Framework application.
15828>>>>>>>//
15828>>>>>>>// This function is used internally by the framework to convert psValue Web Properties.
15828>>>>>>>//
15828>>>>>>>// eDataType - Must be passed to inform this function how to interpret the passed value (sValue)
15828>>>>>>>// sValue    - Is the value to be converted.
15828>>>>>>>// Returns   - The converted value.
15828>>>>>>>//
15828>>>>>>>// See also ConvertFromClient.
15828>>>>>>>Function ConvertToClient Global Integer eDataType String sValue Returns String
15830>>>>>>>    // Test if the value represents a number, date or datetime. If so we must convert
15830>>>>>>>    // the value into a universal format for transferring it to the client....
15830>>>>>>>    Case Begin
15830>>>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeNumber)
15832>>>>>>>            // don't convert if psValue = "", otherwise "" will convert to "0".
15832>>>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
15834>>>>>>>                ConvertToXml xsNumber sValue to sValue
15835>>>>>>>            End
15835>>>>>>>>
15835>>>>>>>            Case Break
15836>>>>>>>        
15836>>>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeDate)
15839>>>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
15841>>>>>>>                ConvertToXml xsDate sValue to sValue
15842>>>>>>>            End
15842>>>>>>>>
15842>>>>>>>            Case Break
15843>>>>>>>        
15843>>>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeDateTime)
15846>>>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
15848>>>>>>>                ConvertToXml xsDatetime sValue to sValue
15849>>>>>>>            End
15849>>>>>>>>
15849>>>>>>>            Case Break
15850>>>>>>>        
15850>>>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeTime)
15853>>>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
15855>>>>>>>                ConvertToXml xsTime sValue to sValue
15856>>>>>>>            End
15856>>>>>>>>
15856>>>>>>>            Case Break
15857>>>>>>>        
15857>>>>>>>    Case End
15857>>>>>>>    
15857>>>>>>>    Function_Return sValue
15858>>>>>>>End_Function
