16523>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
16524>>>>>>>>>>>    
16524>>>>>>>>>>>    // Returns the handle to the resource manager
16524>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ResourceManager Returns Handle
16526>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (phoResourceManager(Host(Self)))
