17680>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class server_mixin is a mixin
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   Server is the object id of the database agent for this object.
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   Watched_Servers is a set of object ids for database agents whose state
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   must also be monitored by this object (but which never receive requests
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   directly from this object, unlike the Server).
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   Servers_Scanned determines if the items of this object have been
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   scanned to see if this object should be connected to other database
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   agents as 'just watching' (see Watched_Servers, above).
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   Auto_Fill_State determines if this object should always automatically
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   fill itself with data when it is activated.
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   Deferred_State determines if this object's browsing in database files
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   should be reflected immediately in this object's database agent (and
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   the agents' agents, etc.), or not.
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
17681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure define_server
17683>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer obj#
17683>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private.Server           0
17684>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Watched_Servers          0
17685>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // used to send Set Changed_State to "foreign" servers, while Watched_Servers
17685>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // is used for sending messages from the DDO to DEOs (there are more of them)
17685>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer ChangedStateWatched_Servers     0
17686>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private.Servers_Scanned  0
17687>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17687>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Auto_Fill_State False
17688>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbAutoFillOnInit True      // Used to tell DDO's that we want autofill on initialization when DEO is attaching
17689>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17689>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Deferred_State  False
17690>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17690>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // added to support DEO request-delegation. This is set true
17690>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // if the server is explicitly set in this DEO (normally via a
17690>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // USING parameter).
17690>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer explicit_server_state False
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Since this package's SET changed_state is using change_
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // disabled_state we might as well define it here. This gets changed
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // by Clear_mx to support setting of defaults without changing the
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // objects changed_state.
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // This stops changed_state from getting changed. It allows item_changed_
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // state to chagne without the object's changed_state getting changed.
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // This should be considered protected (i.e., likely to change). The new
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // messages Entry_Defaults and Set Default_Value are both public and use
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // this. Try to use these messages instead of this property.
17691>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Change_Disabled_State  False
17692>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17692>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // If true DEO will not disconnect from server when deactivating.
17692>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // If true View should handles attaching and detaching.
17692>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Register_Function Default_static_server_state Returns Integer
17692>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Static_Server_State  (Default_Static_Server_State(Self))
17693>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17693>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Properties to better support tables. If Refresh_dirty_state
17693>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // is true then the list object needs refreshing (because it was inactive
17693>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // and changes were made that were not updated). After add_focus is
17693>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // complete the add_focus_msg is sent (allows tables to initialize the
17693>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // list).
17693>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Refresh_dirty_state  True // when not active/dirty
17694>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Add_focus_msg        0    // by dflt no message
17695>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17695>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // This will call a stub procedure which will be augmented (or replaced)
17695>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // by the xdeo mixins
17695>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Define_Extended_DEO_Mixin
17696>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17696>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
