17697>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure remove_deo_from_server
17699>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer obj# isclient wsrvr
17699>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to obj#
17700>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // as of 17.0, containers will be added as a DEO so it receives the Refresh message
17700>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (obj# <> 0) ;            Send remove_user_interface to obj# Self
17703>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Watched_Servers to wsrvr
17704>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If wsrvr ;            Send remove_user_interface to wsrvr Self True // TRUE for watchers
17707>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Refresh_dirty_state to True
