18100>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psCurrencySymbol ""       // The default currency symbol to use on the client in currency masks. "&euro;" can be used to represent the EURO symbol. If left blank then the server's default system currency symbol will be loaded. This symbol replaces the "&curren;" symbol in the mask string when the mask is sent to the client.
