18319>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$No to ButtonTextArray[1]
18320>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Cancel to ButtonTextArray[2]
18321>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18321>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 3) Begin
18323>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sOptCaption to sCaption
18324>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18324>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18324>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18325>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move C_$Confirm to sCaption
18326>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18326>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18326>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18326>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Num_Arguments > 4) Begin
18328>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           Move eOptDfltBtn to eDflt
18329>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18329>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18329>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18330>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           Move 3 to eDflt //cmCancel to eDflt
18331>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18331>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18331>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18331>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move "WebMsgBoxConfirm" to sCSSClass // assume this defines any images and other features for a yes/no dialog.    
18332>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18332>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ShowMessageBox hoCallBack hmCallback sMessage sCaption sCSSClass eDflt ButtonTextArray
18333>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Updates the title of the web page based on the provided string.
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  sTitle  The new page title.
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetPageTitle String sTitle
18336>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18337>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18337>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sTitle to aParams[0]
18338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "setPageTitle" aParams
18339>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Client Action: Shows the provided text on the console of JavaScript debuggers (like 
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  FireBug). This is a common debugging method in web applications comparable to Showln in 
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  windows. The "Server: " String is added before the text to identify server-side log lines 
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  on the client.
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClientLog String sText
18342>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18343>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18343>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move ("Server: " * sText) to aParams[0]
18344>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18344>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "log" aParams
18345>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Client Action: Sends a forceResize which triggers a resize action after handling this call. 
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Usually this should happen autmatically when needed but this method provides a way to force
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  it.
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClientResize
18348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18349>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18349>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "forceResize" aParams
18350>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Pushes a new state item to the browser its history stack. Implemented as a client action 
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // (see history.pushState JavaScript API).
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sUrl        URL for the new history item.
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sTitle      Page title for the new history item.
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      stateData   Valuetree struct that is added as data to the history item. This allows 
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                  custom information to be added for usage on back navigation.
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HistoryPushState String sUrl String sTitle  tWebValueTree stateData
18353>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18354>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18354>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sUrl to aParams[0]
18355>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 1) Begin
18357>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sTitle to aParams[1]
18358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 2) Begin
18360>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "historyPushState" aParams stateData
18361>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18361>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18361>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18362>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "historyPushState" aParams 
18363>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18363>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18363>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Replaces the current item in the browser its history stack. Implemented as client action and
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // maps to the history.replaceState JavaScript API.
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sUrl        URL for the new history item.
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sTitle      Page title for the new history item.
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      stateData   Valuetree struct that is added as data to the history item. This allows 
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                  custom information to be added for usage on back navigation.
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HistoryReplaceState String sUrl String sTitle  tWebValueTree stateData
18366>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18367>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18367>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sUrl to aParams[0]
18368>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 1) Begin
18370>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sTitle to aParams[1]
18371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 2) Begin
18373>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "historyReplaceState" aParams stateData
18374>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18374>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18374>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18375>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "historyReplaceState" aParams 
18376>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18376>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18376>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Server-Action
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Triggered by the client when a history popstate event occurs. This is a browser back 
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // navigation to an item that was added to the history stack using HistoryPushState. The 
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // ptActionData contains the tWebValueTree struct with data passed to HistoryPushItem.
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sTitle      Page title for the history item.
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sUrl        URL for the history item.
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HistoryPopState String sTitle String sUrl
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sStateHash
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree stateData
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree stateData
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ptActionData to stateData
18380>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18380>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Trigger public event
18380>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send OnHistoryPopState sTitle sUrl stateData
18381>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This event is called when the browser navigates back to a history item added using 
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // HistoryPushState. This allows the application to respond to the back navigation. If 
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // peApplicationStateMode is set to asmHistoryOnly or asmHistoryAndUrls then the framework will
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // have restored the state before this event is triggered.
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sTitle      Page title of the history item.
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sUrl        URL of the history item.
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      stateData   Custom state data passed to HistoryPushState or HistoryReplaceState.
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnHistoryPopState String sTitle String sUrl tWebValueTree stateData
18384>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18384>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Server-Action
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Called by the client when the location hash changes (hashchange browser event) and triggers
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // a restorestate if needed and calls OnLocationHashChange.
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // 
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sHash       New location hash.
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure LocationHashChange String sHash
18387>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send OnLocationHashChange sHash
18388>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Triggers when the location hash changes (#.. part of the URL). Only fires if the hash change
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // is not caused by an pop state event, in that case OnHistoryPopState should be used.
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sHash   New location hash.
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnLocationHashChange String sHash
18391>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18392>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18392>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnOrientationChange Integer iOrientation
18394>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Event that is fired when the size of the browser window changes. This event can be used to 
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // make the web application layout responsive to the browser size. It gets the new dimensions
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // of the browser window passed as parameters.
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  iWindowWidth    Width of the browser window in pixels.
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  iWindowHeight   Height of the browser window in pixels.
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnResizeWindow Integer iWindowWidth Integer iWindowHeight
18397>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Event that is fired when the operating systems prefered theme changes.
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // It gets the new prefered theme of the operating system as a string
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // peThemePreference    Name of the new prefered theme
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSystemThemePreferenceChange Integer eSystemThemePreference
18400>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18401>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18401>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_cWebHostAPI_mixin
18403>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnOrientationChange
18404>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnResizeWindow
18405>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure HistoryPopState
18406>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure LocationHashChange
18407>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnSystemThemePreferenceChange
18408>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18409>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
18410>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18410>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebBaseUIObject_mixin is a mixin
18411>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18413>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Published Properties
18413>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbEnabled True          // If False, the control cannot get the focus.
18416>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbRender True           // If False, the control's elements are removed from the HTML (see also pbVisible)
18419>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbVisible True          // If False, the control's elements are hidden (but still present) (see also pbRender)
18422>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psBackgroundColor ""     // CSS Inline Style - Color of the control's background
18425>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psCSSClass ""            // CSS Class
18428>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psHtmlId ""              // HTML Element ID
18431>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psTextColor ""           // CSS Inline Style - Color of control's text
18434>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18434>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnRender ""      // Can be set to a JavaScript Event Handler that will be triggered immediately after rendering the control.
18437>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18437>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbNoAccessibilityCheck False   //  Use this property to disable the accessibility check (to allow JavaScript to show/enable controls)
18438>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18438>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piAccessibilityCacheCall 0 //  giWebAccCacheCtx value indicating if cached value is valid
18439>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piAccessibilityCache 0     //  Cached value of the accessibility number
18440>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18441>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18441>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnCloseModalDialog Handle hoModalDialog
18443>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18444>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18444>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Gives the focus to the control. If the control can't take the focus nothing will happen. If 
18444>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  sent to a container the focus will go to the first focusable control in that container.
18444>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Focus
18446>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "svrFocus"        
18447>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18448>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18448>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Apply focus to object within this view but only do it with
18448>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // non mobile clients.
18448>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ConditionalFocus
18450>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsMobile
18450>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbIsMobile of (Host(Self)) to bIsMobile
18451>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If not bIsMobile Begin
18453>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Focus
18454>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18454>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18454>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18455>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18455>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18455>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18455>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AddKeyHandler Handle hMsg Integer iKeyCode Boolean bShift Boolean bAlt Boolean bCtrl
18457>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18458>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sMsg
18458>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18458>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebMethodName hMsg to sMsg
18459>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18459>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sMsg <> "") Begin
18461>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sMsg       to aParams[0]
18462>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move iKeyCode   to aParams[1]
18463>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bShift     to aParams[2]
18464>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bAlt       to aParams[3]
18465>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bCtrl      to aParams[4]
18466>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18466>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "addKeyHandler" aParams
18467>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18467>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18467>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18468>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18468>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RemoveKeyHandler Handle hMsg Integer iKeyCode Boolean bShift Boolean bAlt Boolean bCtrl
18470>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18471>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sMsg
18471>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18471>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebMethodName hMsg to sMsg
18472>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18472>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sMsg <> "") Begin
18474>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sMsg       to aParams[0]
18475>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move iKeyCode   to aParams[1]
18476>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bShift     to aParams[2]
18477>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bAlt       to aParams[3]
18478>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bCtrl      to aParams[4]
18479>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18479>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "removeKeyHandler" aParams
18480>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18480>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18480>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18481>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18481>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18481>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Will attempt to scroll this UI object into the view. So parent containers will scroll if
18481>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // nessecary to make this element visible.
18481>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ScrollIntoView Boolean bAlignToTop
18483>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18484>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18484>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move bAlignToTop to aParams[0]
18485>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18485>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "scrollIntoView" aParams
18486>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18487>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18487>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18489>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnCloseModalDialog
18490>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18491>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Base class for Ajax Web Objects that model some client-side user interface.
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Supports:
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Properties to control rendering, visible, enabled etc.
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - HTML element support (#ID, Class, etc).
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Common CSS properties (color etc).
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Data binding to DDO server.
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebBaseUIObject is a cWebObject
18493>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18493>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
18497>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18497>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Define_cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18498>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send DefineWebDragDropMixin
18499>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18500>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18500>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol cWebDragDropMixin
18501>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18502>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18502>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines if a control is rendered (if pbRender is true of itself and its parents)
18502>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsControlRendered Returns Boolean
18504>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRendered
18504>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoParent
18504>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18504>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbRender to bRendered
18505>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18505>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bRendered) Begin
18507>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Parent to hoParent
18508>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoParent > 0) Begin
18510>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (IsObjectOfClass(hoParent, RefClass(cWebBaseUIObject))) Begin
18512>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get IsControlRendered of hoParent to bRendered
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bRendered
18514>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18515>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18515>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines if a control is visible (if pbVisible is true of itself and its parents)
18515>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsControlVisible Returns Boolean
18517>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bVisible
18517>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoParent
18517>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18517>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbVisible to bVisible
18518>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18518>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bVisible) Begin
18520>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Parent to hoParent
18521>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoParent > 0) Begin
18523>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (IsObjectOfClass(hoParent, RefClass(cWebBaseUIObject))) Begin
18525>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get IsControlVisible of hoParent to bVisible
18526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
18526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bVisible
18527>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18528>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18528>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines if a control is enabled (if pbEnabled is true of itself and its parents)
18528>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsControlEnabled Returns Boolean
18530>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bEnabled
18530>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoParent
18530>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18530>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbEnabled to bEnabled
18531>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18531>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bEnabled) Begin
18533>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Parent to hoParent
18534>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoParent > 0) Begin
18536>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (IsObjectOfClass(hoParent, RefClass(cWebBaseUIObject))) Begin
18538>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get IsControlEnabled of hoParent to bEnabled
18539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
18539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bEnabled
18540>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18541>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18541>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Augmented to invalidate the accessibility cache for the involved properties
18541>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetSyncProp Handle hoObject Handle hmSetter String sPropName Variant vPropValue
18543>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Invalidate accessibility cache
18543>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbRender) or hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbEnabled) or hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbVisible)) Begin
18545>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Increment giWebAccCacheCtx
18546>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18546>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18546>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18546>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send SetSyncProp hoObject hmSetter sPropName vPropValue
18548>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines if the control is currently accessible. Accessible means that it is a view that
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  is available on the client and it is rendered, visible and enabled. This check takes the 
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  state of parent controls into account, but not for example if the control is on the current 
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  tab page or if the group it is on is expanded.
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  This is used to check if a control should accept server messages and if DEO objects should 
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  communicate with DD's. Because it can be called a lot and the determination goes up in the 
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  object structure and involves server properties this value is cached.
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsControlAccessible Boolean bVerifyEnabled Boolean bVerifyVisibility Returns Boolean
18551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bAccessible
18551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iAccessible
18551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get GetAccessible to iAccessible
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (iAccessible iand C_UIA_InSync) to bAccessible
18553>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18553>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bVerifyEnabled and bAccessible) Begin
18555>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (iAccessible iand C_UIA_Enabled) to bAccessible
18556>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18556>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18556>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bVerifyVisibility and bAccessible) Begin
18558>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (iAccessible iand C_UIA_Rendered and iAccessible iand C_UIA_Visible) to bAccessible
18559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bAccessible
18560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18561>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18561>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines th accessibility which is expressed folded into an integer and can be checked 
18561>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  using IAND.
18561>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GetAccessible Returns Integer
18563>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iAccessible iAccessibleParent
18563>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bVal
18563>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18563>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (piAccessibilityCacheCall(Self) <> giWebAccCacheCtx) Begin
18565>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move C_UIA_InSync to iAccessible
18566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (pbNoAccessibilityCheck(Self)) Begin
18568>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>               Move C_UIA_All to iAccessible
18569>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18569>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18569>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
18570>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbRender to bVal
18571>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bVal) ;                    Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Rendered) to iAccessible
18574>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
18574>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbVisible to bVal
18575>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bVal) ;                    Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Visible) to iAccessible
18578>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
18578>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbEnabled to bVal
18579>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bVal) ;                    Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Enabled) to iAccessible
18582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get GetAccessible to iAccessibleParent
18584>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (iAccessibleParent iand iAccessible) to iAccessible
18585>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18585>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set piAccessibilityCache to iAccessible
18586>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set piAccessibilityCacheCall to giWebAccCacheCtx
18587>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18587>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18587>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18588>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get piAccessibilityCache to iAccessible
18589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iAccessible
18590>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18591>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18591>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  By default UI objects are only accessible if they are visible and enabled.
18591>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AllowServerAction Boolean ByRef bAllow String sMethodName Handle hoMessage Boolean bIsFunction String[] ByRef aParams
18593>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsControlAccessible True True to bAllow
18594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18595>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18595>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // We don't support dragging by default, so just return a blank String
18595>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DragData Returns Variant
18597>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return ""
18598>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18599>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18599>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DropData Returns Variant
18601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlDropData DropData
18601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebControlDropData DropData
18601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJsonData
18601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoJsonDropData to hoJsonData
18602>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoJsonData <> C_WebUnresolvedObject and IsOfJsonType(hoJsonData, jsonTypeObject)) Begin
18604>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbRequireAllMembers of hoJsonData to False
18605>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get JsonToDataType of hoJsonData to DropData
18606>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18606>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18606>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18606>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return DropData
18607>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18608>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18608>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // By default, we only want to support dropping, so we always return false here
18608>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function SupportsDragAction Integer eAction Returns Boolean
18610>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
18611>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function SupportsDropAction Integer eAction Returns Boolean
18614>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eAction = C_WebDropOnControl) Begin
18616>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
18617>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18617>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18617>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18617>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
18618>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18619>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18619>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_Object
18621>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send End_Construct_cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18622>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send End_Construct_Object
18624>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18625>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
