18913>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This adds every parent DDO for the passed DDO to the DEO's list of DDOs to watch.
18913>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // It adds the parents and then does this recursively up the DDO tree.
18913>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This means that this DEO will respond to any DD change for any server. This does not
18913>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure WatchAllParentServers Handle hoDDO
18915>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSrvr
18915>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServer iServers
18915>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoDDO to iServers
18916>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
18922>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18922>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoDDO iServer to hoSrvr
18923>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Watched_Server hoSrvr
18924>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoSrvr
18925>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
18926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18926>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
