18927>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // standard helper used for all verify save, delete, clear confirmation
18927>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure VerifyRequest Handle hmCallBack Handle hmVerifyMsg
18929>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hmVerifyRequest
18929>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get hmVerifyMsg to hmVerifyRequest // this is the verify message for this operation
18930>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If hmVerifyRequest Begin
18932>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if a verify message exists call it passing the callback message
18932>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send hmVerifyRequest hmCallBack
18933>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18933>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18933>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18934>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if no verify message, just execute the callback with a yes
18934>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send hmCallBack cmYes
18935>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18935>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18935>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
