19018>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbDeleteCallbackActive to bActive
19019>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bActive)) Begin
19021>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_WEBAPP_ACCESS_DENIED
19022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19022>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
19023>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
19023>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19023>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebSet pbDeleteCallbackActive to False
19024>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19024>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eConfirmMode=cmYes) Begin
19026>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send RequestDeleteExec
19027>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
