19039>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebSet pbDeleteCallbackActive to True
19040>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send VerifyRequest (RefProc(RequestDeleteCallBack)) (RefFunc(Verify_Delete_Msg))
19041>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
