19044>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
19045>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False to Err
19046>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_Delete to hoServer
19047>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Always clear deleted record
19047>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(err)) Begin
19049>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send RequestClearExec
19050>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send OnViewDeleted hoServer
19051>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
