19259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Shows an info balloon next to the control (below or above) containing HTML.
19259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
19259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Params:
19259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sCssClass   CSS Classname applied to the info balloon for custom styling.
19259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sText       The content of the info balloon (HTML).
19259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
19259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowInfoBalloon String sCssClass String sText Boolean bOptShow
19261>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sCssClass      to aParams[0]
19263>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sText          to aParams[1]
19264>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments >= 3) Begin
19266>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bOptShow   to aParams[2]
19267>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
19267>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19267>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
19268>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move True       to aParams[2]
19269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
19269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "showInfoBalloon" aParams
19270>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
19271>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19271>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19271>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Hides the info balloon shown by ShowInfoBalloon.
19271>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HideInfoBalloon
19273>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "hideInfoBalloon"
19274>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
