19340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  to determine if you are within a DEO control finding obejct and should therefore send a DEO message.
19340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
19340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Deo_Find_Object Returns Boolean
19342>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
