20065>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
20066>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
20067>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoDDO <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
20069>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set File_Field_Changed_Value of hoDDO iFile iField to sValue
