20094>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20094>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // required DD/DEO interface. This is sent from the DD during a save Request_Validate is used to allow
20094>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // fields with DEOs bound to them to do the first validation.  
20094>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Validate_Items Boolean bNotFindReq Returns Integer
20096>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
20096>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoOrigin 
20096>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMode
20096>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // DoAutoFind may do a DD find and reset these modes. Make sure the get restored
20096>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move OPERATION_MODE to iMode
20097>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move OPERATION_ORIGIN to hoOrigin
20098>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send DoAutoFind // we must make sure autofind happens before the validation
20099>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move iMode to OPERATION_MODE
20100>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move hoOrigin to OPERATION_ORIGIN
20101>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get OnValidate to bOk
20102>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (not(bOk))
20103>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
