20104>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20104>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // performs a clear of the DD that owns the Data_File. This can be used to clear a parent
20104>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // field in a view (e.g., salesperson in order view). This is not assigned a hot key by
20104>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default and it is up to the developer to use this. We also use this with autofinds that
20104>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // allow null parents. Also note that there are no data-loss messages sent for this message
20104>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Added as part of null parent support.
20104>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_ClearBindingTable
20106>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
20106>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile
20106>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
20107>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
20108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer and iFile) Begin
20110>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClearForTable of hoServer iFile
20111>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20111>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20111>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20112>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
