20116>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
20117>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer and iFile) Begin
20119>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Which_Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoDD
20120>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Field_RememberedValue of hoDD iField to sValue
20121>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20121>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20121>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20122>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
