20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>Use cWebObjectOwner_mixin.pkg
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// cWebRadio objects act in a co-ordinated way with other radio button objects as a collective "group"
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 1 or more groups of radio buttons can live together in the same container object.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// In a radio button group there is always one button object that is the "master" and the "slaves" in that group
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// are connected to it. Which radio button is the master should be irrelevant to the developer.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// The psValue property of every radio button in a group is synchronized.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A group is defined by creating a master radio button and connecting slave buttons to it. Any button can be
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the master. The master button defines a group name and\or a data binding. The Data Binding and group name
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// is copied to each slave.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A slave can be connected to a master button by...
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// a) Setting the slave's phoMasterRadio property to the master's object handle.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// b) Seting the slave's psGroupName to the same group name as the master radio button.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A radio button cannot change radio groups dynamically. Radio groups are configured at design time and connected
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// at object creation time. Once established, a radio group should not be changed.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// An empty\null psGroupName is allowed. A null group name will be converted into the object name of the radio's
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// container web panel object. All radio buttons with a null psGroupName in the same Web Panel belong to the same group.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Setting a radio button's data binding automatically set's its group name to "table_name.column_name".
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Groups are scoped to their view (or dialog). Button objects of the same group can be defined anywhere within
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the same view. Buttons in one view cannot be grouped to buttons of another view.
20200>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebRadio is a cWebBaseDEO    
20201>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Construct_Object:
20201>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20201>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
20203>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
20205>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20205>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMasterRadio            // Name of the master radio button in this group (can be self). This is either advanced or private interface.
20208>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20208>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoMasterRadio 0         // Object handle to the master radio button in this group (can be self). This is either advanced or private interface.
20209>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20209>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Published Properties....
20209>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMasterName ""
20212>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psGroupName ""           // All radio buttons in a view with this group name belong to the same radio button group
20215>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psRadioValue ""          // This is the unique value for this radio button in its group. When the group's psValue matches psRadioValue then this radio button is selected.  
20218>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbServerOnSelect False  // Determines is the client will initiate an OnSelect event to the server when this radio button is selected.
20221>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnSelect ""      // Client event listner to fire for when this radio object is selected.
20224>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20224>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psCaption ""
20227>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20227>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set pbShowLabel to False
20228>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psJSClass to "df.WebRadio"
20229>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20230>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20230>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20230>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetSelected
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Sets this object as the currently selected radio object in its group.
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Note: during WebApp initialization (while all the Web Objects are being created) then this
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // message will set the design-time psValue, at all other times it will WebSet the client's
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // synchronized psValue.
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bInitWebApp
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20232>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Initializing of (Host(Self)) to bInitWebApp
20233>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bInitWebApp) Begin
20235>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psRadioValue to sValue
20236>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set psValue to sValue
20237>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20237>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20237>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20238>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psRadioValue to sValue
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebSet psValue to sValue
20240>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20240>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20240>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20241>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20241>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20241>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GetSelected Returns Boolean
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Returns True if this radio button is the currently selected radio in its group.
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Note: during WebApp initialization (while all the Web Objects are being created) this
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // message will get the design-time psValue, at all other times it will WebGet the client's
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // synchronized psValue.
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sSelected sValue
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bInitWebApp
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Initializing of (Host(Self)) to bInitWebApp
20244>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bInitWebApp) Begin
20246>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psRadioValue to sSelected
20247>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psValue to sValue
20248>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20248>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20248>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20249>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psRadioValue to sSelected
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psValue to sValue
20251>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20251>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20251>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20251>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (sValue = sSelected)        
20252>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
20253>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20253>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20253>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSelect
20255>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Sent to the radio button that has just been selected by the user at the client. Not sent if the
20255>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // radio button is selected programatically.
20255>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20256>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20256>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20256>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GetSyncProp Handle hoObject Handle hmSetter String sPropName Returns Variant
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Overridden to re-direct WebGet psValue to the master radio button.
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoMasterRadio
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Variant vResult
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sResult sMasterRadio sDynamicObjectId
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamic bFound
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoMasterRadio to hoMasterRadio
20259>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsDynamicObject to bDynamic
20260>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20260>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bDynamic) Begin
20262>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDynamicObjectId to sDynamicObjectId
20263>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
20263>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get FindRadioGroup sDynamicObjectId (&bFound) to tRadioGroup
20264>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20264>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bFound) Begin
20266>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get DynamicObject tRadioGroup.sMaster to hoMasterRadio
20267>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
20267>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20267>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
20268>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat("Radio button %1 was not found.", sDynamicObjectId))
20269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20269>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
20269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20269>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20269>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hmSetter = RefProcSet(psValue) or hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbChanged)) and hoMasterRadio <> Self) Begin
20271>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get GetSyncProp of hoMasterRadio hoMasterRadio hmSetter sPropName to sResult  // get it from the master radio
20272>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return sResult
20273>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20273>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20273>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20274>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Forward Get GetSyncProp hoObject hmSetter sPropName to vResult
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return vResult
20277>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
20278>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20278>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20278>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetSyncProp Handle hoObject Handle hmSetter String sPropName Variant vPropValue
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Overridden to re-direct WebGet psValue to the master radio button.
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoMasterRadio
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sResult sMasterRadio sDynamicObjectId
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamic bFound
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoMasterRadio to hoMasterRadio
