20282>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20282>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bDynamic) Begin
20284>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDynamicObjectId to sDynamicObjectId
20285>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20285>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get FindRadioGroup sDynamicObjectId (&bFound) to tRadioGroup
20286>>>>>>>>>>>>>
