20430>>>>>>>>>    Function AllowAccess Returns Boolean
20432>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk bEnforced
20432>>>>>>>>>        // User hook that is called by the session manager if a call comes in that tries to access 
20432>>>>>>>>>        // this view. Can be used to implement a custom access rights checks for this view.
20432>>>>>>>>>        
20432>>>>>>>>>        // first check with webapp to see if a login is required and we are logged in
20432>>>>>>>>>        // pbLoginModeEnforced can cancel this check, which might be needed with things like login dialogs
20432>>>>>>>>>        Move True to bOk
20433>>>>>>>>>        Get pbLoginModeEnforced to bEnforced
20434>>>>>>>>>        If (bEnforced) Begin
20436>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get ValidLogin to bOk
20438>>>>>>>>>        End 
20438>>>>>>>>>>
20438>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bOk
20439>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
