21011>>>>>>>>>
21011>>>>>>>>>    // AppSycnhing is used to check if this process is in a create
21011>>>>>>>>>    // or client synching state. When True, the application is in an
21011>>>>>>>>>    // initialization state and there may be some things (such as DD events)
21011>>>>>>>>>    // that you don't want to process
21011>>>>>>>>>    Function AppSynching Returns Boolean
21013>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bInitWebApp bSynchronizing
21013>>>>>>>>>        Get pbInitWebApp to bInitWebApp
21014>>>>>>>>>        Get pbSynchronizing to bSynchronizing
21015>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (bInitWebApp or bSynchronizing)
21016>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21017>>>>>>>>>    
21017>>>>>>>>>    // Is used to check if this proces is in a create state. If this is true there are some things 
21017>>>>>>>>>    // (like DD events) that you don't want to process. Note that in most cases you'd want to look 
21017>>>>>>>>>    // at AppSynching.
21017>>>>>>>>>    Function Initializing Returns Boolean
21019>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (pbInitWebApp(Self))
21020>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21021>>>>>>>>>
21021>>>>>>>>>    // This returns the VDF object handle of the server-side object that represents the current
21021>>>>>>>>>    // focused object on the client. If Focus = C_WebUnresolvedObject then there is no focus object.
21021>>>>>>>>>    // The return value is set by CallAction and remains in scope during execution of CallAction.
21021>>>>>>>>>    Function FocusObject Returns Handle
21023>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoFocus
21023>>>>>>>>>        String sFocus
21023>>>>>>>>>        
21023>>>>>>>>>        Get private_psFocus to sFocus
21024>>>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectByName sFocus to hoFocus
21025>>>>>>>>>        
21025>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoFocus
21026>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21027>>>>>>>>>
21027>>>>>>>>>    // returns focus handle if it is a bindable DEO control, else 0
21027>>>>>>>>>    Function DEOControlFocusObject Returns Handle
21029>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoFocus
21029>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsOk
21029>>>>>>>>>        Get DEOFocusObject to hoFocus
21030>>>>>>>>>        If (hoFocus) Begin
21032>>>>>>>>>           Get DEO_Control_Object of hoFocus to bIsOk
21033>>>>>>>>>           If not (bIsOk) Begin
21035>>>>>>>>>               Move 0 to hoFocus
21036>>>>>>>>>           End
21036>>>>>>>>>>
21036>>>>>>>>>        End
21036>>>>>>>>>>
21036>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoFocus
21037>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21038>>>>>>>>>
21038>>>>>>>>>    // returns focus handle if it is a bindable DEO control, else 0
21038>>>>>>>>>    Function DEOFocusObject Returns Handle
21040>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoFocus
21040>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsOk
21040>>>>>>>>>        Get FocusObject to hoFocus
21041>>>>>>>>>        If (hoFocus) Begin
21043>>>>>>>>>           Get DEO_Object of hoFocus to bIsOk
21044>>>>>>>>>           If not (bIsOk) Begin
21046>>>>>>>>>               Move 0 to hoFocus
