21047>>>>>>>>>>
21047>>>>>>>>>        End
21047>>>>>>>>>>
21047>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoFocus
21048>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21049>>>>>>>>>
21049>>>>>>>>>    // Server-Action
21049>>>>>>>>>    //
21049>>>>>>>>>    // Server action that is called by the JavaScript engine opun initialization. It makes sure 
21049>>>>>>>>>    // that the object definitions of the global object and the initial view (phoLoginView or 
21049>>>>>>>>>    // phoDefaultView) including its DDO state. Also makes sure that translations are sent to the 
21049>>>>>>>>>    // client.
21049>>>>>>>>>    //
21049>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
21049>>>>>>>>>    //  bLoadInitial     If true (or not passed) the default (or login) view is loaded immediately 
21049>>>>>>>>>    //          and sent to the client. If displayView is used on the client this will be false.
21049>>>>>>>>>    // Returns:
21049>>>>>>>>>    //      The name of the initial view or dialog.
21049>>>>>>>>>    Function LoadWebApp Boolean bLoadInitial Returns String
21051>>>>>>>>>        String[] asBrowserLanguages asParams
21053>>>>>>>>>        Integer eAppStyle iBrowserTimezoneOffset iWidth iHeight
21053>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsLoggedIn bAllowAccess bOverrideState bOnResize
21053>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoView hoDefaultView hjObjectDef hjTranslations
21053>>>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue[] aTranslations
21053>>>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue[] aTranslations
21054>>>>>>>>>        
21054>>>>>>>>>        //  Trigger event allowing application to initialize things based on the client locales
21054>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pasBrowserLanguages to asBrowserLanguages
21055>>>>>>>>>        WebGet piBrowserTimezoneOffset to iBrowserTimezoneOffset
21056>>>>>>>>>        
21056>>>>>>>>>        Send OnInitializeLocales (If(SizeOfArray(asBrowserLanguages) > 0, asBrowserLanguages[0], "")) iBrowserTimezoneOffset
21057>>>>>>>>>        
21057>>>>>>>>>        //  Load translations (mark as 'early' client action so it executes before anything else)
21057>>>>>>>>>        Get ClientTranslations to aTranslations
21058>>>>>>>>>        Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hjTranslations
21059>>>>>>>>>        Send DataTypeToJson of hjTranslations aTranslations 
21060>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientActionEarly "initTranslations" asParams hjTranslations
21061>>>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hjTranslations
21062>>>>>>>>>        
21062>>>>>>>>>        //  Trigger resize event
21062>>>>>>>>>        Get pbServerOnResizeWindow to bOnResize
21063>>>>>>>>>        If (bOnResize) Begin
21065>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piWindowWidth to iWidth
21066>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piWindowHeight to iHeight
21067>>>>>>>>>            
21067>>>>>>>>>            Send OnResizeWindow iWidth iHeight
21068>>>>>>>>>        End
21068>>>>>>>>>>
21068>>>>>>>>>        
21068>>>>>>>>>        //  Serialize Global Objects
21068>>>>>>>>>        Get SerializeObject to hjObjectDef
21069>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientActionEarly "createWebApp" asParams hjObjectDef 
21070>>>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hjObjectDef
21071>>>>>>>>>        
21071>>>>>>>>>        WebSet pbIsLoaded to True
21072>>>>>>>>>        
21072>>>>>>>>>        If (bLoadInitial) Begin
21074>>>>>>>>>            Send Load_InitialView
21075>>>>>>>>>        End
21075>>>>>>>>>>
21075>>>>>>>>>         
21075>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return ""
21076>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21077>>>>>>>>>    
21077>>>>>>>>>    //  Empty stub, called from loadWebApp, implemented in cWebViewHost_mixin
21077>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Load_InitialView
21079>>>>>>>>>        
21079>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21080>>>>>>>>>    
21080>>>>>>>>>    //  Empty stub, implemented in cWebSessionHost_mixin
21080>>>>>>>>>    Function ValidLogin Returns Boolean
21082>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True        
21083>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21084>>>>>>>>>    
21084>>>>>>>>>    // Determines if web objects in this scope have been loaded to the client.
21084>>>>>>>>>    Function IsLoaded Returns Boolean
21086>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bLoaded
21086>>>>>>>>>        
21086>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbIsLoaded to bLoaded
21087>>>>>>>>>        
21087>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bLoaded
21088>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21089>>>>>>>>>    
21089>>>>>>>>>
21089>>>>>>>>>    // Client Actions: Sends an error to the client so it can be displayed.
21089>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowError Integer iErrNum Integer iErrLine String sErrText String sCaption Boolean bUserError
21091>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
21092>>>>>>>>>        
21092>>>>>>>>>        Move iErrNum    to aParams[0]
21093>>>>>>>>>        Move iErrLine   to aParams[1]
21094>>>>>>>>>        Move sErrText   to aParams[2]
21095>>>>>>>>>        Move sCaption   to aParams[3]
21096>>>>>>>>>        Move bUserError to aParams[4]
21097>>>>>>>>>        
21097>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "showError" aParams
21098>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure    
21099>>>>>>>>>
21099>>>>>>>>>    // Returns the translations in an array of name value structs. The translations are currently 
21099>>>>>>>>>    // coming from the symbols which means that they are replaced at compile time. Augment this 
21099>>>>>>>>>    // method to add additional translations.
21099>>>>>>>>>    Function ClientTranslations Returns tWebNameValue[]
21101>>>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue[] aTranslations
21101>>>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue[] aTranslations
21102>>>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue Trans
21102>>>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue Trans
21102>>>>>>>>>        
21102>>>>>>>>>        //  Generic                 
21102>>>>>>>>>        Move "ok"                   to Trans.sN
21103>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$OK                  to Trans.sV
21104>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21105>>>>>>>>>                                    
21105>>>>>>>>>        Move "cancel"               to Trans.sN
21106>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Cancel              to Trans.sV
21107>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21108>>>>>>>>>                                    
21108>>>>>>>>>        Move "yes"                  to Trans.sN
21109>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Yes                 to Trans.sV
21110>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21111>>>>>>>>>        
21111>>>>>>>>>        Move "no"                   to Trans.sN
21112>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$No                  to Trans.sV
21113>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21114>>>>>>>>>                                    
21114>>>>>>>>>        Move "search"               to Trans.sN
21115>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Search              to Trans.sV
21116>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21117>>>>>>>>>                                    
21117>>>>>>>>>        Move "loading"              to Trans.sN
21118>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Loading             to Trans.sV
21119>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21120>>>>>>>>>                                    
21120>>>>>>>>>        Move "back"                 to Trans.sN
21121>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Back                to Trans.sV
21122>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21123>>>>>>>>>                                    
21123>>>>>>>>>        //  Calendar                
21123>>>>>>>>>        Move "todayIs"              to Trans.sN
21124>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$TodayIs             to Trans.sV
21125>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21126>>>>>>>>>                                    
21126>>>>>>>>>        Move "wk"                   to Trans.sN
21127>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Wk                  to Trans.sV
21128>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21129>>>>>>>>>        
21129>>>>>>>>>        //  Months short            
21129>>>>>>>>>        Move "jan"                  to Trans.sN
21130>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Jan                 to Trans.sV
21131>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21132>>>>>>>>>                                    
21132>>>>>>>>>        Move "feb"                  to Trans.sN
21133>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Feb                 to Trans.sV
21134>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21135>>>>>>>>>                                    
21135>>>>>>>>>        Move "mar"                  to Trans.sN
21136>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Mar                 to Trans.sV
21137>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21138>>>>>>>>>                                    
21138>>>>>>>>>        Move "apr"                  to Trans.sN
21139>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Apr                 to Trans.sV
21140>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21141>>>>>>>>>        //  May is not shorter than May
21141>>>>>>>>>        Move "mayShort"             to Trans.sN   
21142>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$MayShort            to Trans.sV
21143>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21144>>>>>>>>>                                    
21144>>>>>>>>>        Move "jun"                  to Trans.sN
21145>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Jun                 to Trans.sV
21146>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21147>>>>>>>>>                                    
21147>>>>>>>>>        Move "jul"                  to Trans.sN
21148>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Jul                 to Trans.sV
21149>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21150>>>>>>>>>                                    
21150>>>>>>>>>        Move "aug"                  to Trans.sN
21151>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Aug                 to Trans.sV
21152>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21153>>>>>>>>>                                    
21153>>>>>>>>>        Move "sep"                  to Trans.sN
21154>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Sep                 to Trans.sV
21155>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21156>>>>>>>>>                                    
21156>>>>>>>>>        Move "oct"                  to Trans.sN
21157>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Oct                 to Trans.sV
21158>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
21159>>>>>>>>>                                    
21159>>>>>>>>>        Move "nov"                  to Trans.sN
21160>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Nov                 to Trans.sV
21161>>>>>>>>>        Move Trans                  to aTranslations[-1]
