21339>>>>>>>>>    // Called as the last step of the initialization of the webapp just before pbInitWebApp becomes
21339>>>>>>>>>    // false. At this point the web property system should be initialized and configuration options
21339>>>>>>>>>    // (like pbLocking of phoServerPropStore) can be set here.
21339>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnPostInitialize
