21342>>>>>>>>>    // Called during the creation of the webapp object. For FlexTron this is called later to 
21342>>>>>>>>>    // synchronize better with windows controls. Note that Attach_Deo_To_Server should be broadcasted
21342>>>>>>>>>    // before this method is called.
21342>>>>>>>>>    Procedure FinishWebObjectInitialize
21344>>>>>>>>>        Broadcast Recursive Send AfterAttachDDO         // Received by all data-bound DEOs after DDO properties are applied (or not).
21346>>>>>>>>>        
21346>>>>>>>>>        Send OnPostInitialize
