21415>>>>>>>>>    // Returns the collection of DDO object name and RowID pairs for the view's DDO structure.
21415>>>>>>>>>    // The collection is specially ordered so that the first DDO is the view's Main DD, followed
21415>>>>>>>>>    // by the child DDO sub-tree, then the parent DDO sub-tree. This is the order that you want
21415>>>>>>>>>    // to traverse the DDO tree when synchronizing each server DDO to the client RowIDs.
21415>>>>>>>>>    Procedure StoreDDOStates
21417>>>>>>>>>        Integer i icDDO iFile
21417>>>>>>>>>        RowID riRowID
21417>>>>>>>>>        String sCheck
21417>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamicConstraints
21417>>>>>>>>>        Integer iSrvr iSrvrs
21417>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServerDD
21417>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTable
21417>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSwitched
21417>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aDDOHandles
21418>>>>>>>>>        tWebDDODef tDDODef
21418>>>>>>>>>        tWebDDODef tDDODef
21418>>>>>>>>>        
21418>>>>>>>>>        Get IsDynamicConstraints to bDynamicConstraints
21419>>>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName to tDDODef.sView
21420>>>>>>>>>        
21420>>>>>>>>>        Get paDDOHandlesTree to aDDOHandles
21421>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aDDOHandles)) to icDDO
21422>>>>>>>>>        
21422>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (icDDO - 1)
21428>>>>>>>>>>
21428>>>>>>>>>            Get CurrentRowId of aDDOHandles[i] to riRowID
21429>>>>>>>>>            Move (SerializeRowID(riRowID)) to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].sRowID
21430>>>>>>>>>            Get DDIdentity aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].sName
21431>>>>>>>>>            Get pDDDefaults of aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aRemembered 
21432>>>>>>>>>            If (bDynamicConstraints) Begin
21434>>>>>>>>>                Get Constrain_File of aDDOHandles[i] to iFile
21435>>>>>>>>>            End
21435>>>>>>>>>>
21435>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
21436>>>>>>>>>                Move -1 to iFile
21437>>>>>>>>>            End
21437>>>>>>>>>>
21437>>>>>>>>>            Move iFile to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].iConstrainFile
21438>>>>>>>>>
21438>>>>>>>>>            // DD changed_state and parent changed state info
21438>>>>>>>>>            Get Changed_State of aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].bChanged
21439>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server_Count of aDDOHandles[i] to iSrvrs
21440>>>>>>>>>            For iSrvr from 0 to (iSrvrs-1)
21446>>>>>>>>>>
21446>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Set_Server of aDDOHandles[i] iSrvr to hoServerDD
21447>>>>>>>>>                Get Main_File of hoServerDD to iTable
21448>>>>>>>>>                Move iTable to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aParentChanged[iSrvr].iTable
21449>>>>>>>>>                Get ParentDDOSwitched of aDDOHandles[i] iTable to bSwitched
21450>>>>>>>>>                Move bSwitched to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aParentChanged[iSrvr].bSwitched 
21451>>>>>>>>>            Loop
21452>>>>>>>>>>
21452>>>>>>>>>
21452>>>>>>>>>                        
21452>>>>>>>>>        Loop
21453>>>>>>>>>>
21453>>>>>>>>>            
21453>>>>>>>>>        Move True to tDDODef.bA
21454>>>>>>>>>        
21454>>>>>>>>>        WebSet ptDDOStates to tDDODef
21455>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
