22200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Used for storing non-scalar (advanced) synchronized properties during the AJAX Call. Next
22200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// to the tWebAdvSyncProp struct known by the client it also keeps track of 
22200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// changes and caches the deserialized value in a variant for repeative access.
