22473>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22473>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Adds a new advanced sync prop to the cache.
22473>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22473>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function AddToAdvPropCache Handle hoObj String sPropName Returns Integer
22475>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iNew iStoreIndex
22475>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebCacheAdvProp tNew
22475>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebCacheAdvProp tNew
22475>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22475>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get piStoreIndex to iStoreIndex
22476>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22476>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move hoObj                  to tNew.hoObj
22477>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName of hoObj  to tNew.tSvrProp.sO
22478>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sPropName              to tNew.tSvrProp.sP
22479>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move tNew.tSvrProp.sO       to tNew.tSyncProp.sO
22480>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move tNew.tSvrProp.sP      to tNew.tSyncProp.sP
22481>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False                  to tNew.bChanged
22482>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False                  to tNew.bDeserialized
22483>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22483>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex])) to iNew
22484>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move tNew to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iNew]
22485>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22485>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iNew
22486>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
