22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Singleton object that is the central manager for all web properties handlers. It is accessed by
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the cWebApp class when needed and WebSet and WebGet are handled here. It has forwards these 
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>// operations to the handler objects for the different web property types. These handlers are 
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>// created by this class and all share a generic API (cWebBasePropertyHandler). These different types 
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>// are Client (web properties stored and used on the client), Server (web properties stored on the 
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>// server bound to the page scope) and ServerSession (web properties stored on the server bound to 
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the session lifetime).
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22532>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebPropertyHost_mixin is a Mixin
22533>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_cWebPropertyHost_mixin
22535>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22535>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psSPKey ""                     // Web property storing the identifier key for server-side properties with a page lifetime
22538>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22538>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Initialize and store handles to the three different handlers
