22594>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppNotWebObject, sObject, "WebSet " + pubProp.sName, C_NewLine+C_NewLine))
22595>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
