23748>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Attach_Deo_To_Server
23750>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt
23750>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iValue
23750>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23750>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Attach_Deo_To_Server
23752>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23752>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // after DEO is attached, set the prompt button automatically (if needed)
23752>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbPromptButton to iValue
23753>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23753>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
23755>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get PromptObject to hoPrompt
