23760>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23760>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AfterAttachDDO
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Sent after each DEO Object has been attached to its DDO server and had all the DDO field settings
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // applied to its published properties. We will set default values to any cWebControl properties that
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // are still unassigned...
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iValue eDataType iPrecision
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sInputMode
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send AfterAttachDDO
23764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Determine sInputMode
23764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get peDataType to eDataType
23765>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get psInputMode to sInputMode
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eDataType = typeNumber and sInputMode = "") Begin
23768>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get piPrecision to iPrecision
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iPrecision > 0) Begin
23771>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set psInputMode to "decimal"
23772>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23772>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23772>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
23773>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set psInputMode to "numeric"
23774>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23774>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23774>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23774>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23774>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23774>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Correct pbPromptButton
23774>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbPromptButton to iValue
23775>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23775>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
23777>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbPromptButton to False
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
