23783>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // returns PromptObject. If phoPrompt is set, it returns this, else checks with DD for web prompt object
23783>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function PromptObject Returns Handle
23785>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt hoDD
23785>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
23785>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eStyle
