23786>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eStyle = wvsDesktop or eStyle=wvsDialog) Begin
23788>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get phoPrompt to hoPrompt
23789>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoPrompt=0) Begin
23791>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_File to iFile
23792>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Field to iField
23793>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Server to hoDD
23794>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (iFile and hoDD) Begin
23796>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get File_Field_WebPrompt_Object of hoDD iFile iField to hoPrompt
23797>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
23797>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23797>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23797>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23797>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23797>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23797>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoPrompt
