23958>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
23958>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Required DD/DEO interface. Indicates that this DEO understands the DEO Request_Find protocol
23958>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DEO_Find_Object Returns Boolean
23960>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
23961>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
23962>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
23962>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Used to determine if the object understands the DEO interface.
23962>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Probably not used in Ajax WebApps.
23962>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DEO_Object Returns Boolean
23964>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
