23966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
23966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This only gets called when the developer is killing this object. During application
23966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // shut-down, only destroy_object is called. This augmentation destroys the watched broadcaster
23966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // (which is sitting on the desktop). During program shut down we don't care if this is called
23966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // because it is getting destroyed anyway. We are making the assumption that a developer controlled
23966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // destroy will always be called with the watcher still existing.
23966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Destroy
23968>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoWatched
23968>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Changed_State to False //   is this really needed anymore???
23969>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // if non 0, The watched server, must still exist.
23969>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Watched_Servers to hoWatched
23970>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If hoWatched Begin
23972>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Broadcast_State of hoWatched to False
23973>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Destroy of hoWatched     // destroy the broadcaster
23974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // if non 0, The bound watched server, must still exist.
23974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ChangedStateWatched_Servers to hoWatched
23975>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If hoWatched Begin
23977>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Broadcast_State of hoWatched to False
23978>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Destroy of hoWatched     // destroy the broadcaster
23979>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23979>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23979>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Destroy
23981>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
23982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
23982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Required DD/DEO interface
23982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // sent by DD before a find and save. We only care about DD finds which
23982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // means DoAll is 1
23982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Entry_Update Integer iFile Integer iDoAll
23984>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   This procedure scans the fields of this object's items to determine
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   what other database agents (data_sets) other than this object's Server
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   should be 'watched' (for data changes).
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   iTableFlag is a boolean determining whether this object relies on a
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   prototype row (TRUE) or an item list (FALSE).
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   [JVH] VDF 17.0 - Ignored in this class.
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   This object must understand pbDataBindable, and have a private
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   boolean property named Private_pbServersScanned to note the event.
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Notes
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   This procedure is invoked once per object, the first time the object
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   is activated.  If the data_file, data_field, and/or main_file of this
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   object are changed (don't change them while this object is active!),
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   set Private_pbServersScanned to FALSE to force this object to scan
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   again (when it is next activated).
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // 17.0: The logic has been retooled to add more watched servers to the DDOs. This is done so
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // DD operations will send Refresh to these additional watched-servers. There are two changes:
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // 1. Containers are now made watched servers for the Server and all parent servers
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // 2. Non-file.field DEOs (e.g., expressions) are made watched servers for the server (which it
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //    already did and for all parent servers. Without this, parent entry_item expressions were not
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //    getting updated
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Here is how watched-servers works.
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Each DEO attaches and detaches from its Server by sending Add_User_interface and Remove_User_interface
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // to the server DD. Once attached, the DD knows about this DEO and sends messages to it as needed (Refresh,
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Entry_Update, etc.). In addition, a DEO may need to attach a parent DDO so that changes in that parent DD
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // results in those messages being sent. This is needed if the binding table in entry_item refers to a parent
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // table. So we need to send Add_User_interface and Remove_User_interface to that parent server as well. If a DEO
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // has multiple, there could be multiple parent servers. As of 17.0, we are also attaching to parent servers if
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // we are unsure about how the DEO is being used. If an expression is used, it might need to be updated when
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // a parent (or any ancestor) changes. Each DEO keeps track of servers that it attaches to and this is referred
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // to as the watched_server list. This list is maintained so the DEO knows which DDOs to attach and detach to.
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // [JVH] VDF 17.1 cWebAppDEOServer_mixin Notes:
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // - Modified to support only 1 item per control. Get Item_Count interface not supported.
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // - Modified to not support the Prototype_Object interface (old windows Table class).
23985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Find_Servers_To_Watch Integer iTableFlag
23987>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFileNum iServerFile
23987>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoDataSet
23987>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataBindable
23987>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
23987>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbDataBindable to bDataBindable
23988>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Private_pbServersScanned to True
23989>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
23990>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
23990>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer = 0) Begin
23992>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
23993>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23993>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23993>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
23993>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Delete_Watched_Servers  // empty Watched_Servers broadcaster first
23994>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File of hoServer to iServerFile  // data-set's main-file
23995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
23995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bDataBindable)) Begin
23997>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // containers should get added to all parent DDOs
23997>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoServer
23998>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
23999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
23999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFileNum
24000>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // we need watched server if file exists, it is not the main file
24000>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // and is not an updating file (as opposed to updating data-set).
24000>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iFileNum > 0 and iFileNum <> iServerFile) Begin
24002>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Which_Data_Set of hoServer iFileNum to hoDataSet
24003>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoDataSet <> 0 and hoDataSet <> hoServer) Begin
24005>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Add_Watched_Server hoDataSet
24006>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Add_ChangedStateWatched_Server hoDataSet
24007>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
24007>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24007>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24007>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24007>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else If (iFileNum = 0) Begin
24010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if no file (e.g., expression) we don't know when it changes so we tell all servers
24010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // that this is a watcher
24010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoServer
24011>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24011>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24011>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
24012>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
24012>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This function returns the object id of the database agent of this object,
24012>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // or 0.
24012>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Locate_Server Returns Integer
24014>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
24014>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
24015>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoServer
24016>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
24017>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
