24115>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This adds every parent DDO for the passed DDO to the DEO's list of DDOs to watch.
24115>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // It adds the parents and then does this recursively up the DDO tree.
24115>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This means that this DEO will respond to any DD change for any server. This does not
24115>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure WatchAllParentServers Handle hoDDO
24117>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSrvr
24117>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServer iServers
24117>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoDDO to iServers
24118>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
24124>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24124>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoDDO iServer to hoSrvr
24125>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Watched_Server hoSrvr
24126>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoSrvr
24127>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
24128>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24128>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
