24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Sent by DDO when there is a clear/find/save/delete.
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This should Set all necessary web properties of the control
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // For example pbEnabled.
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // eMode - Determines the type of DDO operation which generated this refresh message. 
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         It may be one of the following:
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Clear:             Used only for DEOs attached to the DDO that was the
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 "origin" of a Clear operation, (i.e., the DDO received
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 the original Clear message). All other DDOs Send their 
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 DEOs the refresh message passing mode_find_or_clear_set.  
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set: Used for DEOs attached to DDOs which have Found and/or cleared records.  
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Clear_All:         Used for DEOs attached to any DDO that participated in a clear_all operation.  
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Delete:            Used for DEOs attached to any DDO that performed a successful deletion. 
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 DDOs that were merely updated as the result of a deletion Use Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set.  
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Save:              Used for DEOs attached to any DDO involved in a successful Save operation. 
24200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Refresh Integer eMode
24202>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
24203>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
24203>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // helper function returns true if any child DDO relates to this
24203>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsConstrainingParent Handle hoDDO Returns Boolean
24205>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iClients i iFile
24205>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoClient
24205>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRelates
24205>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File of hoDDO to iFile
24206>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Client_Count of hoDDO to iClients
24207>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (iClients-1)
24213>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24213>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Client of hoDDO i to hoClient
24214>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get IsRelatesToConstrained of hoClient iFile to bRelates
24215>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If bRelates Begin
24217>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return True
24218>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
24218>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24218>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
24219>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24219>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
24220>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
24221>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
24221>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Find Integer eFindMode
24223>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Generic request find method for handling Request_Find
24223>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // eFindMode - Can be one of... lt, le, eq, ge, gt, or it may be either Next_Record, First_Record, or Last_Record
24223>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iField iFile iMainIndex
24223>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
24223>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24223>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
24224>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24224>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer <> 0) Begin
24226>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_File to iFile
24227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iField
24228>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
24228>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iFile > 0) Begin
24230>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Item_Find to hoServer eFindMode iFile iField True False False   // Entry Update = True, Show find error = True, Deferred State = False
24231>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
24231>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24231>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24231>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24231>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
