24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // performs a clear of the DD that owns the Data_File. This can be used to clear a parent
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // field in a view (e.g., salesperson in order view). This is not assigned a hot key by
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default and it is up to the developer to use this. We also use this with autofinds that
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // allow null parents. Also note that there are no data-loss messages sent for this message
24235>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Added as part of null parent support.
