24241>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClearForTable of hoServer iFile
24242>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24242>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24242>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
