24525>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aItems)) to iItemIndex
24526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24526>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
24528>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get piFindIndex to iIndex
24529>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbCaseSensitive to bCase
24530>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
24530>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_TYPE of iFile iField to eType
24533>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_LENGTH of iFile iField to iLength
24536>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_PRECISION of iFile iField to iDec
24539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
24539>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (iLength - iDec) to iLength
24540>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
