24593>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If (bScanAll or bFilterApplied) Begin
24595>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Move False to bBreak
24596>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
24596>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24596>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Else Begin
24597>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Move True to bBreak
24598>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
24598>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24598>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If (bBreak and eType = DF_BCD and Length(sFilter) < iLength) Begin
24600>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Move (GetRowID(iFile)) to riTest
24601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        
24601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Repeat
24601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Move (sFilter + "0") to sFilter
24602>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            If (Length(sFilter) >= iLength) ;                                Break
24605>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            
24605>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Set_Field_Value iFile iField to sFilter
24608>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Send Request_Read of hoServer GE iFile iIndex
24609>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Move (IsSameRowID(riTest, GetRowID(iFile))) to bBreak
24610>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Until (not(bBreak))
24612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End                    
24612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
24612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Request_Read of hoServer GT iFile iIndex
24613>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Loop
24614>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24614>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (not(Found) or bBreak) to bLast
24615>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
24616>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send DisregardFilterExpression hoServer sOrigFilter bOrigActive bFilterApplied
24617>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24617>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
