25105>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sRowId to tCustomItem.sRowId
25106>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sText to tCustomItem.aValues[0]
25107>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move "Sugg_ControlSuggestion" to tCustomItem.sCssClassName 
25108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move tCustomItem to aItems[-1]
25109>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25110>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25110>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function HasAdvancedSearchPrompt Returns Boolean
25112>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebForwardPath[] aNavInfo
25112>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebForwardPath[] aNavInfo
25113>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt
25113>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25113>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get PromptObject to hoPrompt
25114>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoPrompt) Begin
25116>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
25117>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25117>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25117>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
