25298>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RemoveTag String sTag
25300>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aTags
25301>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bCaseSensitive
25301>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer i
25301>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25301>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get GetTags to aTags
25302>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbCaseSensitive to bCaseSensitive
25303>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25303>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bCaseSensitive)) ;            Move (Uppercase(sTag)) to sTag
25306>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
25306>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (SizeOfArray(aTags) - 1)
25312>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25312>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If ((bCaseSensitive and aTags[i]= sTag) or (not(bCaseSensitive) and Uppercase(aTags[i]) = sTag)) Begin
25314>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move (RemoveFromArray(aTags, i)) to aTags
25315>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Decrement i
25316>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
25316>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25316>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
25317>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25317>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25317>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send UpdateTags aTags
25318>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
