25937>>>>>>>>>>>>
25937>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25938>>>>>>>>>>>    
25938>>>>>>>>>>>    
25938>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Called by the list / grid to determine the field value details based on the current 
25938>>>>>>>>>>>    //  environment values (global buffer or properties). It fills the tWebCell struct that is 
25938>>>>>>>>>>>    //  passed by reference with details needed by the JavaScript Engine to render the cell.
25938>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure LoadGridCell tWebCell ByRef tCell
25940>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
25940>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
25940>>>>>>>>>>>        
25940>>>>>>>>>>>
25940>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
25941>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
25942>>>>>>>>>>>        
25942>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iFile <> 0) Begin
25944>>>>>>>>>>>            //  Security check
25944>>>>>>>>>>>            If (FillDEOAllowed(Self)) Begin            
25946>>>>>>>>>>>                // If there is a data binding then get the file.field value....
25946>>>>>>>>>>>                Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sValue
25949>>>>>>>>>>>            End
25949>>>>>>>>>>>>
25949>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25949>>>>>>>>>>>>
25949>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
25950>>>>>>>>>>>            // if there is no data binding then fire the calculated field event....
25950>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psValue to sValue
25951>>>>>>>>>>>            Send OnSetCalculatedValue (&sValue)         // calculated value
25952>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25952>>>>>>>>>>>>
25952>>>>>>>>>>>
25952>>>>>>>>>>>        // Convert the value into the correct format for transport....                    
25952>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Trim(sValue)) to sValue                                            // make sure the value is trimmed
25953>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ConvertToTransport (RefFunc(psValue)) sValue cArgStr  to sValue
