27226>>>>>>>>>    // Client action that triggers the grid to send the entire set of data in a separate request. 
27226>>>>>>>>>    // This request is handled by HandleProcessDataSet and triggers the OnProcessDataSet event that 
27226>>>>>>>>>    // should be implemented to save / process the data of the grid.
27226>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ProcessDataSet Integer eOperation
27228>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
27229>>>>>>>>>        
27229>>>>>>>>>        Move eOperation to aParams[0]
27230>>>>>>>>>        
27230>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "processDataSet" aParams
27231>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27232>>>>>>>>>    
27232>>>>>>>>>    // Published method that is called by the client to save the entire set of data. It gets the 
27232>>>>>>>>>    // action data and triggers the OnProcessDataSet event.
27232>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HandleProcessDataSet Integer eOperation Integer iSelectedRowIndex
27234>>>>>>>>>        tWebRow[] aData
27234>>>>>>>>>        tWebRow[] aData
27235>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
27235>>>>>>>>>        
27235>>>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
27236>>>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to aData
27237>>>>>>>>>        
27237>>>>>>>>>        Send OnProcessDataSet aData eOperation iSelectedRowIndex
27238>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
27239>>>>>>>>>    
27239>>>>>>>>>    // Event that is called by the client grid class to pass the entire set of data that the grid 
27239>>>>>>>>>    // was working on. Implement this event to store all the grid data at once. Use the ProcessDataSet
27239>>>>>>>>>    // method to trigger this event.
27239>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnProcessDataSet tWebRow[] aData Integer eOperation Integer iSelectedRowIndex
27241>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
