27923>>>>>>>    // returns true if this should use dynamic constraints. By default
27923>>>>>>>    // desktop views never use this and probably never should.
27923>>>>>>>    // Drilldown views do use this but there may be times you'd want to stop this
27923>>>>>>>    // in which case you's set pbDrillDownDynamicConstraints to true. 
27923>>>>>>>    Function IsDynamicConstraints Returns Boolean
27925>>>>>>>        Integer eWebViewStyle
27925>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamicConstraints
27925>>>>>>>        Get peWebViewStyle to eWebViewStyle
27926>>>>>>>        Get pbDrillDownDynamicConstraints to bDynamicConstraints
27927>>>>>>>        Function_Return (eWebViewStyle = wvsDrillDown and bDynamicConstraints)
27928>>>>>>>    End_Function
