27929>>>>>>>    // We provide this because NavigateData is an important web property and these
27929>>>>>>>    // two messages can be accessed via delegation (which WebGet|WebSet pNavigateData cannot).
27929>>>>>>>    Function GetNavigateData Returns tWebNavigateData
27931>>>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
27931>>>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
27931>>>>>>>        WebGet pNavigateData to NavigateData
