29241>>>>>>>// This class is the main entry point for Web Framework WebApps. It handles the HTTP API requests
29241>>>>>>>// that come in from the JavaScript Engine. The initial parsing and validation is done here before
29241>>>>>>>// the request is forwarded to the cWebApp for further handling. 
