29278>>>>>>>        Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hoJson
29279>>>>>>>        Send InitializeJsonType of hoJson jsonTypeObject
29280>>>>>>>        
29280>>>>>>>        Send SetMemberValue of hoJson "errorCode" jsonTypeString "soap:Server"
