29658>>>>>>>>>// This class is capable of parsing multipart/form-data requests. These requests are used to post
29658>>>>>>>>>// binary data and usually files. The WAF file upload uses this class. Because it works in chunks
29658>>>>>>>>>// are used this class is capable of handling large files. The main implementation is in the
29658>>>>>>>>>// cWebHttpMultipartFormdataHandler_mixin so it can also be used by other classes like
29658>>>>>>>>>// cLocalWebResourceManagerProxy.
