30374>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Generates random data.
30374>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GenerateRandom Integer iBytes Returns UChar[]
30376>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hProv
30376>>>>>>>>>>>        UChar[] uaResult
30377>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRes
30377>>>>>>>>>>>        
30377>>>>>>>>>>>        Get AcquireContext to hProv
30378>>>>>>>>>>>        
30378>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(uaResult, iBytes)) to uaResult
30379>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (CryptGenRandom(hProv, iBytes, AddressOf(uaResult))) to bRes
30380>>>>>>>>>>>        
30380>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ReleaseContext hProv to bRes
30381>>>>>>>>>>>        
30381>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return uaResult
30382>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
