30424>>>>>>>>>    // User hook to manage what to do when creating a new client/server session. By default
30424>>>>>>>>>    // the system will create a globally unique identifier GUID as a new session key.
30424>>>>>>>>>    // This is called automatically during LoadWebApp and the session key is passed back to the 
30424>>>>>>>>>    // client.
30424>>>>>>>>>    // sRemoteAddress - Is the IP address of the client.
30424>>>>>>>>>    // Returns        - The new session key.
30424>>>>>>>>>    Function CreateSession String sRemoteAddress Returns String
30426>>>>>>>>>        String sSessionKey
30426>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoCryptRandom
30426>>>>>>>>>        Integer iLength
30426>>>>>>>>>        
30426>>>>>>>>>        Get piSessionKeyLength to iLength
30427>>>>>>>>>        
30427>>>>>>>>>        //  Generate a random key (slightly too long)
30427>>>>>>>>>        Get phoRandomizer to hoCryptRandom
30428>>>>>>>>>        Get GenerateRandomString of hoCryptRandom (iLength + 10) to sSessionKey
30429>>>>>>>>>        
30429>>>>>>>>>        //  Clear out special characters as these might cause issues with older browsers and ASP Classic, and then cut to the proper length
30429>>>>>>>>>        Move (Left(Replaces("+", Replaces("/", sSessionKey, ""), ""), iLength)) to sSessionKey
30430>>>>>>>>>        
30430>>>>>>>>>        Set psSessionKey to sSessionKey
30431>>>>>>>>>        
30431>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sSessionKey
30432>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
