30469>>>>>>>>>    // Returns     - True if the session key is valid and the AJAX call can continue.
30469>>>>>>>>>    Function ValidateSession String sSessionKey Returns Boolean
30471>>>>>>>>>        If (Length(sSessionKey) = piSessionKeyLength(Self)) Begin
30473>>>>>>>>>            Set psSessionKey to sSessionKey
30474>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
30475>>>>>>>>>        End
30475>>>>>>>>>>
30475>>>>>>>>>        
30475>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
30476>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
