30860>>>>>>>>>    
30860>>>>>>>>>
30860>>>>>>>>>    
30860>>>>>>>>>    //
30860>>>>>>>>>    //  Stores the serialized property values for the specified scope. Creates a new record if it
30860>>>>>>>>>    //  doesn't exist. Immediately unlocks and updates expiration date.
30860>>>>>>>>>    //
30860>>>>>>>>>    //  Params:
30860>>>>>>>>>    //      sKey        Key for the scope.
30860>>>>>>>>>    //      ucPropData  The serialized property data.
30860>>>>>>>>>    //
30860>>>>>>>>>    Procedure StorePropValues String sKey UChar[] ByRef ucPropData
30862>>>>>>>>>        DateTime dtExpires dtCreated
30862>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMaxSize iPages iPage iChar
30862>>>>>>>>>        UChar[] ucPage
30863>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bLocking
30863>>>>>>>>>        String sExpiresTime sCreatedTime
30863>>>>>>>>>        
30863>>>>>>>>>        Move (CurrentDateTime()) to dtCreated
30864>>>>>>>>>        Get TimeToString dtCreated to sCreatedTime
30865>>>>>>>>>        
30865>>>>>>>>>        Get CalculateExpires to dtExpires
30866>>>>>>>>>        Get TimeToString dtExpires to sExpiresTime
30867>>>>>>>>>        Get pbLocking to bLocking
30868>>>>>>>>>        Get piMaxSize to iMaxSize
30869>>>>>>>>>
30869>>>>>>>>>        
30869>>>>>>>>>        Move (Round((Number(SizeOfArray(ucPropData)) / Number(iMaxSize)) + 0.5)) to iPages
30870>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iPage
30871>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iChar
30872>>>>>>>>>        
30872>>>>>>>>>        Move sKey to WebAppServerProps.Key
30873>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to WebAppServerProps.Page
30874>>>>>>>>>        Find EQ WebAppServerProps by 1
30875>>>>>>>>>>
30875>>>>>>>>>        
30875>>>>>>>>>        While (Found and (Trim(WebAppServerProps.Key) = sKey))
30879>>>>>>>>>            If (iPage < iPages) Begin
30881>>>>>>>>>                Reread WebAppServerProps
30885>>>>>>>>>                
30885>>>>>>>>>                    If (iPage = 0) Begin
30887>>>>>>>>>                        If (bLocking) Begin
30889>>>>>>>>>                            Move 0 to WebAppServerProps.Locked
30890>>>>>>>>>                        End
30890>>>>>>>>>>
30890>>>>>>>>>                    End
30890>>>>>>>>>>
30890>>>>>>>>>                    Move dtExpires to WebAppServerProps.ExpiresDate
30891>>>>>>>>>                    Move sExpiresTime to WebAppServerProps.ExpiresTime
30892>>>>>>>>>                    
30892>>>>>>>>>                    //  Update record with new data
30892>>>>>>>>>                    Move iPages to WebAppServerProps.Pages
30893>>>>>>>>>                    Move iPage to WebAppServerProps.Page
30894>>>>>>>>>                    
30894>>>>>>>>>                    If (iPages = 1) Begin
30896>>>>>>>>>                        Set_Field_Value WebAppServerProps.File_Number (RefTable(WebAppServerProps.Data)) to ucPropData 
30899>>>>>>>>>                    End
30899>>>>>>>>>>
30899>>>>>>>>>                    Else Begin
30900>>>>>>>>>                        Move (CopyArray(ucPropData, iChar, (iChar + iMaxSize) - 1)) to ucPage
30901>>>>>>>>>                        Set_Field_Value WebAppServerProps.File_Number (RefTable(WebAppServerProps.Data)) to ucPage
30904>>>>>>>>>                    End
30904>>>>>>>>>>
30904>>>>>>>>>                    
30904>>>>>>>>>                    SaveRecord WebAppServerProps
30905>>>>>>>>>                Unlock
30906>>>>>>>>>>
30906>>>>>>>>>            End
30906>>>>>>>>>>
30906>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
30907>>>>>>>>>                //  Remove record
30907>>>>>>>>>                Delete WebAppServerProps
30908>>>>>>>>>                
30908>>>>>>>>>                Move sKey to WebAppServerProps.Key
30909>>>>>>>>>                Move iPage to WebAppServerProps.Page
30910>>>>>>>>>            End
30910>>>>>>>>>>
30910>>>>>>>>>            
30910>>>>>>>>>            Increment iPage
30911>>>>>>>>>            Move ((iChar + iMaxSize)) to iChar
30912>>>>>>>>>            Find GT WebAppServerProps by 1
30913>>>>>>>>>>
30913>>>>>>>>>        Loop
30914>>>>>>>>>>
30914>>>>>>>>>        
30914>>>>>>>>>        //  Create new records
30914>>>>>>>>>        While (iPage < iPages)
30918>>>>>>>>>            Clear WebAppServerProps
30919>>>>>>>>>            
30919>>>>>>>>>            If (iPage = 0) Begin
30921>>>>>>>>>                If (bLocking) Begin
30923>>>>>>>>>                    Move 0 to WebAppServerProps.Locked
30924>>>>>>>>>                End
30924>>>>>>>>>>
30924>>>>>>>>>            End
30924>>>>>>>>>>
30924>>>>>>>>>            Move dtExpires to WebAppServerProps.ExpiresDate
30925>>>>>>>>>            Move sExpiresTime to WebAppServerProps.ExpiresTime
30926>>>>>>>>>            
30926>>>>>>>>>            Move dtCreated to WebAppServerProps.CreateDate
30927>>>>>>>>>            Move sCreatedTime to WebAppServerProps.CreateTime
30928>>>>>>>>>            
30928>>>>>>>>>            Move sKey to WebAppServerProps.Key
30929>>>>>>>>>            Move iPages to WebAppServerProps.Pages
30930>>>>>>>>>            Move iPage to WebAppServerProps.Page
30931>>>>>>>>>            
30931>>>>>>>>>            If (iPages = 1) Begin
30933>>>>>>>>>                Set_Field_Value WebAppServerProps.File_Number (RefTable(WebAppServerProps.Data)) to ucPropData 
30936>>>>>>>>>            End
30936>>>>>>>>>>
30936>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
30937>>>>>>>>>                Move (CopyArray(ucPropData, iChar, (iChar + iMaxSize) - 1)) to ucPage
30938>>>>>>>>>                Set_Field_Value WebAppServerProps.File_Number (RefTable(WebAppServerProps.Data)) to ucPage
30941>>>>>>>>>            End
30941>>>>>>>>>>
30941>>>>>>>>>            
30941>>>>>>>>>            SaveRecord WebAppServerProps
30942>>>>>>>>>            
30942>>>>>>>>>            Move ((iChar + iMaxSize)) to iChar
30943>>>>>>>>>            Increment iPage
30944>>>>>>>>>        Loop
30945>>>>>>>>>>
30945>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
30946>>>>>>>>>    
30946>>>>>>>>>    //
30946>>>>>>>>>    //  Called when the request is done processing but no values where changed. Not called if when 
30946>>>>>>>>>    //  StorePropValues is called. Unlocks (if locking is enabled and updates expiration date).
30946>>>>>>>>>    //
30946>>>>>>>>>    //  Params:
30946>>>>>>>>>    //      sKey    Key for the scope.
30946>>>>>>>>>    //
30946>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ReleasePropValues String sKey
30948>>>>>>>>>        DateTime dtExpires
30948>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bLocking
30948>>>>>>>>>        
30948>>>>>>>>>        Get pbLocking to bLocking
30949>>>>>>>>>        
30949>>>>>>>>>        Move sKey to WebAppServerProps.Key
30950>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to WebAppServerProps.Page
30951>>>>>>>>>        
30951>>>>>>>>>        Find EQ WebAppServerProps by 1
30952>>>>>>>>>>
30952>>>>>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
30954>>>>>>>>>            Reread WebAppServerProps
30958>>>>>>>>>            
30958>>>>>>>>>                Get CalculateExpires to dtExpires
30959>>>>>>>>>                Move dtExpires to WebAppServerProps.ExpiresDate
30960>>>>>>>>>                Get TimeToString dtExpires to WebAppServerProps.ExpiresTime
30961>>>>>>>>>    
30961>>>>>>>>>                If (bLocking) Begin
30963>>>>>>>>>                    Move 0 to WebAppServerProps.Locked
30964>>>>>>>>>                End
30964>>>>>>>>>>
30964>>>>>>>>>                
30964>>>>>>>>>                SaveRecord WebAppServerProps
30965>>>>>>>>>            Unlock
30966>>>>>>>>>>
30966>>>>>>>>>        End
30966>>>>>>>>>>
30966>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
30967>>>>>>>>>    
30967>>>>>>>>>    //
30967>>>>>>>>>    // Calculates when a set of web properties expires by looking at the piSessionTimeout property
30967>>>>>>>>>    // of the session manager. This is only stored for cleanup purposes.
30967>>>>>>>>>    //
30967>>>>>>>>>    Function CalculateExpires Returns DateTime
30969>>>>>>>>>        DateTime dtExpires
30969>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTimeout
30969>>>>>>>>>        
30969>>>>>>>>>        Get piSessionTimeout of (SessionManager(Self)) to iTimeout
30970>>>>>>>>>        Move (DateAddMinute(CurrentDateTime(), iTimeout)) to dtExpires
30971>>>>>>>>>        
30971>>>>>>>>>        
30971>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return dtExpires
30972>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
30973>>>>>>>>>    
30973>>>>>>>>>    //
30973>>>>>>>>>    //  Converts the given time to an string that can be saved in the database.
30973>>>>>>>>>    //
30973>>>>>>>>>    //  Params:
30973>>>>>>>>>    //      dtTime  Time to convert
30973>>>>>>>>>    //  Returns:
30973>>>>>>>>>    //      String with "HH:MM:SS" format
30973>>>>>>>>>    //
30973>>>>>>>>>    Function TimeToString DateTime dtTime Returns String
30975>>>>>>>>>        String sHours sMinutes sSeconds sMillis
30975>>>>>>>>>        
30975>>>>>>>>>        //  Extract parts
30975>>>>>>>>>        Move (String(DateGetHour(dtTime))) to sHours
30976>>>>>>>>>        Move (String(DateGetMinute(dtTime))) to sMinutes
30977>>>>>>>>>        Move (String(DateGetSecond(dtTime))) to sSeconds
30978>>>>>>>>>        Move (String(DateGetMillisecond(dtTime))) to sMillis
30979>>>>>>>>>        
30979>>>>>>>>>        //  Fill out with 0
30979>>>>>>>>>        If (Length(sHours) = 1) ;            Move ("0" + sHours) to sHours
30982>>>>>>>>>        If (Length(sMinutes) = 1) ;            Move ("0" + sMinutes) to sMinutes
30985>>>>>>>>>        If (Length(sSeconds) = 1) ;            Move ("0" + sSeconds) to sSeconds
30988>>>>>>>>>        Move (Right("00" + sMillis, 3)) to sMillis
30989>>>>>>>>>        
30989>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (sHours + ":" + sMinutes + ":" + sSeconds + "." + sMillis)
30990>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
30991>>>>>>>>>
30991>>>>>>>>>
30991>>>>>>>>>    //
30991>>>>>>>>>    //  Sets the time of the datetime variable to the time in the string.
30991>>>>>>>>>    //
30991>>>>>>>>>    //  Params:
30991>>>>>>>>>    //      dtTime  Datetime variable to add time to
30991>>>>>>>>>    //      sTimeString String with time in the format "HH:MM:SS"
30991>>>>>>>>>    //  Returns:
30991>>>>>>>>>    //      dtDateTime with the loaded time
30991>>>>>>>>>    //
30991>>>>>>>>>    Function StringToTime DateTime dtTime String sTimeString Returns DateTime
30993>>>>>>>>>        String sHours sMinutes sSeconds sMillis
30993>>>>>>>>>        
30993>>>>>>>>>        //  Extract parts
30993>>>>>>>>>        Move (Mid(sTimeString, 2, 1)) to sHours
30994>>>>>>>>>        Move (Mid(sTimeString, 2, 4)) to sMinutes
30995>>>>>>>>>        Move (Mid(sTimeString, 2, 7)) to sSeconds
30996>>>>>>>>>        Move (Right(sTimeString, 3)) to sMillis
30997>>>>>>>>>        
30997>>>>>>>>>        //  Set to DateTime
30997>>>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetHour(dtTime, (Integer(sHours))))   to dtTime
30998>>>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetMinute(dtTime, (Integer(sMinutes)))) to dtTime
30999>>>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetSecond(dtTime, (Integer(sSeconds)))) to dtTime
31000>>>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetMillisecond(dtTime, (Integer(sMillis)))) to dtTime
31001>>>>>>>>>        
31001>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return dtTime
31002>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
31003>>>>>>>>>    
31003>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_Object
31005>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send End_Construct_Object
31007>>>>>>>>>
31007>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
