31237>>>>>>>    //
31237>>>>>>>    // Special logic for when a view is loaded. When loading a view the client can already have web
31237>>>>>>>    // properties being webset and they are passed to the server. This function makes sure they are
31237>>>>>>>    // passed back to client as if they where just set by marking all of the properties of the 
31237>>>>>>>    // passed view as changed.
31237>>>>>>>    //
31237>>>>>>>    Procedure ProcessLoadViewClientSyncProps Handle hoView
31239>>>>>>>        // Analyses all of the sync properties passed in the request and stored in gaSyncProps. If any of these properties belong to
31239>>>>>>>        // the passed hoView object or a child of hoView, then they are transferred to gaSyncChangedProps. This has the effect of
31239>>>>>>>        // marking the property as changed during the AJAX Call so the values will be sent back to the client.
31239>>>>>>>        //
31239>>>>>>>        // This is used by LoadView to ensure that any cached sync property values of the loaded view that were passed to the server
31239>>>>>>>        // will be passed back to the client so that the client will consider them to have been WebSet during the call and will apply
31239>>>>>>>        // the property changes. This forms part of our support for caching WebSet property changes of views that have never been
31239>>>>>>>        // loaded on the client.
31239>>>>>>>        Integer iObject icObject iTo iStoreIndex
31239>>>>>>>        Integer iProperty   icProperty
31239>>>>>>>        Handle hoObject hoWebNeighborhood
31239>>>>>>>        
31239>>>>>>>        Get piStoreIndex to iStoreIndex
31240>>>>>>>        
31240>>>>>>>        // Iterate the web properties. We are looking for objects that match hoView or are
31240>>>>>>>        // child objects of hoView....
31240>>>>>>>        Get piSize to icObject
31241>>>>>>>        
31241>>>>>>>        For iObject from 0 to (icObject - 1)
31247>>>>>>>>
31247>>>>>>>            Get phoWebNeighborhood of gaSyncObjectHandles[iStoreIndex][iObject] to hoWebNeighborhood
31248>>>>>>>            
31248>>>>>>>            If (hoWebNeighborhood = hoView) Begin
31250>>>>>>>                // Mark all web properties of this object as changed....
31250>>>>>>>                Move True to gaSyncChangedProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].bContainsChanges     // Mark the object as changed
31251>>>>>>>                
31251>>>>>>>                // Iterate the properties of this object....
31251>>>>>>>                Move (SizeOfArray(gaSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].aP)) to icProperty
31252>>>>>>>                
31252>>>>>>>                For iProperty from 0 to (icProperty - 1)
31258>>>>>>>>
31258>>>>>>>                    Move iProperty to gaSyncChangedProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].aiIndex[iProperty]
31259>>>>>>>                Loop
31260>>>>>>>>
31260>>>>>>>            End
31260>>>>>>>>
31260>>>>>>>        Loop
31261>>>>>>>>
31261>>>>>>>        
31261>>>>>>>        
31261>>>>>>>        //  Iterate all advanced web properties to mark them as changed as well
31261>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]) - 1) to iTo
31262>>>>>>>        For iProperty from 0 to iTo
31268>>>>>>>>
31268>>>>>>>            Get phoWebNeighborhood of gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProperty].hoObj to hoWebNeighborhood
31269>>>>>>>            If (hoWebNeighborhood = hoView) Begin
31271>>>>>>>                Move True to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProperty].bChanged
31272>>>>>>>            End
31272>>>>>>>>
31272>>>>>>>            
31272>>>>>>>        Loop
31273>>>>>>>>
31273>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
31274>>>>>>>
31274>>>>>>>
31274>>>>>>>    //
31274>>>>>>>    // Augments the initialization with the logic for advanced sync props. These are serialized to 
31274>>>>>>>    // a value tree when sent to the client (which doesn't happen for server props) and they are 
31274>>>>>>>    // not deserialized until a webget is performed.
31274>>>>>>>    //
31274>>>>>>>    Procedure InitializeSyncProps tWebSyncProps[] aSyncProps tWebAdvSyncProp[] aAdvSyncProps
31276>>>>>>>        Integer iSize iProp iStoreIndex
31276>>>>>>>        Handle hoLocator
31276>>>>>>>        
31276>>>>>>>        Get piStoreIndex to iStoreIndex
31277>>>>>>>        Get phoWebControlLocator to hoLocator
31278>>>>>>>        
31278>>>>>>>        //  Initialize the advanced property cache
31278>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aAdvSyncProps)) to iSize
31279>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex], 0)) to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]   //  Clear it just to be sure
31280>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex], iSize)) to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]
31281>>>>>>>        
31281>>>>>>>        For iProp from 0 to (iSize - 1)
31287>>>>>>>>
31287>>>>>>>            Get FindWebObject of hoLocator aAdvSyncProps[iProp].sO to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].hoObj
31288>>>>>>>            Move False                  to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].bChanged
31289>>>>>>>            Move False                  to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].bDeserialized
31290>>>>>>>            Move 0                      to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].tSvrProp.vV
31291>>>>>>>            Move aAdvSyncProps[iProp]   to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].tSyncProp
31292>>>>>>>        Loop
31293>>>>>>>>
31293>>>>>>>        
31293>>>>>>>        Forward Send InitializeSyncProps aSyncProps
31295>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
