31380>>>>>>>>>    // This is the Error_Report for non AJAX style applications. This could be 
31380>>>>>>>>>    // Web Service, HTTP Handler, ASP or old style webapps. We've copied it here
31380>>>>>>>>>    // rather than trying to integrate it directly into Error_Report. It gets called by
31380>>>>>>>>>    // Error_Report as needed.
31380>>>>>>>>>    Procedure BasicErrorReport Integer iError Integer iLine String ErrMsg
31382>>>>>>>>>        String sSystemErr sMess sLabel sFile sDtl sFullError
31382>>>>>>>>>        String sStack sSystemAndStack
