31384>>>>>>>>>        Get pbUnhandledErrorSupport to bUnhandledSupport
31385>>>>>>>>>        Move (IsDebuggerPresent()) to bDebugging
31386>>>>>>>>>        
31386>>>>>>>>>        // if an operator error this may be a Procedure UserError situation where the
31386>>>>>>>>>        // caption is passed in the error text. This handler does not support setting the caption so we just remove it.
31386>>>>>>>>>        // The ajax superclass handler will support this
31386>>>>>>>>>        If (iError=DFERR_OPERATOR) Begin
31388>>>>>>>>>            Move (pos(C_ErrorCaption,ErrMsg)) to iSrc
31389>>>>>>>>>            If iSrc Begin
31391>>>>>>>>>                Move (length(C_ErrorCaption)) to  iTxtLen
31392>>>>>>>>>                Move (remove(ErrMsg, 1, iSrc-1 + iTxtLen )) to sCaption // will not get used here
31393>>>>>>>>>                Move (Left(ErrMsg,iSrc-1)) to ErrMsg
31394>>>>>>>>>            End
31394>>>>>>>>>>
31394>>>>>>>>>        End
31394>>>>>>>>>>
