31442>>>>>>>>>                    // The option to disable stack dumps only makes sense if the developer is using html errors to report unhandled problems
31442>>>>>>>>>                    // and for some reason the stack dump will mess up existing applications. This seems very unlikely but we are providing
31442>>>>>>>>>                    // a way to disable this if needed via pbUnhandledSupport.
31442>>>>>>>>>                    Send ReportError to hoInetSession iError (If(bUnhandledSupport, sSystemAndStack, sSystemErr)) iLine iErrFile iErrField
