31449>>>>>>>>>                End
31449>>>>>>>>>>
31449>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
31450>>>>>>>>>                    Send ReportErrorEvent to hoInetSession iError sSystemAndStack  iLine iErrFile iErrField
31451>>>>>>>>>                    Send ReportErrorEvent to hoInetSession iError C_$CriticalErrorProgramHalted iLine 0 0
31452>>>>>>>>>                End
