31594>>>>>>>>>    //
31594>>>>>>>>>    // Enumerate all errors.
31594>>>>>>>>>    // For each error send iMsg to hObj passing all required error
31594>>>>>>>>>    // information: iErr#, sErrorMsg, iLine, iFile, iField
31594>>>>>>>>>    //
31594>>>>>>>>>    Procedure EnumerateErrors Integer iMsg Integer hObj
31596>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount i
31596>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31597>>>>>>>>>        Decrement iCount
31598>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to iCount
31604>>>>>>>>>>
31604>>>>>>>>>            Send ErrorReportCallback i iMsg hObj
31605>>>>>>>>>        Loop
31606>>>>>>>>>>
31606>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
31607>>>>>>>>>    
31607>>>>>>>>>    // if item is -1 it is last error
31607>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ErrorReportCallback Integer iItem Integer iMsg Integer hObj
31609>>>>>>>>>        String  sErrMsg
31609>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFileNr iFieldNr iErrNr iLineNr
31609>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
31609>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31610>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
31613>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) Begin
31615>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_ErrNr   iItem to iErrNr
31616>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_ErrMsg  iItem to sErrMsg
31617>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_LineNr  iItem to iLineNr
31618>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_FileNr  iItem to iFileNr
31619>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_FieldNr iItem to iFieldNr
31620>>>>>>>>>            Send iMsg to hObj iErrNr sErrMsg iLineNr iFileNr iFieldNr
31621>>>>>>>>>        End
31621>>>>>>>>>>
31621>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
31622>>>>>>>>>    
31622>>>>>>>>>    // this is used to remove a single error from the queue
31622>>>>>>>>>    // if iItem is -1, last error
31622>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClearError Integer iItem
31624>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
31624>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31625>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
31628>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) Begin
31630>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item iItem
31631>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oErrorText iItem
31632>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oLineNr    iItem
31633>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oFileNr    iItem
31634>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oFieldNr   iItem
31635>>>>>>>>>        End
31635>>>>>>>>>>
31635>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
