31669>>>>>>>>>    // see if error exists for this file and field. If it does, return the
31669>>>>>>>>>    // item number, else return -1.
31669>>>>>>>>>    Function FileFieldErrorItem Integer iFile Integer iField Returns Integer
31671>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount i
