31672>>>>>>>>>        Decrement iCount
31673>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to iCount
31679>>>>>>>>>>
31679>>>>>>>>>            If (Error_FileNr(Self,i)=iFile and ;                Error_FieldNr(Self,i)=iField) ;                Function_Return i
