31689>>>>>// WebApp wrapper object. Each AJAX WebApp must have one and only one cWebApp object. 
31689>>>>>// The webapp object is used as a container for...
31689>>>>>// - The application's commandbar/titlebar (menubar, toolbars, breadcrumb etc)
31689>>>>>// - Each cWebView and cWebModalDialog
31689>>>>>//
31689>>>>>// Adds interface for:
31689>>>>>// - Loading the WebApp
31689>>>>>// - General handling web service requests,
31689>>>>>// - Registering web service objects (cWebView etc),
31689>>>>>// - Locating cWebControl objects (i.e. retreiving the object handle of any cWebControl),
31689>>>>>// - Managing client-server web properties,
31689>>>>>// - Show/Hide View interface.
31689>>>>>// - Height & width properties.
31689>>>>>// - cWebUIObject support (via mixin)
31689>>>>>// 
31689>>>>>
31689>>>>>
31689>>>>>
31689>>>>>Class cWebApp is a cWebBaseUIObject
31690>>>>>
31690>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
31692>>>>>        Move Self to ghoWebApp               // Store global reference to the webapp object.
31693>>>>>        
31693>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
31695>>>>>        
31695>>>>>        Send Define_cWebAppBase_Mixin
31696>>>>>        
