32581>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnFindSuggestions String sSearch tSuggestion[] ByRef aSuggestions
32583>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMode iFile
32583>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFullText bResult bSupportsSQL
32583>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
32583>>>>>>>>>        
32583>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32584>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32585>>>>>>>>>        
32585>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32587>>>>>>>>>            
32587>>>>>>>>>            WebGet peSuggestionMode to iMode
32588>>>>>>>>>            WebGet pbFullText to bFullText
32589>>>>>>>>>            
32589>>>>>>>>>            If (iMode = smFind) Begin
32591>>>>>>>>>                If (not(bFullText)) Begin
32593>>>>>>>>>                    Send SuggestionsFindIncremental sSearch (&aSuggestions)
32594>>>>>>>>>                End
32594>>>>>>>>>>
32594>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
32595>>>>>>>>>                    Get SupportsSQLFilters of hoServer to bSupportsSQL
32596>>>>>>>>>                    If (bSupportsSQL) Begin
32598>>>>>>>>>                        Send SuggestionsSQLFullText sSearch (&aSuggestions)
32599>>>>>>>>>                    End
32599>>>>>>>>>>
32599>>>>>>>>>                    Else Begin
32600>>>>>>>>>                        Send SuggestionsFindFullText sSearch (&aSuggestions)
32601>>>>>>>>>                    End
32601>>>>>>>>>>
32601>>>>>>>>>                End
32601>>>>>>>>>>
32601>>>>>>>>>            End
32601>>>>>>>>>>
32601>>>>>>>>>            Else If (iMode = smValidationTable) Begin
32604>>>>>>>>>                Send SuggestionsValidation sSearch (&aSuggestions) bFullText
32605>>>>>>>>>            End
32605>>>>>>>>>>
32605>>>>>>>>>        End
32605>>>>>>>>>>
32605>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
