32606>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SelectSuggestion String sSearch
32608>>>>>>>>>        tSuggestion[] aData
32608>>>>>>>>>        tSuggestion[] aData
32609>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
32609>>>>>>>>>        
32609>>>>>>>>>        //  Deserialize the sent row
32609>>>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
32610>>>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to aData
32611>>>>>>>>>        
32611>>>>>>>>>        If (SizeOfArray(aData) = 1) Begin
32613>>>>>>>>>            Send OnSelectSuggestion sSearch aData[0] 
32614>>>>>>>>>        End
32614>>>>>>>>>>
32614>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
