32618>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSelectSuggestion String sSearch tSuggestion Suggestion
32620>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
32620>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iMode
32620>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFind bSuccess
32620>>>>>>>>>        RowID rRowId
32620>>>>>>>>>        
32620>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32621>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32622>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
32623>>>>>>>>>        
32623>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32625>>>>>>>>>            WebGet peSuggestionMode to iMode
32626>>>>>>>>>            
32626>>>>>>>>>            If (iMode = smFind) Begin
32628>>>>>>>>>                Get pbFindOnSelect to bFind
32629>>>>>>>>>                If (bFind) Begin
32631>>>>>>>>>                    Move (DeserializeRowID(Suggestion.sRowId)) to rRowId    
32632>>>>>>>>>                    
32632>>>>>>>>>                    If (not(IsNullRowID(rRowId))) Begin
32634>>>>>>>>>                        Get FindByRowIdEx of hoServer iFile rRowId to bSuccess
32635>>>>>>>>>                        // this is very unlikely
32635>>>>>>>>>                        If not bSuccess Begin
32637>>>>>>>>>                            Error DFERR_CANT_REFIND_RECORD
32638>>>>>>>>>>
32638>>>>>>>>>                        End
32638>>>>>>>>>>
32638>>>>>>>>>                    End
32638>>>>>>>>>>
32638>>>>>>>>>                End
32638>>>>>>>>>>
32638>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
32639>>>>>>>>>                    WebSet psValue to Suggestion.aValues[0]
32640>>>>>>>>>                    WebSet pbChanged to True
32641>>>>>>>>>                End
32641>>>>>>>>>>
32641>>>>>>>>>            End
32641>>>>>>>>>>
32641>>>>>>>>>            Else If (imode = smValidationTable) Begin
32644>>>>>>>>>                WebSet psValue to Suggestion.sRowId
32645>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbChanged to True
32646>>>>>>>>>            End
32646>>>>>>>>>>
32646>>>>>>>>>            
32646>>>>>>>>>        End
32646>>>>>>>>>>
32646>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
