33575>>>>>>>        Case Begin
33575>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 1) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_SELECT_SINGLE
33577>>>>>>>                Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to Row
33578>>>>>>>                Send OnSelectRow Row
33579>>>>>>>                Case Break
33580>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 2) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_DESELECT_SINGLE
33583>>>>>>>                Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to Row
33584>>>>>>>                Send OnDeSelectRow Row
33585>>>>>>>                Case Break
33586>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 3) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_SELECT_ALL
33589>>>>>>>                Send OnSelectAllRows
33590>>>>>>>                Case Break
33591>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 4) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_DESELECT_ALL
33594>>>>>>>                Send OnDeSelectAllRows
33595>>>>>>>                Case Break
33596>>>>>>>        Case End
33596>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
