34765>>>>>>>        Send OnFillLabels
34766>>>>>>>        
34766>>>>>>>        Get paLabels to aData
34767>>>>>>>        ValueTreeSerializeParameter aData to tData
34768>>>>>>>        
34768>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "fillLabels" aParams tData        
34769>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
