34774>>>>>>>    Function ValueToPosition String sValue Returns Integer
34776>>>>>>>        // Called if the cWebSlider has a data binding. Maps the database value (sValue) as an integer
34776>>>>>>>        // to the slider position.
34776>>>>>>>        // Augment this function to make a different kind of mapping e.g. date values or enumerated strings.
34776>>>>>>>        // If you augment this then you should also augment PositionToValue to perform the converse mapping.
34776>>>>>>>        Function_Return sValue
34777>>>>>>>    End_Function
34778>>>>>>>    
34778>>>>>>>    
34778>>>>>>>    Function PositionToValue Integer iPosition Returns String
34780>>>>>>>        // Called if the cWebSlider has a data binding. Maps the slider position to the database value as an integer.
34780>>>>>>>        // Augment this function to make a different kind of mapping e.g. date values or enumerated strings.
34780>>>>>>>        // If you augment this then you should also augment ValueToPosition to perform the converse mapping.
34780>>>>>>>        Function_Return iPosition
34781>>>>>>>    End_Function
