35423>>>>>>>                Procedure_Return
35424>>>>>>>            End
35424>>>>>>>>
35424>>>>>>>            
35424>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoDD
35425>>>>>>>            
35425>>>>>>>            If (hoDD > 0) Begin
35427>>>>>>>                Get AllowParentFind of hoDD to bAllowFind
35428>>>>>>>                
