35613>>>>>>>    //             converted to an object handle. This object must understand the
35613>>>>>>>    //             NavigateBack message.
35613>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSelect String sViewName
35615>>>>>>>        Send NavigateBackByName of (ViewStack(Self)) sViewName
35616>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
35617>>>>>>>
35617>>>>>>>
