36456>>>>>>>    // =========================
36456>>>>>>>    // PROCESS MEMORY MANAGEMENT
36456>>>>>>>    // =========================
36456>>>>>>>    
36456>>>>>>>    // Loads all dynamic objects in memory. This method is often called
36456>>>>>>>    // before rendering, so that all inter-object connections are set
36456>>>>>>>    // up properly.
36456>>>>>>>    Procedure CreateAllLocal 
36458>>>>>>>        Integer icObjects iObject
36458>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36458>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36459>>>>>>>        Handle hoObj
36459>>>>>>>        
36459>>>>>>>        WebGet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36460>>>>>>>        
36460>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aDynamicObjects)) to icObjects
36461>>>>>>>        For iObject from 0 to (icObjects - 1)
36467>>>>>>>>
36467>>>>>>>            Get DynamicObject aDynamicObjects[iObject].sId to hoObj
36468>>>>>>>        Loop
36469>>>>>>>>
36469>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36470>>>>>>>    
36470>>>>>>>    
36470>>>>>>>    Function CreateLongNameUsingParents Handle hoDynamicObject Handle hoMaxParent Returns String
36472>>>>>>>        String sName
36472>>>>>>>        Handle hoParent hoCurrent
36472>>>>>>>        
36472>>>>>>>        Move hoDynamicObject to hoCurrent
36473>>>>>>>        Get Parent of hoMaxParent to hoMaxParent
36474>>>>>>>        
36474>>>>>>>        While (hoCurrent <> hoMaxParent and hoCurrent <> Self)
36478>>>>>>>            If (hoCurrent = hoDynamicObject) ;                Move (Object_Label(hoCurrent)) to sName
36481>>>>>>>            Else ;                Move (Object_Label(hoCurrent) + "." + sName) to sName
36483>>>>>>>            
36483>>>>>>>            Get Parent of hoCurrent to hoCurrent
36484>>>>>>>        Loop
36485>>>>>>>>
36485>>>>>>>        
36485>>>>>>>        
36485>>>>>>>        
36485>>>>>>>        If (Left(sName, 1) = "#") ;            Move (Remove(sName, 1, 1)) to sName
36488>>>>>>>            
36488>>>>>>>        Function_Return sName
36489>>>>>>>    End_Function
36490>>>>>>>    
36490>>>>>>>    Function SyncDynamicDDOs Handle hoDynamicObj Returns Integer
36492>>>>>>>        // Override in cWebWidgetContainer
36492>>>>>>>        Function_Return 0
36493>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36494>>>>>>>    
36494>>>>>>>    Procedure StoreDynamicDDOs Handle hoDynamicObj
36496>>>>>>>        // Override in cWebWidgetContainer
36496>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36497>>>>>>>    
36497>>>>>>>    
36497>>>>>>>    // Creates an object in memory. Due to process pooling, it can not
36497>>>>>>>    // be guaranteed that all objects are always loaded in memory. 
36497>>>>>>>    // This method creates an object in the memory of the current process.
36497>>>>>>>    Function CreateLocal String sDynamicObjectId Returns Handle
36499>>>>>>>        String sName
36499>>>>>>>        Boolean bRequiresChildren
36499>>>>>>>        Integer iObjectIndex iHandleIndex iClassId iParentIndex icObjects iObject iWebRadioClass iSyncRequestResponse
36499>>>>>>>        Handle hoObj hoParent hoChild   
36499>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory tObject
36499>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory tObject
36499>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36499>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36500>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36500>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36500>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36500>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36501>>>>>>>
36501>>>>>>>        Get paDynamicObjectsInMemory to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36502>>>>>>>        
36502>>>>>>>        Move sDynamicObjectId to tObject.sDynamicObjectId
36503>>>>>>>
36503>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tObject, aDynamicObjectsInMemory, False)) to iHandleIndex
36504>>>>>>>        If (iHandleIndex = -1) Begin
36506>>>>>>>            WebGet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36507>>>>>>>            
36507>>>>>>>            Move sDynamicObjectId to tDynamicObject.sId
36508>>>>>>>            
36508>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchArray(tDynamicObject, aDynamicObjects, False)) to iObjectIndex
36509>>>>>>>            If (iObjectIndex <> -1) Begin
36511>>>>>>>                Move aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].iClassId to iClassId
36512>>>>>>>                Get DynamicParent sDynamicObjectId to hoParent
36513>>>>>>>                // DynamicParent might already have created the object. We either retrieve the created object.
36513>>>>>>>                // Or we do an in-place CreateNamed.
36513>>>>>>>                Send RetrieveOrCreateHandle sDynamicObjectId (&hoObj) hoParent iClassId
36514>>>>>>>
36514>>>>>>>                // Check WebObject
36514>>>>>>>                If (not(IsAjaxWebObject(hoObj))) Begin
36516>>>>>>>                    Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat("Class %1 is not a valid cWebObject and can't be used with CreateDynamicObject.", iClassId))
36517>>>>>>>>
36517>>>>>>>                    Send Destroy of hoObj
36518>>>>>>>                    Function_Return C_WebUnresolvedObject
36519>>>>>>>                End
36519>>>>>>>>
36519>>>>>>>                
36519>>>>>>>                If (Pos(".", sDynamicObjectId) > 0) Begin
36521>>>>>>>                    // This is a static child so it has been created by DynamicParent which means that all processing below is already done
36521>>>>>>>                    Function_Return hoObj
36522>>>>>>>                End
36522>>>>>>>>
36522>>>>>>>                
36522>>>>>>>                Set psDynamicObjectId of hoObj to sDynamicObjectId
36523>>>>>>>                Set phoOwner of hoObj to (Self)
36524>>>>>>>                
36524>>>>>>>                Send ApplyDynamicProps sDynamicObjectId hoObj
36525>>>>>>>                
36525>>>>>>>                // Call to attempt to sync DDO's
36525>>>>>>>                Get SyncDynamicDDOs hoObj to iSyncRequestResponse
36526>>>>>>>                If (iSyncRequestResponse = -1) Begin
36528>>>>>>>                    // Request response -1 means no access, so we should destroy this object to prevent any possible calls
36528>>>>>>>                    Send DestroyDynamicObject sDynamicObjectId
36529>>>>>>>                    Procedure_Return
36530>>>>>>>                End
36530>>>>>>>>
36530>>>>>>>                
36530>>>>>>>                // Process belated childs.
36530>>>>>>>                Send CreateLocalOfChildren hoObj hoObj
36531>>>>>>>                
36531>>>>>>>                //  All data bindable objects need AfterAttachDDO message (even through Data awareness is not supported on dynamic objects for now)
36531>>>>>>>                If (pbDataBindable(hoObj)) Begin
36533>>>>>>>                    Send AfterAttachDDO of hoObj
36534>>>>>>>                End         
36534>>>>>>>>
36534>>>>>>>                
36534>>>>>>>                // WebRadio's require slightly different logic. Here we check if the 
36534>>>>>>>                // object we want to create is a cWebRadio. 
36534>>>>>>>                Move (RefClass(cWebRadio)) to iWebRadioClass
36535>>>>>>>                If (IsObjectOfClass(hoObj, iWebRadioClass)) Begin
36537>>>>>>>                    Send RegisterRadio hoObj   
36538>>>>>>>                End   
36538>>>>>>>>
36538>>>>>>>            End
36538>>>>>>>>
36538>>>>>>>            Else ;                Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$DynamicObjectNotRegistered, sDynamicObjectId))
36540>>>>>>>        End
36540>>>>>>>>
36540>>>>>>>        Else Begin
36541>>>>>>>            Get StoredHandle sDynamicObjectId to hoObj
36542>>>>>>>        End
36542>>>>>>>>
36542>>>>>>>        
36542>>>>>>>        // In addition to creating the object itself, we also want to create all child objects (for some objects).
36542>>>>>>>        // This solves issues with objects that have embedded children (such as cWebList).
36542>>>>>>>        Get RequiresChildren hoObj to bRequiresChildren
36543>>>>>>>        If (bRequiresChildren) Begin      
36545>>>>>>>            Send CreateChildren sDynamicObjectId
36546>>>>>>>        End
36546>>>>>>>>
36546>>>>>>>  
36546>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoObj
36547>>>>>>>    End_Function
36548>>>>>>>                
36548>>>>>>>    // This function is only called from a createlocal with static children (should be guarded by DynamicObjectsInMemory).
36548>>>>>>>    // It registers the dynamic object if it has to and sets a mangled name on the child to make it unique.
36548>>>>>>>    // It then recurses down.
36548>>>>>>>    Procedure CreateLocalFor Handle hoObj Handle hoParent Handle hoMaxParent
36550>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex iSyncRequestResponse
36550>>>>>>>        Boolean bRequiresChildren
36550>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36550>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36550>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects  
36550>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects  
36551>>>>>>>        
36551>>>>>>>        WebGet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36552>>>>>>>        
36552>>>>>>>        // Get parent info.
36552>>>>>>>        Get psDynamicObjectId of hoParent to tDynamicObject.sParentId
36553>>>>>>>        Get CreateLongNameUsingParents hoObj hoMaxParent to tDynamicObject.sId
36554>>>>>>>        
36554>>>>>>>        // Find a registration.
36554>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tDynamicObject, aDynamicObjects, False)) to iIndex
36555>>>>>>>        If (iIndex = -1) Begin
36557>>>>>>>            // Dynamic object has not been registered before, so append it  
36557>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchInsertPos()) to iIndex
36558>>>>>>>            Get ObjectClass of hoObj to tDynamicObject.iClassId
36559>>>>>>>            Move False to tDynamicObject.bRendered
36560>>>>>>>            
36560>>>>>>>            Move (InsertInArray(aDynamicObjects, iIndex, tDynamicObject)) to aDynamicObjects
36561>>>>>>>            
36561>>>>>>>            WebSet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36562>>>>>>>        End
36562>>>>>>>>
36562>>>>>>>        
36562>>>>>>>        // Now apply state.
36562>>>>>>>        Set psDynamicObjectId of hoObj to tDynamicObject.sId
36563>>>>>>>        Set phoOwner of hoObj to Self
36564>>>>>>>        
36564>>>>>>>        Send ApplyDynamicProps tDynamicObject.sId hoObj
36565>>>>>>>        Send StoreDirectHandle tDynamicObject.sId hoObj
36566>>>>>>>        
36566>>>>>>>        // Call to attempt to sync DDO's
36566>>>>>>>        Get SyncDynamicDDOs hoObj to iSyncRequestResponse
36567>>>>>>>        If (iSyncRequestResponse = -1) Begin
36569>>>>>>>            // Request response -1 means no access, so we should destroy this object to prevent any possible calls
36569>>>>>>>            Send DestroyDynamicObject tDynamicObject.sId
36570>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
36571>>>>>>>        End
36571>>>>>>>>
36571>>>>>>>
36571>>>>>>>        // Process belated childs.
36571>>>>>>>        Send CreateLocalOfChildren hoObj hoMaxParent
36572>>>>>>>        
36572>>>>>>>        //  All data bindable objects need AfterAttachDDO message (even through Data awareness is not supported on dynamic objects for now)
36572>>>>>>>        If (pbDataBindable(hoObj)) Begin
36574>>>>>>>            Send AfterAttachDDO of hoObj
36575>>>>>>>        End
36575>>>>>>>>
36575>>>>>>>        
36575>>>>>>>        // WebRadio's require slightly different logic. Here we check if the 
36575>>>>>>>        // object we want to create is a cWebRadio. 
36575>>>>>>>        If (IsObjectOfClass(hoObj, (RefClass(cWebRadio)))) Begin
36577>>>>>>>            Send RegisterRadio hoObj
36578>>>>>>>        End
36578>>>>>>>>
36578>>>>>>>        
36578>>>>>>>        Get RequiresChildren hoObj to bRequiresChildren
36579>>>>>>>        If (bRequiresChildren) Begin      
36581>>>>>>>            Send CreateChildren tDynamicObject.sId
36582>>>>>>>        End
36582>>>>>>>>
36582>>>>>>>        
36582>>>>>>>        // Insert object at end of parent's child structure
36582>>>>>>>        If (pbIsCreating(Self)) Begin
36584>>>>>>>            Send AppendToSiblings tDynamicObject.sId
36585>>>>>>>        End
36585>>>>>>>>
36585>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36586>>>>>>>    
36586>>>>>>>    
36586>>>>>>>    Procedure CreateLocalOfChildren Handle hoParent Handle hoMaxParent
36588>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
36588>>>>>>>        Handle hoChild
36588>>>>>>>        
36588>>>>>>>        For iIndex from 0 to (Child_Count(hoParent) - 1)
36594>>>>>>>>
36594>>>>>>>            Get ChildByIndex of hoParent iIndex to hoChild
36595>>>>>>>            If (IsObjectOfClass(hoChild, RefClass(cWebObject))) Begin
36597>>>>>>>                Send CreateLocalFor hoChild hoParent hoMaxParent
36598>>>>>>>            End
36598>>>>>>>>
36598>>>>>>>        Loop
36599>>>>>>>>
36599>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36600>>>>>>>    
36600>>>>>>>     
36600>>>>>>>    // Destroys all dynamic objects on the server. This procedure is
36600>>>>>>>    // executed after every call from the client to prevent spawning too 
36600>>>>>>>    // many objects in complex applications.
36600>>>>>>>    Procedure DestroyLocalObjects
36602>>>>>>>        Handle hoChild
36602>>>>>>>        Integer iObject
36602>>>>>>>        String sDynamicObjectName
36602>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36602>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36603>>>>>>>        tWebClientAction[] aClientActions
36603>>>>>>>        tWebClientAction[] aClientActions
36604>>>>>>>            
36604>>>>>>>        Get paDynamicObjectsInMemory to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36605>>>>>>>        
36605>>>>>>>        For iObject from 0 to (Child_Count(Self) - 1)
36611>>>>>>>>
36611>>>>>>>            Get ChildByIndex iObject to hoChild
36612>>>>>>>            If (IsObjectOfClass(hoChild, RefClass(cWebObject))) Begin
36614>>>>>>>                Get psDynamicObjectId of hoChild to sDynamicObjectName
36615>>>>>>>                If (IsDynamicObject(hoChild) and SizeOfString(sDynamicObjectName)) Begin
36617>>>>>>>                    Send StoreDynamicDDOs hoChild
36618>>>>>>>                    Send Destroy of hoChild
36619>>>>>>>                    Decrement iObject
36620>>>>>>>                End
36620>>>>>>>>
36620>>>>>>>            End
36620>>>>>>>>
36620>>>>>>>        Loop
36621>>>>>>>>
36621>>>>>>>        
36621>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(aDynamicObjectsInMemory, 0)) to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36622>>>>>>>        Set paDynamicObjectsInMemory to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36623>>>>>>>        Set paClientActionsQueue to aClientActions  // Should be empty, clear to preven cross session leakage
36624>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36625>>>>>>>    
36625>>>>>>>    
36625>>>>>>>    // Returns the handle of a dynamic object from memory. Does not guarantee
36625>>>>>>>    // the object exists or is loaded. Do not use this method to get the handle
36625>>>>>>>    // of a dynamic object in applications. Use 'Get DynamicObject' instead.
36625>>>>>>>    Function StoredHandle String sDynamicObjectId Returns Handle
36627>>>>>>>        Integer iObjectIndex iHandleIndex
36627>>>>>>>        Handle hoObj
36627>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory tObject
36627>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory tObject
36627>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36627>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36628>>>>>>>
36628>>>>>>>        Get paDynamicObjectsInMemory to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36629>>>>>>>        
36629>>>>>>>        Move sDynamicObjectId to tObject.sDynamicObjectId
36630>>>>>>>        
36630>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tObject, aDynamicObjectsInMemory, False)) to iHandleIndex
36631>>>>>>>        If (iHandleIndex <> -1) Begin
36633>>>>>>>            Move aDynamicObjectsInMemory[iHandleIndex].hoObj to hoObj
36634>>>>>>>        End
36634>>>>>>>>
36634>>>>>>>        
36634>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoObj
36635>>>>>>>    End_Function
36636>>>>>>>    
36636>>>>>>>    // Saves the handle for a dynamic object in memory.
36636>>>>>>>    Procedure StoreDirectHandle String sDynamicObjectId Handle hoObj
36638>>>>>>>        Integer iHandleIndex iIndex
36638>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory tObject
36638>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory tObject
36638>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36638>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36639>>>>>>>        
36639>>>>>>>        Get paDynamicObjectsInMemory to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36640>>>>>>>        
36640>>>>>>>        Move sDynamicObjectId to tObject.sDynamicObjectId
36641>>>>>>>        
36641>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tObject, aDynamicObjectsInMemory, False)) to iHandleIndex
36642>>>>>>>        If (iHandleIndex <> -1) Begin
36644>>>>>>>            // Update handle
36644>>>>>>>            Move hoObj to aDynamicObjectsInMemory[iHandleIndex].hoObj
36645>>>>>>>        End
36645>>>>>>>>
36645>>>>>>>        Else Begin
36646>>>>>>>            // Set new handle
36646>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchInsertPos()) to iIndex
36647>>>>>>>            Move sDynamicObjectId to tObject.sDynamicObjectId
36648>>>>>>>            Move hoObj to tObject.hoObj
36649>>>>>>>            
36649>>>>>>>            Move (InsertInArray(aDynamicObjectsInMemory, iIndex, tObject)) to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36650>>>>>>>        End  
36650>>>>>>>>
36650>>>>>>>        
36650>>>>>>>        Set paDynamicObjectsInMemory to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36651>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36652>>>>>>>    
36652>>>>>>>    // Saves the handle for a dynamic object in memory.
36652>>>>>>>    Procedure RetrieveOrCreateHandle String sDynamicObjectId Handle ByRef hoObj Handle hoParent Integer iClassId 
36654>>>>>>>        Integer iHandleIndex iIndex
36654>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory tObject
36654>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory tObject
36654>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36654>>>>>>>        tObjectInMemory[] aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36655>>>>>>>        
36655>>>>>>>        Get paDynamicObjectsInMemory to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36656>>>>>>>        
36656>>>>>>>        Move sDynamicObjectId to tObject.sDynamicObjectId
36657>>>>>>>        
36657>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tObject, aDynamicObjectsInMemory, False)) to iHandleIndex
36658>>>>>>>        If (iHandleIndex <> -1) Begin
36660>>>>>>>            // Retrieve handle
36660>>>>>>>            Move aDynamicObjectsInMemory[iHandleIndex].hoObj to hoObj            
36661>>>>>>>        End
36661>>>>>>>>
36661>>>>>>>        Else Begin
36662>>>>>>>            // Create new handle
36662>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchInsertPos()) to iIndex
36663>>>>>>>            Move sDynamicObjectId to tObject.sDynamicObjectId
36664>>>>>>>            
36664>>>>>>>            Get CreateNamed of hoParent iClassId ("#" + sDynamicObjectId) to hoObj
36665>>>>>>>            Move hoObj to tObject.hoObj
36666>>>>>>>            
36666>>>>>>>            Move (InsertInArray(aDynamicObjectsInMemory, iIndex, tObject)) to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36667>>>>>>>        End  
36667>>>>>>>>
36667>>>>>>>        
36667>>>>>>>        Set paDynamicObjectsInMemory to aDynamicObjectsInMemory
36668>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36669>>>>>>>    
36669>>>>>>>    
36669>>>>>>>    // ==========================================
36669>>>>>>>    // SYNCHRONIZED PROPERTY HANDLING (3RD LEVEL)
36669>>>>>>>    // ==========================================
36669>>>>>>>    
36669>>>>>>>    // Dynamic objects have three levels of properties. The first level contains properties that
36669>>>>>>>    // are set in the subclass definition of the object. The second level properties (called 
36669>>>>>>>    // dynamic properties) can be different for individual instances of objects. Two dynamic
36669>>>>>>>    // buttons of the same class can have different initial properties. The third and final 
36669>>>>>>>    // level contains properties that are changed at runtime. This is done using regular
36669>>>>>>>    // WebGet/WebSet operations.
36669>>>>>>>    
36669>>>>>>>    
36669>>>>>>>    // Sets a synchronized property.
36669>>>>>>>    Procedure OwnerSetSyncProp Handle hoObj tWebPropMetaData ByRef pubProp Variant vPropValue
36671>>>>>>>        Integer iPubPropIndex
36671>>>>>>>        String sObjName sDynamicObjectId
36671>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsRendered bAdvanced bIsAjaxWebObject
36671>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue tProp
36671>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue tProp
36671>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncProp tAdvProp
36671>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncProp tAdvProp
36671>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp tQueuedProp
36671>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp tQueuedProp
36671>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp[] aSyncPropsQueue
36671>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp[] aSyncPropsQueue
36672>>>>>>>
36672>>>>>>>                
36672>>>>>>>        // Test that the target object is a cWebObject....
36672>>>>>>>        Get IsAjaxWebObject of hoObj to bIsAjaxWebObject
36673>>>>>>>        
36673>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsAjaxWebObject)) Begin
36675>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppNotWebObject, Name(hoObj), "WebSet " + pubProp.sName, C_NewLine+C_NewLine))
36676>>>>>>>>
36676>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
36677>>>>>>>        End
36677>>>>>>>>
36677>>>>>>>               
36677>>>>>>>        
36677>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName of hoObj to sObjName
36678>>>>>>>        Get psDynamicObjectId of hoObj to sDynamicObjectId
36679>>>>>>>        Move False to bAdvanced
36680>>>>>>>        
36680>>>>>>>        // Check if property is advanced
36680>>>>>>>        If (pubProp.eType = cArgArray or pubProp.eType = cArgStruct) Begin
36682>>>>>>>            Move True to bAdvanced
36683>>>>>>>        End
36683>>>>>>>>
36683>>>>>>>        
36683>>>>>>>        // If the object has not been rendered yet, it is not known to the client.
36683>>>>>>>        // Therefore, all properties set before an object is rendered will be added
36683>>>>>>>        // to a special queue, so they are initialized when the object is created.
36683>>>>>>>        Get IsRendered sDynamicObjectId to bIsRendered
36684>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsRendered) and (pubProp.eMode = wptClient or pubProp.eMode = wptClientProtected)) Begin
36686>>>>>>>            WebGet paSyncPropsQueue to aSyncPropsQueue
36687>>>>>>>            
36687>>>>>>>            Move sObjName to tQueuedProp.sO
36688>>>>>>>            Move pubProp.sName to tQueuedProp.sP
36689>>>>>>>            
36689>>>>>>>            If (bAdvanced) Begin
36691>>>>>>>                Move True to tQueuedProp.bA
36692>>>>>>>                ValueTreeSerializeParameter vPropValue to tQueuedProp.tVT  
36693>>>>>>>            End
36693>>>>>>>>
36693>>>>>>>            Else Begin
36694>>>>>>>                Move False to tQueuedProp.bA
36695>>>>>>>                Get ConvertToTransport of hoObj pubProp.hmGetter vPropValue pubProp.eType to tQueuedProp.sV
36696>>>>>>>            End
36696>>>>>>>>
36696>>>>>>>            
36696>>>>>>>            Move tQueuedProp to aSyncPropsQueue[SizeOfArray(aSyncPropsQueue)]
36697>>>>>>>            WebSet paSyncPropsQueue to aSyncPropsQueue
36698>>>>>>>            
36698>>>>>>>            If (pubProp.eMode = wptClient) ;                Procedure_Return
36701>>>>>>>        End
36701>>>>>>>>
36701>>>>>>>        
36701>>>>>>>        // This function accepts both advanced and regular properties.        
36701>>>>>>>        If (bAdvanced) Begin
36703>>>>>>>            ValueTreeSerializeParameter vPropValue to tAdvProp.tV
36704>>>>>>>            Move sObjName to tAdvProp.sO
36705>>>>>>>            Move pubProp.sName to tAdvProp.sP
36706>>>>>>>            
36706>>>>>>>            If (pubProp.eMode = wptClientProtected) Begin
36708>>>>>>>                Send SetAdvPropInWrapper wptClient (&tAdvProp)
36709>>>>>>>                Send SetAdvPropInWrapper wptServerPage (&tAdvProp)
36710>>>>>>>            End
36710>>>>>>>>
36710>>>>>>>            Else Begin
36711>>>>>>>                Send SetAdvPropInWrapper pubProp.eMode (&tAdvProp)
36712>>>>>>>            End
36712>>>>>>>>
36712>>>>>>>        End
36712>>>>>>>>
36712>>>>>>>        Else Begin
36713>>>>>>>            Move pubProp.sName to tProp.sN
36714>>>>>>>            Get ConvertToTransport of hoObj pubProp.hmGetter vPropValue pubProp.eType to  tProp.sV
36715>>>>>>>           
36715>>>>>>>            If (pubProp.eMode = wptClientProtected) Begin
36717>>>>>>>                If (bIsRendered) ;                    Send SetPropInWrapper wptClient sObjName (&tProp)
36720>>>>>>>                Send SetPropInWrapper wptServerPage sObjName (&tProp)
36721>>>>>>>            End
36721>>>>>>>>
36721>>>>>>>            Else Begin
36722>>>>>>>                Send SetPropInWrapper pubProp.eMode sObjName (&tProp)
36723>>>>>>>            End
36723>>>>>>>>
36723>>>>>>>           
36723>>>>>>>        End 
36723>>>>>>>>
36723>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36724>>>>>>>    
36724>>>>>>>    Procedure SetPropInWrapper Integer eMode String sObjectName tWebNameValue ByRef newProp
36726>>>>>>>        tWebSyncPropsWrapper wrapper
36726>>>>>>>        tWebSyncPropsWrapper wrapper
36726>>>>>>>        tWebSyncProps objProps
36726>>>>>>>        tWebSyncProps objProps
36726>>>>>>>        Integer iObjectIndex iPropIndex
36726>>>>>>>        
36726>>>>>>>        If (eMode = wptClient) Begin
36728>>>>>>>            WebGet ptSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36729>>>>>>>            Move (SortArray(wrapper.aSyncProps, False)) to wrapper.aSyncProps
36730>>>>>>>        End
36730>>>>>>>>
36730>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerPage) Begin
36733>>>>>>>            WebGet ptSyncServerPropsWrapper to wrapper
36734>>>>>>>        End
36734>>>>>>>>
36734>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerSession) Begin
36737>>>>>>>            WebGet ptSyncServerSessionPropsWrapper to wrapper 
36738>>>>>>>        End
36738>>>>>>>>
36738>>>>>>>        
36738>>>>>>>        
36738>>>>>>>        Move sObjectName to objProps.sO
36739>>>>>>>        
36739>>>>>>>        // First find the object containing all properties for a dynamic object            
36739>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(objProps, wrapper.aSyncProps, False)) to iObjectIndex
36740>>>>>>>        If (iObjectIndex <> -1) Begin
36742>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchArray(newProp, wrapper.aSyncProps[iObjectIndex].aP, False)) to iPropIndex
36743>>>>>>>            If (iPropIndex <> -1) Begin
36745>>>>>>>                // Update property value
36745>>>>>>>                Move newProp.sV to wrapper.aSyncProps[iObjectIndex].aP[iPropIndex].sV
36746>>>>>>>            End
36746>>>>>>>>
36746>>>>>>>            Else Begin
36747>>>>>>>                // Add new property
36747>>>>>>>                Move (BinarySearchInsertPos()) to iPropIndex
36748>>>>>>>                
36748>>>>>>>                Move (InsertInArray(wrapper.aSyncProps[iObjectIndex].aP, iPropIndex, newProp)) to wrapper.aSyncProps[iObjectIndex].aP
36749>>>>>>>            End
36749>>>>>>>>
36749>>>>>>>        End
36749>>>>>>>>
36749>>>>>>>        Else Begin
36750>>>>>>>            // Object has no synchronized properties yet, so add an entry for this object
36750>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchInsertPos()) to iObjectIndex
36751>>>>>>>            
36751>>>>>>>            Move newProp to objProps.aP[0]
36752>>>>>>>            
36752>>>>>>>            Move (InsertInArray(wrapper.aSyncProps, iObjectIndex, objProps)) to wrapper.aSyncProps
36753>>>>>>>        End
36753>>>>>>>>
36753>>>>>>>        
36753>>>>>>>        If (eMode = wptClient) Begin
36755>>>>>>>            WebSet ptSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36756>>>>>>>            Move (SortArray(wrapper.aSyncProps, False)) to wrapper.aSyncProps
36757>>>>>>>        End
36757>>>>>>>>
36757>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerPage) Begin
36760>>>>>>>            WebSet ptSyncServerPropsWrapper to wrapper
36761>>>>>>>        End
36761>>>>>>>>
36761>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerSession) Begin
36764>>>>>>>            WebSet ptSyncServerSessionPropsWrapper to wrapper 
36765>>>>>>>        End        
36765>>>>>>>>
36765>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36766>>>>>>>    
36766>>>>>>>    Procedure SetAdvPropInWrapper  Integer eMode tWebAdvSyncProp ByRef newProp
36768>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncPropsWrapper wrapper
36768>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncPropsWrapper wrapper
36768>>>>>>>        Integer iPropIndex
36768>>>>>>>        
36768>>>>>>>        If (eMode = wptClient) Begin
36770>>>>>>>            WebGet ptAdvSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36771>>>>>>>        End
36771>>>>>>>>
36771>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerPage) Begin
36774>>>>>>>            WebGet ptAdvServerSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36775>>>>>>>        End
36775>>>>>>>>
36775>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerSession) Begin
36778>>>>>>>            WebGet ptAdvServerSessionSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper 
36779>>>>>>>        End
36779>>>>>>>>
36779>>>>>>>
36779>>>>>>>        
36779>>>>>>>        
36779>>>>>>>        // First find the object containing all advanced properties for a dynamic object            
36779>>>>>>>        Move (SearchArray(newProp, wrapper.aAdvSyncProps, Self, RefFunc(CompareAdvProp))) to iPropIndex
36780>>>>>>>        Move newProp to wrapper.aAdvSyncProps[iPropIndex]
36781>>>>>>>        
36781>>>>>>>        If (eMode = wptClient) Begin
36783>>>>>>>            WebSet ptAdvSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36784>>>>>>>        End
36784>>>>>>>>
36784>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerPage) Begin
36787>>>>>>>            WebSet ptAdvServerSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36788>>>>>>>        End
36788>>>>>>>>
36788>>>>>>>        Else If (eMode = wptServerSession) Begin
36791>>>>>>>            WebSet ptAdvServerSessionSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper 
36792>>>>>>>        End
36792>>>>>>>>
36792>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36793>>>>>>>    
36793>>>>>>>    
36793>>>>>>>    
36793>>>>>>>    // Gets a synchronized property.
36793>>>>>>>    Function OwnerGetSyncProp Handle hoObj tWebPropMetaData ByRef pubProp Returns String
36795>>>>>>>        String sResult
36795>>>>>>>        Integer iObjectIndex iPropIndex 
36795>>>>>>>        String sObjName sDynamicObjectId
36795>>>>>>>        Boolean bExists bIsRendered bIsAjaxWebObject
36795>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue tProp tCompareProp
36795>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue tProp tCompareProp
36795>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree tVT
36795>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree tVT
36795>>>>>>>        tWebSyncProps tCompareSyncProps
36795>>>>>>>        tWebSyncProps tCompareSyncProps
36795>>>>>>>        tWebSyncProps[] aSyncProps
36795>>>>>>>        tWebSyncProps[] aSyncProps
36796>>>>>>>        tWebSyncPropsWrapper wrapper
36796>>>>>>>        tWebSyncPropsWrapper wrapper
36796>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp tQueuedProp
36796>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp tQueuedProp
36796>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp[] aSyncPropsQueue 
36796>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp[] aSyncPropsQueue 
36797>>>>>>>        
36797>>>>>>>        // Test that the target object is a cWebObject....
36797>>>>>>>        Get IsAjaxWebObject of hoObj to bIsAjaxWebObject
36798>>>>>>>        
36798>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsAjaxWebObject)) Begin
36800>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppNotWebObject, Name(hoObj), "WebSet " + pubProp.sName, C_NewLine+C_NewLine))
36801>>>>>>>>
36801>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
36802>>>>>>>        End
36802>>>>>>>>
36802>>>>>>>        
36802>>>>>>>        
36802>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName of hoObj to sObjName
36803>>>>>>>        Get psDynamicObjectId of hoObj to sDynamicObjectId
36804>>>>>>>        
36804>>>>>>>        
36804>>>>>>>        // If the object has not been rendered yet, it is not known to the client.
36804>>>>>>>        // Therefore, all properties set before an object is rendered are added
36804>>>>>>>        // to a special queue, so they are initialized when the object is created.
36804>>>>>>>        Get IsRendered sDynamicObjectId to bIsRendered
36805>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsRendered) and pubProp.eMode = wptClient) Begin
36807>>>>>>>            WebGet paSyncPropsQueue to aSyncPropsQueue
36808>>>>>>>            
36808>>>>>>>            Move sObjName to tQueuedProp.sO
36809>>>>>>>            Move pubProp.sName to tQueuedProp.sP
36810>>>>>>>            Move (SearchArray(tQueuedProp, aSyncPropsQueue, (Self), (RefFunc(CompareQueuedSyncProps)))) to iPropIndex
36811>>>>>>>            If (iPropIndex <> -1) Begin
36813>>>>>>>                Move aSyncPropsQueue[iPropIndex].sV to sResult
36814>>>>>>>                
36814>>>>>>>                Function_Return sResult
36815>>>>>>>            End
36815>>>>>>>>
36815>>>>>>>            
36815>>>>>>>            // This code is only reached if the property is not synchronized. Therefore, 
36815>>>>>>>            // return the default value of the property.
36815>>>>>>>            Get pubProp.hmGetter of hoObj to sResult
36816>>>>>>>            Function_Return sResult  
36817>>>>>>>        End
36817>>>>>>>>
36817>>>>>>>        
36817>>>>>>>        // This function accepts only scalar properties
36817>>>>>>>        If (pubProp.eMode = wptClient) Begin
36819>>>>>>>            WebGet ptSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36820>>>>>>>            Move (SortArray(wrapper.aSyncProps, False)) to wrapper.aSyncProps
36821>>>>>>>        End
36821>>>>>>>>
36821>>>>>>>        Else If (pubProp.eMode = wptServerPage or pubProp.eMode = wptClientProtected) Begin
36824>>>>>>>            WebGet ptSyncServerPropsWrapper to wrapper
36825>>>>>>>        End
36825>>>>>>>>
36825>>>>>>>        Else If (pubProp.eMode = wptServerSession) Begin
36828>>>>>>>            WebGet ptSyncServerSessionPropsWrapper to wrapper 
36829>>>>>>>        End
36829>>>>>>>>
36829>>>>>>>        
36829>>>>>>>        Move sObjName to tCompareSyncProps.sO
36830>>>>>>>        
36830>>>>>>>        // Check if object has any synchronized properties
36830>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tCompareSyncProps, wrapper.aSyncProps, False)) to iObjectIndex
36831>>>>>>>        If (iObjectIndex <> -1) Begin    
36833>>>>>>>            Move pubProp.sName to tCompareProp.sN
36834>>>>>>>                  
36834>>>>>>>            // Check if object has given synchronized property
36834>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchArray(tCompareProp, wrapper.aSyncProps[iObjectIndex].aP, False)) to iPropIndex
36835>>>>>>>            If (iPropIndex <> -1) Begin
36837>>>>>>>                Get ConvertFromTransport of hoObj pubProp.hmGetter wrapper.aSyncProps[iObjectIndex].aP[iPropIndex].sV pubProp.eType to sResult
36838>>>>>>>                Function_Return sResult
36839>>>>>>>            End
36839>>>>>>>>
36839>>>>>>>        End
36839>>>>>>>>
36839>>>>>>>        
36839>>>>>>>        // This code is only reached if the property is not synchronized. Therefore, 
36839>>>>>>>        // return the default value of the property.
36839>>>>>>>        Get pubProp.hmGetter of hoObj to sResult
36840>>>>>>>        Function_Return sResult             
36841>>>>>>>    End_Function
36842>>>>>>>   
36842>>>>>>>   
36842>>>>>>>    // Gets a synchronized property.
36842>>>>>>>    Function OwnerGetAdvSyncProp Handle hoObj tWebPropMetaData ByRef pubProp Returns Variant
36844>>>>>>>        Variant vResult
36844>>>>>>>        Integer iPropIndex iPubPropIndex iGetterIndex
36844>>>>>>>        String sObjName sDynamicObjectId
36844>>>>>>>        Boolean bExists bIsRendered bIsAjaxWebObject
36844>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncProp tCompareAdvProp 
36844>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncProp tCompareAdvProp 
36844>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncPropsWrapper wrapper
36844>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncPropsWrapper wrapper
36844>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp tQueuedProp
36844>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp tQueuedProp
36844>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp[] aSyncPropsQueue 
36844>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp[] aSyncPropsQueue 
36845>>>>>>>                
36845>>>>>>>        // Test that the target object is a cWebObject....
36845>>>>>>>        Get IsAjaxWebObject of hoObj to bIsAjaxWebObject
36846>>>>>>>        
36846>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsAjaxWebObject)) Begin
36848>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppNotWebObject, Name(hoObj), "WebSet " + pubProp.sName, C_NewLine+C_NewLine))
36849>>>>>>>>
36849>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
36850>>>>>>>        End
36850>>>>>>>>
36850>>>>>>>        
36850>>>>>>>        
36850>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName of hoObj to sObjName
36851>>>>>>>        Get psDynamicObjectId of hoObj to sDynamicObjectId
36852>>>>>>>            
36852>>>>>>>        // If the object has not been rendered yet, it is not known to the client.
36852>>>>>>>        // Therefore, all properties set before an object is rendered are added
36852>>>>>>>        // to a special queue, so they are initialized when the object is created.
36852>>>>>>>        Get IsRendered sDynamicObjectId to bIsRendered
36853>>>>>>>        If (not(bIsRendered) and pubProp.eMode = wptClient) Begin
36855>>>>>>>            WebGet paSyncPropsQueue to aSyncPropsQueue
36856>>>>>>>            
36856>>>>>>>            Move sObjName to tQueuedProp.sO
36857>>>>>>>            Move pubProp.sName to tQueuedProp.sP
36858>>>>>>>            Move (SearchArray(tQueuedProp, aSyncPropsQueue, (Self), (RefFunc(CompareQueuedSyncProps)))) to iPropIndex
36859>>>>>>>            If (iPropIndex <> -1) Begin
36861>>>>>>>                Get pubProp.hmGetter of hoObj to vResult
36862>>>>>>>                ValueTreeDeserializeParameter aSyncPropsQueue[iPropIndex].tVT to vResult
36863>>>>>>>            
36863>>>>>>>                Function_Return vResult
36864>>>>>>>            End
36864>>>>>>>>
36864>>>>>>>            
36864>>>>>>>            // This code is only reached if the property is not synchronized. Therefore, 
36864>>>>>>>            // return the default value of the property.
36864>>>>>>>            Get pubprop.hmGetter of hoObj to vResult
36865>>>>>>>            Function_Return vResult  
36866>>>>>>>        End
36866>>>>>>>>
36866>>>>>>>        
36866>>>>>>>        // This function accepts only non-scalar(advanced)
36866>>>>>>>        If (pubProp.eMode = wptClient) Begin
36868>>>>>>>            WebGet ptAdvSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36869>>>>>>>            Move (SortArray(wrapper.aAdvSyncProps, False)) to wrapper.aAdvSyncProps
36870>>>>>>>        End
36870>>>>>>>>
36870>>>>>>>        Else If (pubProp.eMode = wptServerPage or pubProp.eMode = wptClientProtected) Begin
36873>>>>>>>            WebGet ptAdvServerSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper
36874>>>>>>>        End
36874>>>>>>>>
36874>>>>>>>        Else If (pubProp.eMode = wptServerSession) Begin
36877>>>>>>>            WebGet ptAdvServerSessionSyncPropsWrapper to wrapper 
36878>>>>>>>        End
36878>>>>>>>>
36878>>>>>>>        
36878>>>>>>>        Move sObjName to tCompareAdvProp.sO
36879>>>>>>>        Move pubProp.sName to tCompareAdvProp.sP
36880>>>>>>>        
36880>>>>>>>        // Check if object has any advanced synchronized properties
36880>>>>>>>        Move (SearchArray(tCompareAdvProp, wrapper.aAdvSyncProps, Self, (RefFunc(CompareAdvProp)))) to iPropIndex
36881>>>>>>>        If (iPropIndex <> -1) Begin 
36883>>>>>>>            
36883>>>>>>>            Get pubProp.hmGetter of hoObj to vResult
36884>>>>>>>            ValueTreeDeserializeParameter wrapper.aAdvSyncProps[iPropIndex].tV to vResult
36885>>>>>>>        
36885>>>>>>>            Function_Return vResult
36886>>>>>>>        End
36886>>>>>>>>
36886>>>>>>>        
36886>>>>>>>        
36886>>>>>>>        // This code is only reached if the property is not synchronized. Therefore, 
36886>>>>>>>        // return the default value of the property.
36886>>>>>>>        Get pubProp.hmGetter of hoObj to vResult
36887>>>>>>>        Function_Return vResult             
36888>>>>>>>    End_Function
36889>>>>>>>    
36889>>>>>>>    // =====================================
36889>>>>>>>    // DYNAMIC PROPERTY HANDLING (2ND LEVEL)
36889>>>>>>>    // =====================================
36889>>>>>>>    
36889>>>>>>>    // Sets a dynamic property.
36889>>>>>>>    Procedure SetDynamicProp Handle hoObj tWebPropMetaData pubProp Variant vPropValue
36891>>>>>>>        Integer iObjectIndex iPropIndex iSize iIndex
36891>>>>>>>        String sDynamicObjectId sName
36891>>>>>>>        Boolean bAdvanced
36891>>>>>>>        Handle hmGetter
36891>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue   tCompareProp
36891>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue   tCompareProp
36891>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncProp tCompareAdvProp
36891>>>>>>>        tWebAdvSyncProp tCompareAdvProp
36891>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree tVT
36891>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree tVT
36891>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36891>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36891>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36891>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36892>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName to sName
36893>>>>>>>        WebGet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36894>>>>>>>        Get psDynamicObjectId of hoObj to sDynamicObjectId
36895>>>>>>>
36895>>>>>>>        
36895>>>>>>>        If (pubProp.eType = cArgArray or pubProp.eType = cArgStruct) Begin
36897>>>>>>>            Move True to bAdvanced
36898>>>>>>>        End
36898>>>>>>>>
36898>>>>>>>        
36898>>>>>>>        Move sDynamicObjectId to tDynamicObject.sId
36899>>>>>>>        
36899>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tDynamicObject, aDynamicObjects, False)) to iObjectIndex
36900>>>>>>>        If (iObjectIndex <> -1) Begin    
36902>>>>>>>            If (bAdvanced) Begin         
36904>>>>>>>                Move pubProp.sName to tCompareAdvProp.sP
36905>>>>>>>                ValueTreeSerializeParameter vPropValue to tVT
36906>>>>>>>                
36906>>>>>>>                // Then find the advanced property we are looking for
36906>>>>>>>                Move (BinarySearchArray(tCompareAdvProp, aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aAdvProps, Self, RefFunc(CompareAdvPropNames))) to iPropIndex
36907>>>>>>>                If (iPropIndex <> -1) Begin
36909>>>>>>>                    // Update property value
36909>>>>>>>                    Move tVT to aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aAdvProps[iPropIndex].tV
36910>>>>>>>                End
36910>>>>>>>>
36910>>>>>>>                Else Begin
36911>>>>>>>                    // Add new property     
36911>>>>>>>                    Move (BinarySearchInsertPos()) to iIndex
36912>>>>>>>                    
36912>>>>>>>                    Move pubProp.sName to tCompareAdvProp.sP
36913>>>>>>>                    Move tVT       to tCompareAdvProp.tV
36914>>>>>>>                    Move (InsertInArray(aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aAdvProps, iIndex, tCompareAdvProp)) to aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aAdvProps
36915>>>>>>>                End
36915>>>>>>>>
36915>>>>>>>                
36915>>>>>>>                WebSet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36916>>>>>>>            End
36916>>>>>>>>
36916>>>>>>>            Else Begin              
36917>>>>>>>                Move pubProp.sName to tCompareProp.sN
36918>>>>>>>                
36918>>>>>>>                // Find the property we are looking for
36918>>>>>>>                Move (BinarySearchArray(tCompareProp, aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aProps, False)) to iPropIndex
36919>>>>>>>                If (iPropIndex <> -1) Begin
36921>>>>>>>                    // Update prop value
36921>>>>>>>                    Move pubProp.sName to aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aProps[iPropIndex].sN
36922>>>>>>>                    Move (String(vPropValue)) to aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aProps[iPropIndex].sV
36923>>>>>>>                End
36923>>>>>>>>
36923>>>>>>>                Else Begin
36924>>>>>>>                    // Add new property                   
36924>>>>>>>                    Move (BinarySearchInsertPos()) to iIndex
36925>>>>>>>                    
36925>>>>>>>                    Move pubProp.sName to tCompareProp.sN
36926>>>>>>>                    Move (String(vPropValue)) to tCompareProp.sV
36927>>>>>>>                    Move (InsertInArray(aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aProps, iIndex, tCompareProp)) to aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aProps
36928>>>>>>>                End
36928>>>>>>>>
36928>>>>>>>                
36928>>>>>>>                WebSet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36929>>>>>>>            End
36929>>>>>>>>
36929>>>>>>>        End
36929>>>>>>>>
36929>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36930>>>>>>>    
36930>>>>>>>    
36930>>>>>>>    // Updates the given object with all set dynamic properties
36930>>>>>>>    Procedure ApplyDynamicProps String sDynamicObjectId Handle hoObj
36932>>>>>>>        String sPropName sPropValue sObject
36932>>>>>>>        Integer iObjectIndex icProps iProp iPubPropIndex
36932>>>>>>>        Variant vPropValue
36932>>>>>>>        Handle hmSetter hmGetter
36932>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36932>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36932>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36932>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36933>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
36934>>>>>>>        tWebPropMetaData pubProp
36934>>>>>>>        tWebPropMetaData pubProp
36934>>>>>>>        
36934>>>>>>>        WebGet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36935>>>>>>>        
36935>>>>>>>        Move sDynamicObjectId to tDynamicObject.sId
36936>>>>>>>        
36936>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tDynamicObject, aDynamicObjects, False)) to iObjectIndex
36937>>>>>>>        If (iObjectIndex <> -1) Begin           
36939>>>>>>>            // Apply regular props
36939>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aProps)) to icProps
36940>>>>>>>            For iProp from 0 to (icProps - 1) 
36946>>>>>>>>
36946>>>>>>>                Move aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aProps[iProp].sN to sPropName
36947>>>>>>>                Move aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aProps[iProp].sV to sPropValue
36948>>>>>>>                
36948>>>>>>>                Get FindWebPropertyMetaByName of hoObj sPropName to pubProp
36949>>>>>>>                Set pubProp.hmSetter of hoObj to sPropValue
36950>>>>>>>            Loop
36951>>>>>>>>
36951>>>>>>>            
36951>>>>>>>            // Apply advanced props
36951>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aAdvProps)) to icProps
36952>>>>>>>            For iProp from 0 to (icProps - 1)
36958>>>>>>>>
36958>>>>>>>                Move aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aAdvProps[iProp].sP to sPropName
36959>>>>>>>                Get FindWebPropertyMetaByName of hoObj sPropName to pubProp
36960>>>>>>>                
36960>>>>>>>                If (pubProp.hmGetter <= 0) Begin
36962>>>>>>>                    Get Object_Label of hoObj to sObject
36963>>>>>>>                    Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat(C_$WebAppPropertyNotPublished, "WebSet", sPropName, sObject, C_NewLine+C_NewLine))        
36964>>>>>>>>
36964>>>>>>>                    Function_Return
36965>>>>>>>                End
36965>>>>>>>>
36965>>>>>>>                
36965>>>>>>>                // This step is important, as otherwise the system won't know
36965>>>>>>>                // the actual type of the variant.
36965>>>>>>>                Get pubProp.hmGetter of hoObj to vPropValue
36966>>>>>>>                ValueTreeDeserializeParameter aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aAdvProps[iProp].tV to vPropValue
36967>>>>>>>                Set pubprop.hmSetter of hoObj to vPropValue
36968>>>>>>>            Loop
36969>>>>>>>>
36969>>>>>>>        End
36969>>>>>>>>
36969>>>>>>>    End_Procedure   
36970>>>>>>>    
36970>>>>>>>    
36970>>>>>>>    // =========================
36970>>>>>>>    // DYNAMIC OBJECTS RENDERING
36970>>>>>>>    // =========================
36970>>>>>>>   
36970>>>>>>>    // This function either loads all dynamic objects for the first time, 
36970>>>>>>>    // or it performs an incremental update by inserting a new object.
36970>>>>>>>    Procedure Activate
36972>>>>>>>        Boolean bActivated
36972>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
36972>>>>>>>        String[] aEmptyArray aChildren
36974>>>>>>>        Handle hoQueuedSyncPropsJson hoObjectsJson
36974>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp[] aSyncPropsQueue
36974>>>>>>>        tQueuedSyncProp[] aSyncPropsQueue
36975>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36975>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36975>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36975>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
36976>>>>>>>        
36976>>>>>>>        WebGet pbActivated to bActivated
36977>>>>>>>        
36977>>>>>>>        If (not(bActivated)) Begin
36979>>>>>>>            Send ConnectRadioButtons
36980>>>>>>>            
36980>>>>>>>            Get SerializeContainer to hoObjectsJson 
36981>>>>>>>            WebGet paSyncPropsQueue to aSyncPropsQueue
36982>>>>>>>            
36982>>>>>>>            // Send objects to client
36982>>>>>>>            Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hoQueuedSyncPropsJson
36983>>>>>>>            Send DataTypeToJson of hoQueuedSyncPropsJson aSyncPropsQueue 
36984>>>>>>>
36984>>>>>>>            Send ClientActionEx "loadQueuedSyncProps" aEmptyArray hoQueuedSyncPropsJson
36985>>>>>>>            Send ClientActionEx "loadDynamicObjects" aEmptyArray hoObjectsJson
36986>>>>>>>            
36986>>>>>>>            Send Destroy of hoQueuedSyncPropsJson
36987>>>>>>>            Send Destroy of hoObjectsJson
36988>>>>>>>              
36988>>>>>>>            // Finish rendering
36988>>>>>>>            WebGet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
36989>>>>>>>            Move "" to tDynamicObject.sId
36990>>>>>>>            
36990>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchArray(tDynamicObject, aDynamicObjects, False)) to iIndex
36991>>>>>>>            If (iIndex <> -1) Begin
36993>>>>>>>                Move aDynamicObjects[iIndex].aChildren to aChildren
36994>>>>>>>                Send FinishRendering aChildren
36995>>>>>>>            End
36995>>>>>>>>
36995>>>>>>>        End
36995>>>>>>>>
36995>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36996>>>>>>>    
36996>>>>>>>    
36996>>>>>>>    // Checks if the given object is currently rendered.
36996>>>>>>>    Function IsRendered String sDynamicObjectId Returns Boolean
36998>>>>>>>        Integer iObjectIndex
36998>>>>>>>        Boolean bReturn
36998>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36998>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
36998>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[]  aDynamicObjects
36998>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[]  aDynamicObjects
36999>>>>>>>        
36999>>>>>>>        WebGet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
37000>>>>>>>        
37000>>>>>>>        Move sDynamicObjectId to tDynamicObject.sId
37001>>>>>>>        
37001>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tDynamicObject, aDynamicObjects, False)) to iObjectIndex
37002>>>>>>>        If (iObjectIndex <> -1) Begin
37004>>>>>>>            Move aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].bRendered to bReturn
37005>>>>>>>        End
37005>>>>>>>>
37005>>>>>>>        
37005>>>>>>>        Function_Return bReturn
37006>>>>>>>    End_Function
37007>>>>>>>    
37007>>>>>>>    
37007>>>>>>>    // Marks the given dynamic object as rendered client-side.
37007>>>>>>>    Procedure SetRendered String sDynamicObjectId Boolean bRendered tWebDynamicObject[] ByRef aDynamicObjects Boolean bChildren 
37009>>>>>>>        Integer iObjectIndex iChild icChildren
37009>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
37009>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
37009>>>>>>>        
37009>>>>>>>        Move sDynamicObjectId to tDynamicObject.sId
37010>>>>>>>        
37010>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tDynamicObject, aDynamicObjects, False)) to iObjectIndex
37011>>>>>>>        If (iObjectIndex <> -1) Begin
37013>>>>>>>            Move bRendered to aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].bRendered
37014>>>>>>>        End
37014>>>>>>>>
37014>>>>>>>        
37014>>>>>>>        If (bChildren) Begin
37016>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aChildren)) to icChildren
37017>>>>>>>            For iChild from 0 to (icChildren - 1)
37023>>>>>>>>
37023>>>>>>>                Send SetRendered aDynamicObjects[iObjectIndex].aChildren[iChild] bRendered (&aDynamicObjects) bChildren
37024>>>>>>>            Loop
37025>>>>>>>>
37025>>>>>>>        End
37025>>>>>>>>
37025>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
37026>>>>>>>    
37026>>>>>>>    
37026>>>>>>>    // Serializes the container to a tWebValueTree.
37026>>>>>>>    Function SerializeContainer Returns Handle
37028>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex icObjects iObject icBuffers iBuffer iSize
37028>>>>>>>        String sDynamicObjectId
37028>>>>>>>        Handle hoObj
37028>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
37028>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject tDynamicObject
37028>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
37028>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects
37029>>>>>>>        String[] aObjectList
37030>>>>>>>        
37030>>>>>>>        Handle[] aClasses
37031>>>>>>>        Handle hjWrapper hjClasses hjObjects hjObjectDef
37031>>>>>>>        
37031>>>>>>>        
37031>>>>>>>        Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hjWrapper
37032>>>>>>>        Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hjClasses
37033>>>>>>>        Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hjObjects
37034>>>>>>>        Send InitializeJsonType of hjWrapper jsonTypeObject
37035>>>>>>>        Send InitializeJsonType of hjClasses jsonTypeArray
37036>>>>>>>        Send InitializeJsonType of hjObjects jsonTypeArray
37037>>>>>>>        
37037>>>>>>>        WebGet paDynamicObjects to aDynamicObjects
37038>>>>>>>        
37038>>>>>>>        Move "" to tDynamicObject.sId
37039>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(tDynamicObject, aDynamicObjects, False)) to iIndex
37040>>>>>>>        If (iIndex <> -1) Begin
37042>>>>>>>            Move aDynamicObjects[iIndex].aChildren to aObjectList
37043>>>>>>>            
37043>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aObjectList)) to icObjects
37044>>>>>>>            For iObject from 0 to (icObjects - 1)
37050>>>>>>>>
37050>>>>>>>                Get DynamicObject aObjectList[iObject] to hoObj
37051>>>>>>>                Get DoSerializeObject of hoObj hjClasses (&aClasses) to hjObjectDef 
37052>>>>>>>                Send AddMember of hjObjects hjObjectDef
37053>>>>>>>                Send Destroy of hjObjectDef
37054>>>>>>>            Loop
37055>>>>>>>>
37055>>>>>>>        End
37055>>>>>>>>
37055>>>>>>>        
37055>>>>>>>        Send SetMember of hjWrapper "aClasses" hjClasses
37056>>>>>>>        Send SetMember of hjWrapper "aObjects" hjObjects
37057>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hjClasses
37058>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hjObjects
37059>>>>>>>        
37059>>>>>>>        Function_Return hjWrapper
37060>>>>>>>    End_Function
37061>>>>>>>    
37061>>>>>>>    
37061>>>>>>>    // Serializes the given dynamic object.
37061>>>>>>>    Function SerializeDynamicObject Handle hoObj tWebDynamicObject[] aDynamicObjects Returns Handle
37063>>>>>>>        Handle hjObjectDef
37063>>>>>>>        
37063>>>>>>>        Get SerializeObject of hoObj to hjObjectDef
37064>>>>>>>
37064>>>>>>>        Function_Return hjObjectDef
37065>>>>>>>    End_Function
37066>>>>>>>    
37066>>>>>>>    
37066>>>>>>>    // =============
37066>>>>>>>    // RADIO BUTTONS
37066>>>>>>>    // =============
37066>>>>>>>    
37066>>>>>>>    // Radio buttons require some additional logic to work properly.
37066>>>>>>>    
37066>>>>>>>    Procedure AddRadio Handle hoRadio
37068>>>>>>>        // We just want to interrupt the delegation of this procedure here. The actual
37068>>>>>>>        // registration of the radio object happens in cWebDynamicObjectContainer:CreateLocal(1).
37068>>>>>>>        Procedure_Return
37069>>>>>>>    End_Procedure  
37070>>>>>>>    
37070>>>>>>>    
37070>>>>>>>    // Registers the passed cWebRadio object. The object's group is determined and the radio
37070>>>>>>>    // is registered with the rest of the objects in that group. If this is the first radio
37070>>>>>>>    // object in the group then it will become the "master" radio object for that group.
37070>>>>>>>    Procedure RegisterRadio Handle hoRadio
37072>>>>>>>        String sGroupName sName
37072>>>>>>>        Integer iGroup icGroup icRadio iSize iIndex
37072>>>>>>>        String[] aRadioGroupNames
37073>>>>>>>        String[] aRegisteredRadios
37074>>>>>>>        String[] aConnectQueue
37075>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
37075>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
37076>>>>>>>        
37076>>>>>>>        Get psDynamicObjectId of hoRadio to sName
37077>>>>>>>        
37077>>>>>>>        Get psGroupName of hoRadio to sGroupName
37078>>>>>>>        WebGet paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
37079>>>>>>>        WebGet paRadioGroupNames to aRadioGroupNames
37080>>>>>>>        
37080>>>>>>>        // Is this a new group?....
37080>>>>>>>        Move (SearchArray(sGroupName, aRadioGroupNames, Desktop, RefFunc(DFSTRICMP))) to iGroup   // case insensitive search
37081>>>>>>>        
37081>>>>>>>        If (iGroup = -1) Begin
37083>>>>>>>            // Create a new group and make this radio button the master....
37083>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aRadioGroups)) to icGroup
37084>>>>>>>
37084>>>>>>>            Move sName      to aRadioGroups[icGroup].sMaster
37085>>>>>>>            Move sName      to aRadioGroups[icGroup].aRadioButtons[0]
37086>>>>>>>            Move sGroupName to aRadioGroups[icGroup].sGroupName
37087>>>>>>>            Move sGroupName to aRadioGroupNames[icGroup]
37088>>>>>>>            
37088>>>>>>>            // Save the changes....
37088>>>>>>>            WebSet paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
37089>>>>>>>            WebSet paRadioGroupNames to aRadioGroupNames
37090>>>>>>>        End
37090>>>>>>>>
37090>>>>>>>        Else Begin
37091>>>>>>>            Move (SearchArray(sName, aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons, Desktop, RefFunc(DFSTRICMP))) to iIndex
37092>>>>>>>            
37092>>>>>>>            If (iIndex <> -1) ;                Procedure_Return
37095>>>>>>>            
37095>>>>>>>            // Add this radio to the existing group....
37095>>>>>>>            Move sName to aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons[-1]
37096>>>>>>>            
37096>>>>>>>            // Save the changes....
37096>>>>>>>            WebSet paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
37097>>>>>>>            
37097>>>>>>>            // Save current group name
37097>>>>>>>            Move aRadioGroupNames[iGroup] to sGroupName
37098>>>>>>>        End 
37098>>>>>>>>
37098>>>>>>>        
37098>>>>>>>        // Add the group name to the list of groups that are to be connected
37098>>>>>>>        WebGet paRadioConnectQueue to aConnectQueue
37099>>>>>>>        Move (SearchArray(sGroupName, aConnectQueue)) to iIndex
37100>>>>>>>        If (iIndex = -1) Begin
37102>>>>>>>            Move sGroupName to aConnectQueue[-1]
37103>>>>>>>            WebSet paRadioConnectQueue to aConnectQueue
37104>>>>>>>        End
37104>>>>>>>>
37104>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
37105>>>>>>>    
37105>>>>>>>    
37105>>>>>>>    Procedure ConnectRadioButtons
37107>>>>>>>        // Radio button Helper:
37107>>>>>>>        //
37107>>>>>>>        // Iterate all of the registered radio groups and connect the cWebRadio objects to their master
37107>>>>>>>        // radio buttons.
37107>>>>>>>        String sValue sTemp sMaster sRadio sMasterFullName
37107>>>>>>>        String[] aConnectQueue aRadioGroupNames
37109>>>>>>>        Handle hoRadio hoMaster
37109>>>>>>>        Integer iGroup icGroup iQueuedGroup
37109>>>>>>>        Integer iRadio icRadio
37109>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
37109>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
37110>>>>>>>        
37110>>>>>>>        WebGet paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
37111>>>>>>>        WebGet paRadioConnectQueue to aConnectQueue
37112>>>>>>>        WebGet paRadioGroupNames to aRadioGroupNames
37113>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aConnectQueue)) to icGroup
37114>>>>>>>        
37114>>>>>>>        For iQueuedGroup from 0 to (icGroup - 1)
37120>>>>>>>>
37120>>>>>>>            Move (SearchArray(aConnectQueue[iQueuedGroup], aRadioGroupNames)) to iGroup
37121>>>>>>>            If (iGroup <> -1) Begin
37123>>>>>>>                Move (SizeOfArray(aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons)) to icRadio
37124>>>>>>>                Move "" to sValue
37125>>>>>>>                Move aRadioGroups[iGroup].sMaster to sMaster 
37126>>>>>>>                Get DynamicObject aRadioGroups[iGroup].sMaster to hoMaster
37127>>>>>>>                
37127>>>>>>>                For iRadio from 0 to (icRadio - 1)
37133>>>>>>>>
37133>>>>>>>                    // Set the master radio....
37133>>>>>>>                    Move aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons[iRadio] to sRadio
37134>>>>>>>                    Get DynamicObject sRadio to hoRadio
37135>>>>>>>                    
37135>>>>>>>                    WebSet psMasterRadio of hoRadio to aRadioGroups[iGroup].sMaster
37136>>>>>>>                    If (sRadio <> aRadioGroups[iGroup].sMaster) Begin
37138>>>>>>>                        Get WebObjectName of hoMaster to sMasterFullName
37139>>>>>>>                        WebSet psMasterName of hoRadio to sMasterFullName
37140>>>>>>>                    End
37140>>>>>>>>
37140>>>>>>>                    
37140>>>>>>>                    // Get the last non-null psValue setting....
37140>>>>>>>                    WebGet psValue of hoRadio to sTemp
37141>>>>>>>                    If (sTemp <> "") Begin
37143>>>>>>>                        Move sTemp to sValue
37144>>>>>>>                    End
37144>>>>>>>>
37144>>>>>>>                Loop
37145>>>>>>>>
37145>>>>>>>                
37145>>>>>>>                // If there is no psValue setting then set it to the psRadioValue value of the master radio....
37145>>>>>>>                If (sValue = "") Begin
37147>>>>>>>                    Get DynamicObject aRadioGroups[iGroup].sMaster to hoMaster
37148>>>>>>>                    WebGet psRadioValue of hoMaster to sValue
37149>>>>>>>                End
37149>>>>>>>>
37149>>>>>>>                
37149>>>>>>>                // Synchronize all radios in this group to the same psValue...
37149>>>>>>>                If (sValue <> "") Begin
37151>>>>>>>                    For iRadio from 0 to (icRadio-1)
37157>>>>>>>>
37157>>>>>>>                        Move aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons[iRadio] to sRadio
37158>>>>>>>                        Get DynamicObject sRadio to hoRadio
37159>>>>>>>                        
37159>>>>>>>                        WebSet psValue of hoRadio to sValue
37160>>>>>>>                    Loop
37161>>>>>>>>
37161>>>>>>>                End
37161>>>>>>>>
37161>>>>>>>            End
37161>>>>>>>>
37161>>>>>>>        Loop
37162>>>>>>>>
37162>>>>>>>        
37162>>>>>>>        WebSet paRadioConnectQueue to (ResizeArray(aConnectQueue, 0))
37163>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
37164>>>>>>>    
37164>>>>>>>    
37164>>>>>>>    // Finds and returns the radiogroup to which the given radio belongs.
37164>>>>>>>    Function FindRadioGroup String sDynamicObjectId Boolean ByRef bFound Returns tWebDynamicRadioGroup
37166>>>>>>>        Integer icGroups iGroup iRadioIndex
37166>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
37166>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
37166>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
37166>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
37167>>>>>>>        
37167>>>>>>>        WebGet paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
37168>>>>>>>        
37168>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aRadioGroups)) to icGroups
37169>>>>>>>        For iGroup from 0 to (icGroups - 1)
37175>>>>>>>>
37175>>>>>>>            Move (SearchArray(sDynamicObjectId, aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons)) to iRadioIndex
37176>>>>>>>            If (iRadioIndex <> -1) Begin
37178>>>>>>>                Move True to bFound
37179>>>>>>>                Move aRadioGroups[iGroup] to tRadioGroup
37180>>>>>>>            End
37180>>>>>>>>
37180>>>>>>>            
37180>>>>>>>            If (bFound) ;                Break
37183>>>>>>>        Loop
37184>>>>>>>>
37184>>>>>>>        
37184>>>>>>>        Function_Return tRadioGroup
37185>>>>>>>    End_Function
