37191>>>>>>>    // Called by cWebObject_mixin
37191>>>>>>>    
37191>>>>>>>    // This allows the owner to customize the web object name. In case of the dynamic object container we insert the "$" instead of a ".".
37191>>>>>>>    Procedure OwnerMangleWebObjectName Handle hoWebObject String ByRef sObjectName
37193>>>>>>>        String sOwnerName sContainer
37193>>>>>>>        
37193>>>>>>>        Get Name to sOwnerName
37194>>>>>>>        
37194>>>>>>>        Move (Remove(sObjectName, 1, Length(sOwnerName))) to sObjectName
37195>>>>>>>        If (Left(sObjectName, 1) = ".") ;            Move (Remove(sObjectName, 1, 1)) to sObjectName
37198>>>>>>>        
37198>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName to sContainer
37199>>>>>>>        Move (sContainer + "$" + sObjectName) to sObjectName
37200>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
