37950>>>>>>>    Procedure ReceiveEventData String sEventName String sId
37952>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
37952>>>>>>>        tWebDrawingEventData eventData
37952>>>>>>>        tWebDrawingEventData eventData
37952>>>>>>>
37952>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
37953>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to eventData
37954>>>>>>>        
37954>>>>>>>        Case Begin
37954>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseClick")
37956>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseClick sId eventData
37957>>>>>>>                Case Break
37958>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDoubleClick")
37961>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDoubleClick sId eventData
37962>>>>>>>                Case Break
37963>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseUp")
37966>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseUp sId eventData
37967>>>>>>>                Case Break
37968>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDown")
37971>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDown sId eventData
37972>>>>>>>                Case Break
37973>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDrag")
37976>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDrag sId eventData
37977>>>>>>>                Case Break
37978>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseEnter")
37981>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseEnter sId eventData
37982>>>>>>>                Case Break
37983>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseLeave")
37986>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseMove sId eventData
37987>>>>>>>                Case Break
37988>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseMove")
37991>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseMove sId eventData
37992>>>>>>>                Case Break
37993>>>>>>>        Case End
37993>>>>>>>        
37993>>>>>>>        Send UpdateDrawing
37994>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
