38136>>>>>    
38136>>>>>    // Encrypts a string into an unreadable hash that can later be decrypted using DecryptKey.
38136>>>>>    //
38136>>>>>    // Params:
38136>>>>>    //   sPlainText     String to encrypt.
38136>>>>>    // Returns:
38136>>>>>    //   Base64 encoded hash.
