38927>>>>>    
38927>>>>>    
38927>>>>>    //
38927>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
38927>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
38927>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
38927>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
38927>>>>>    //
38927>>>>>    // Params:
38927>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
38927>>>>>    //
38927>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
38929>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
38929>>>>>        
38929>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
38930>>>>>        
38930>>>>>        //  Update user properties
38930>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
38932>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
38933>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
38934>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
38935>>>>>            
38935>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
38936>>>>>        End
38936>>>>>>
38936>>>>>        Else Begin
